fault directly\ninstead of re-casting a string on every chat request (hot path).\n\n(4) gui/app.page2.js — declare the health-probe bus poller''s interval handle\nwith `let wireIv;` before assigning, clearing a use-before-define linter flag.\n\nPreflight 8/0 (incl. cargo check); smoke 746/0.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f977728821790ad4449a2e1d464c7b60bf3d61c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/git/trees/f977728821790ad4449a2e1d464c7b60bf3d61c3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/git/commits/a52d32bf2edca2c8dabd8fd513df639b9788e6be","verification":{"payload":"tree f977728821790ad4449a2e1d464c7b60bf3d61c3\nparent a767408a777eeb8ae06f7d1b58d92f1c31928169\nauthor NathanNeurotic (Ripto) <noahtkevans@gmail.com> 1782162650 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782162650 -0700\n\nfix: Gemini review follow-ups on the audit batches — 4 small fixes (v10.38.220) (#262)\n\n(1) gui/tts.js — don''t overwrite a \"server not responding\" error that\nloadVoices() set with a \"ready\" line when the post-activation refresh fails;\nguard the success line on dataset.state !== ''error''.\n\n(2) src-tauri/src/lib.rs — make the SearXNG \"is `- json` already enabled?\"\npre-check whitespace-tolerant (same strip_prefix(''-'')/trim as the `- html`\nanchor), so a `-json`/`-  json` variant can''t slip past and get a DUPLICATE\n`- json` inserted.\n\n(3) local_ai_server.py — _chat_env returns its (now typed) default directly\ninstead of re-casting a string on every chat request (hot path).\n\n(4) gui/app.page2.js — declare the health-probe bus poller''s interval handle\nwith `let wireIv;` before assigning, clearing a use-before-define linter flag.\n\nPreflight 8/0 (incl. cargo check); smoke 746/0.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqOaTaCRC1aQ7