ently when it can''t find a\n  `- html` anchor to insert `- json` after: logs a diagnostic, and matches the\n  `- html` line whitespace-tolerantly (mirrors the Python regex) so a `-  html`\n  variant still anchors.\n- Removed a dead `tray:nav` emit (no GUI code ever listened — the direct w.eval\n  IS the navigation) + corrected two stale comments that claimed a listener.\n\nDataDash (gui/activity/datadash.game.js):\n- A REVERSE mystery (negative game.scroll) no longer rewinds the random-event\n  clock and stalls the event — clamped to forward progress.\n- The high-score name field no longer mutates + persists an entry that didn''t\n  make the board (sub-top-N runs push then slice the entry off).\n- Removed a never-read bgScroll accumulator.\n\nDeps:\n- Dropped the unused form-data dependency (imported nowhere) via npm uninstall —\n  trims it + its orphaned sub-deps from package-lock.json; also removed from\n  REQUIREMENTS.md to keep the doc-drift guard in sync.\n\nRust + DataDash apply on the next installer rebuild. Preflight 8/0 (incl. cargo\ncheck); smoke 746/0.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7d50264e03f9f4d9b24faf797907c76624627d7b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/git/trees/7d50264e03f9f4d9b24faf797907c76624627d7b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/git/commits/a767408a777eeb8ae06f7d1b58d92f1c31928169","verification":{"payload":"tree 7d50264e03f9f4d9b24faf797907c76624627d7b\nparent 8a310f6bd0a586fa5eb61a4dfa8047ac54cab483\nauthor NathanNeurotic (Ripto) <noahtkevans@gmail.com> 1782161703 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782161703 -0700\n\nfix: full-codebase audit batch 4 — desktop-shell + DataDash + deps, 8 fixes (v10.38.219) (#261)\n\nDesktop-shell/Rust (src-tauri/src/lib.rs):\n- ensure_searxng_json_format no longer fails silently when it can''t find a\n  `- html` anchor to insert `- json` after: logs a diagnostic, and matches the\n  `- html` line whitespace-tolerantly (mirrors the Python regex) so a `-  html`\n  variant still anchors.\n- Removed a dead `tray:nav` emit (no GUI code ever listened — the direct w.eval\n  IS the navigation) + corrected two stale comments that claimed a listener.\n\nDataDash (gui/activity/datadash.game.js):\n- A REVERSE mystery (negative game.scroll) no longer rewinds the random-event\n  clock and stalls the event — clamped to forward progress.\n- The high-score name field no longer mutates + persists an entry that didn''t\n  make the board (sub-top-N runs push then slice the entry off).\n- Removed a never-read bgScroll accumulator.\n\nDeps:\n- Dropped the unused form-data dependency (imported nowhere) via npm uninstall —\n  trims it + its orphaned sub-deps from package-lock.json; also removed from\n  REQUIREMENTS.md to keep the doc-drift guard in sync.\n\nRust + DataDash apply on the next installer rebuild. Preflight 8/0 (incl. cargo\ncheck); smoke 746/0.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqOaEnCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAhacQAKzT4Zbt1vsC/u24aAQL1F98\nDQ13ENT0/sZGwuKCpbnpkMveMVMd1o6I7tVExdjHrVVr1finwxS6i8UZYCSgJSnm\n/Ni1GjyuoMHWWuqjWqm7cvNW3fgE37xfSJt9Sw8p153ZVdnJ8aaCt0w14o0wg9lG\njlgXnq50igsp0vMSCGELd0ucWqt1T8ZRhIA/HDfd24uaoPLYdgo0ySxm1+YW8DeU\nPuQ+xc13GEw9WaVovkAl4wf18/VR6q4+6AySBTkhSIkpdQ4bhnOr2hyqa9lytZGa\nDoVMwYqnZNeWbRqvnxJRguKgWqITof51pI79b3bGycOGp5Er3UuB9rRXXcudmnrz\n39Ekz9HrnsOtyQFHvVkQ7sTQ03rWUgXgyByFPen5VtWU/DBemj/utJS/+zi6r6Zx\nX1FClRL7+QTQxOdrEW5Q8C6QmTfmkNn4936udr/8prNSaEsaAFBGjJVLmP0lU4pE\nkrK4rbDT5Rx52gkjA6T3CoD+qfqAb0+qSkz88Anl2YLZEODOv9S/QB0koXWZFNtq\nZiTXlRgqOOW6iDeVLbLFtFICngV2jaeL+4EtuY1PbDtAYyO6Lpd+ijZ4T0Q6XMQr\nB/4kUCmHfHExRK9PbqDyLD1sSwbufZMNU6womoeM8iYf9KmBMXYlIpwneoDtuxYH\nILrqLnxOoZoRRCh7xEjB\n=IKqZ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-22T20:55:04Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://ava