ithub.com/NathanNeurotic","id":109461996,"login":"NathanNeurotic","node_id":"U_kgDOBoZB7A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commits/8a310f6bd0a586fa5eb61a4dfa8047ac54cab483/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-22T20:37:23Z","email":"noahtkevans@gmail.com","name":"NathanNeurotic (Ripto)"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-22T20:37:23Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(gui): full-codebase audit batch 3 — GUI, 10 fixes (v10.38.218) (#260)\n\nFrom the multi-agent audit (each finding adversarially verified).\n\n- api.page.js: revoke the prior image-response blob: URL before overwriting the\n  pane — every image-endpoint SEND leaked an object URL.\n- image-ab.page.js: \"Use as src\" snapshots a blob: URL to a self-contained data:\n  URL (the panel''s object URL gets revoked when it re-runs, invalidating it).\n- installer.page1.js: doctor button no longer stuck at \"RUNNING\" forever if the\n  WS bus never connects — 30s safety re-enable, cleared by the real event.\n- tts.js: surface the \"voice active but not saved to .env\" warning AFTER\n  loadVoices() (it was instantly overwritten).\n- setup-wizard.page.js: render only the failing steps (was also rendering the\n  passed ones, contradicting its own comment).\n- model-install.js: Models-missing banner adds html:true (its <code>/<a> markup\n  was shown as escaped literal text) + escapes the dynamic model id/backend.\n- config-render.js: ensure a select field''s default is among its options so\n  reset() isn''t a silent no-op.\n- launcher.js: removed a duplicate service.state.changed subscription that\n  defeated the 200ms burst-coalescing.\n- roadmap.html: \"Persistent memory\" card was class=\"live\" (no such filter) so it\n  never showed under the Shipped chip — now class=\"shipped\".\n- installer.page2.js: clear the 4s bootstrap-status probe interval once the step\n  is complete instead of polling forever.\n\nDeferred to a follow-up (need runtime verification): app.page2 ''both'' A/B mode,\n''Stop all'' toggle, the logs-pane double-wire (page2 vs page5), and the updater\nskip-link banner restructure.\n\nSmoke 746/0; preflight 8/0.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f3daabc2437da013693395b59c0b95aa890a2533","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/git/trees/f3daabc2437da013693395b59c0b95aa890a2533"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/git/commits/8a310f6bd0a586fa5eb61a4dfa8047ac54cab483","verification":{"payload":"tree f3daabc2437da013693395b59c0b95aa890a2533\nparent c46177b287451667bbed8eea18910551cbf31455\nauthor NathanNeurotic (Ripto) <noahtkevans@gmail.com> 1782160643 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782160643 -0700\n\nfix(gui): full-codebase audit batch 3 — GUI, 10 fixes (v10.38.218) (#260)\n\nFrom the multi-agent audit (each finding adversarially verified).\n\n- api.page.js: revoke the prior image-response blob: URL before overwriting the\n  pane — every image-endpoint SEND leaked an object URL.\n- image-ab.page.js: \"Use as src\" snapshots a blob: URL to a self-contained data:\n  URL (the panel''s object URL gets revoked when it re-runs, invalidating it).\n- installer.page1.js: doctor button no longer stuck at \"RUNNING\" forever if the\n  WS bus never connects — 30s safety re-enable, cleared by the real event.\n- tts.js: surface the \"voice active but not saved to .env\" warning AFTER\n  loadVoices() (it was instantly overwritten).\n- setup-wizard.page.js: render only the failing steps (was also rendering the\n  passed ones, contradicting its own comment).\n- model-install.js: Models-missing banner adds html:true (its <code>/<a> markup\n  was shown as escaped literal text) + escapes the dynamic model id/backend.\n- config-render.js: ensure a select field''s default is among its options so\n  reset() isn''t a silent no-op.\n- launcher.js: removed a duplicate service.state.changed subscription that\n  defeated the 200ms burst-coalescing.\n- roadmap.html: \"Persistent memory\" card was class=\"live\" (no such filter) so it\n  never showed under the Shipped chip — now class=\"shipped\".\n- installer.page2.js: clear the 4s bootstrap-status probe interval once the step\n  is complete instead of polling forever.\n\nDeferred to a follow-up (need runtime verification): app.page2 ''both'' A/B mode,\n''Stop all'' toggle, the logs-pane double-wire (page2 vs page5), and the updater\nskip-link banner restructure.\n\nSmoke 746/0; preflight 8/0.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqOZ0DCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA9JEQAG7o9uS9A0472ZpDvqV+DI05\nBl91ZLF+1mLhYUjNGPz9gyVaE+TXzJPxyIbwJYczp6eNuHMJb2acatpjWLYeWgzU\nwGxydqtKpz2Hq9vO4dslaT8nQz+2ji0U412iPZ03cRPeQM9y4agJ2SoFWbLRIb6S\nM6h3ZPXW41JtWYBV3O1GpNE/Fw8ZY6j+uZGMyiIwO4R+8FEdkNLBIzf5AXpojqrK\nt4M+mhC65m+AdwJ+nfrX9FdvSOsNvcmN5pgngp0z/0AoG5d8tDRSHTknMLqAJalN\nPwvSx4/26v6/B73rjl7se5RzDjW9wy06rF2Ys09JdlogzjGCJwHgaemxmX6b8+8Q\ngJTu0j6EfxBGCfNtDyTUmOah4VLuPj8FccFIRLq/X8YK8E0PHse0eyv61jI3Wmd2\n1qcMEp+fTOLBOs1sbWq7vQQHQZcoh2eyUcHbO1JBFGOcUjLkTLMoTSgq5WRoQEuT\n5ZbZKzAdAzOIIC05u6e+VTdw7mo9+awAyhAOuqUv32w9J3J5ijunE2lVSZJIjcNN\noZRbbZxwxNf9sTylbg3imw73hUiNtkQ0nnW6QzbsQ29Uhn35Oi/ppcGTxOh1hZ/X\nvnGs91f5duSO+8ETNsRJENlQwV1JPAv3vSvW59vuL562JoRFDczb0XKVYOOJVvpM\nA/GJMSr66eefqBAk24yF\n=XwVP\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-22T20:37:23Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commit/8a310f6bd0a586fa5eb61a4dfa8047ac54cab483","node_id":"C_kwDOSly7ZdoAKDhhMzEwZjZiZDBhNTg2ZmE1ZWI2MWE0ZGZhODA0N2FjNTRjYWI0ODM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commit/c46177b287451667bbed8eea18910551cbf31455","sha":"c46177b287451667bbed8eea18910551cbf31455","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commits/c46177b287451667bbed8eea18910551cbf31455"}],"sha":"8a310f6bd0a586fa5eb61a4dfa8047ac54cab483","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commits/8a310f6bd0a586fa5eb61a4dfa8047ac54cab483"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109461996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NathanNeurotic","id":109461996,"login":"NathanNeurotic","node_id":"U_kgDOBoZB7A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commits/c46177b287451667bbed8eea18910551cbf31455/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-22T20:20:35Z","email":"noahtkevans@gmail.com","name":"NathanNeurotic (Ripto)"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-22T20:20:35Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(server): full-codebase audit batch 2 — Python server, 8 fixes (v10.38.217) (#259)\n\nlocal_ai_server.py:\n- Removed a duplicate @app.exception_handler(Exception) registered later in the\n  file that silently overrode the structured handler (Starlette keys by class) —\n  it leaked str(exc)+type name to clients and dropped the CUDA-OOM->503 retryable\n  classification. The structured handler is the sole owner again (+ full\n  traceback now logged to the server console).\n- Cold-start \"default_chat\" redirect resolves model_id via resolve_chat_role\n  (live config) instead of the import-frozen CHAT_MODEL_ID, so /config/reload is\n  honored.\n- The 3 chat sampling knobs (CHAT_TOP_K / CHAT_REPETITION_PENALTY /\n  CHAT_NO_REPEAT_NGRAM_SIZE) are parsed defensively — a non-numeric value no\n  longer throws ValueError on every local /chat request.\n- Dropped a dead Z-Image negative_prompt re-read (already merged above).\n\ngui_endpoints.py:\n- Fresh-boot ritual (_clean_stale_stack/_autostart_stack) now runs via\n  asyncio.to_thread instead of blocking the event loop during startup.\n- _compute_system_state reuses the gpu block embedded in the health payload\n  instead of calling the gpu provider too — both run gpu_stats() (nvidia-smi, no\n  cache), so it probed the GPU twice per 1s tick; also fixes a silent\n  device_name=None (the gpu provider renamed the key to \"device\").\n- The config-store file lock''s inner getmtime-OSError branch now honors the\n  timeout + backoff instead of busy-spinning.\n\nwarmup_local_cache.py:\n- Dropped the deprecated resume_download=True arg (newer huggingface_hub warns\n  on every model; downloads resume automatically).\n\nDeclined: slowing the 1Hz system-state write when idle — intentional + documented\n(tray/bot read it with no GUI open) and already offloaded to a worker thread.\n\npy_compile clean; gui-smoke 279/0; preflight 8/0.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"785c35d0e8d13c3e9ecf1d2c96bb78577d3a444c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/git/trees/785c35d0e8d13c3e9ecf1d2c96bb78577d3a444c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/git/commits/c46177b287451667bbed8eea18910551cbf31455","verification":{"payload":"tree 785c35d0e8d13c3e9ecf1d2c96bb78577d3a444c\nparent 5008c896a592ce72f59995fa3b3210a57e5d0e19\nauthor NathanNeurotic (Ripto) <noahtkevans@gmail.com> 1782159635 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782159635 -0700\n\nfix(server): full-codebase audit batch 2 — Python server, 8 fixes (v10.38.217) (#259)\n\nlocal_ai_server.py:\n- Removed a duplicate @app.exception_handler(Exception) registered later in the\n  file that silently overrode the structured handler (Starlette keys by class) —\n  it leaked str(exc)+type name to clients and dropped the CUDA-OOM->503 retryable\n  classification. The structured handler is the sole owner again (+ full\n  traceback now logged to the server console).\n- Cold-start \"default_chat\" redirect resolves model_id via resolve_chat_role\n  (live config) instead of the import-frozen CHAT_MODEL_ID, so /config/reload is\n  honored.\n- The 3 chat sampling knobs (CHAT_TOP_K / CHAT_REPETITION_PENALTY /\n  CHAT_NO_REPEAT_NGRAM_SIZE) are parsed defensively — a non-numeric value no\n  longer throws ValueError on every local /chat request.\n- Dropped a dead Z-Image negative_prompt re-read (already merged above).\n\ngui_endpoints.py:\n- Fresh-boot ritual (_clean_stale_stack/_autostart_stack) now runs via\n  asyncio.to_thread instead of blocking the event loop during startup.\n- _compute_system_state reuses the gpu block embedded in the health payload\n  instead of calling the gpu provider too — both run gpu_stats() (nvidia-smi, no\n  cache), so it probed the GPU twice per 1s tick; also fixes a silent\n  device_name=None (the gpu provider renamed the key to \"device\").\n- The config-store file lock''s inner getmtime-OSError branch now honors the\n  timeout + backoff instead of busy-spinning.\n\nwarmup_local_cache.py:\n- Dropped the deprecated resume_download=True arg (newer huggingface_hub warns\n  on every model; downloads resume automatically).\n\nDeclined: slowing the 1Hz system-state write when idle — intentional + documented\n(tray/bot read it with no GUI open) and already offloaded to a worker thread.\n\npy_compile clean; gui-smoke 279/0; preflight 8/0.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqOZkTCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA0RAQAJDpHIb9xacsUdreu5geT+Xv\ngQ4oTqAsavxmm1KSySBD8r47mHDMSiQTc0VrINx2ZPZ5sK5KE4/U1TVNJnHBfnWj\n5dD5EeaLVSHJYA1oqxstz12I430E92rKZUvBpr3cimMuJytHGKCHLPUOg8tW8lNu\nb0vRiAusIVc76odL4nUdrW56T0xmK7pj2A9v7Kju1EvYiYHYe/C0/RRK9I17CXk8\nbke4LpEGO3dMybX7t3a+eaPAVyk8el2IWDFcwjcfXDwpXMt7hzisgTggG8QGC5BY\nL/uL39pu8r4ys9EerkeIYHrBWkwXEBSypzDweLYXrIeCy1LLzgndQ