SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commits/c46177b287451667bbed8eea18910551cbf31455"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109461996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NathanNeurotic","id":109461996,"login":"NathanNeurotic","node_id":"U_kgDOBoZB7A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commits/5008c896a592ce72f59995fa3b3210a57e5d0e19/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-22T20:03:41Z","email":"noahtkevans@gmail.com","name":"NathanNeurotic (Ripto)"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-22T20:03:41Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(bot): full-codebase audit batch 1 — security fix + 9 correctness/cleanup (v10.38.216) (#258)\n\nFrom a fresh ruthless multi-agent audit (every finding adversarially verified).\nThis is the index.js batch.\n\nSECURITY (HIGH): the Discord message-link extract route''s cross-guild guard only\nfired when message.guild?.id was truthy, so in a 1:1 DM it was skipped entirely\nand a user could paste a private guild-channel link and have the bot fetch/dump\nits contents with the BOT''s permissions (confused-deputy/IDOR). The guard now\nfires for any guild-scoped link whose server != the current context (DM included);\nsame-guild + @me DM links still work.\n\nCorrectness:\n- circuit breaker only counts transport-level unreachability, not HTTP 4xx/5xx\n  (3 bad-input 400s could otherwise open it and block all chat 60s).\n- archive-count: a reply-ping no longer hijacks the \"@other user\" path.\n- reactrule add: validate the emoji is usable (seekdeepResolveEmojiForReact)\n  before saving — it only checked the pattern.\n- admin-priority image-queue ack shows the true front-jumped position.\n- requester reader accepts the manual \"Saved by:\" label too.\n- archive-clean scan: env-overridable page cap SEEKDEEP_ARCHIVE_CLEAN_MAX_PAGES\n  (documented in .env.example).\n\nDead code: removed an unreachable trailing archive-status handler, an unused\nscope var, and collapsed a verbose no-op refined-prompt builder to match the\ncanonical generate path.\n\nSmoke 746/0; preflight 8/0.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"97a50c603d602b8df3507a7389adc934713303f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/git/trees/97a50c603d602b8df3507a7389adc934713303f5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/git/commits/5008c896a592ce72f59995fa3b3210a57e5d0e19","verification":{"payload":"tree 97a50c603d602b8df3507a7389adc934713303f5\nparent 440c3a132d70c204abb45b349f551a7d7292484e\nauthor NathanNeurotic (Ripto) <noahtkevans@gmail.com> 1782158621 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782158621 -0700\n\nfix(bot): full-codebase audit batch 1 — security fix + 9 correctness/cleanup (v10.38.216) (#258)\n\nFrom a fresh ruthless multi-agent audit (every finding adversarially verified).\nThis is the index.js batch.\n\nSECURITY (HIGH): the Discord message-link extract route''s cross-guild guard only\nfired when message.guild?.id was truthy, so in a 1:1 DM it was skipped entirely\nand a user could paste a private guild-channel link and have the bot fetch/dump\nits contents with the BOT''s permissions (confused-deputy/IDOR). The guard now\nfires for any guild-scoped link whose server != the current context (DM included);\nsame-guild + @me DM links still work.\n\nCorrectness:\n- circuit breaker only counts transport-level unreachability, not HTTP 4xx/5xx\n  (3 bad-input 400s could otherwise open it and block all chat 60s).\n- archive-count: a reply-ping no longer hijacks the \"@other user\" path.\n- reactrule add: validate the emoji is usable (seekdeepResolveEmojiForReact)\n  before saving — it only checked the pattern.\n- admin-priority image-queue ack shows the true front-jumped position.\n- requester reader accepts the manual \"Saved by:\" label too.\n- archive-clean scan: env-overridable page cap SEEKDEEP_ARCHIVE_CLEAN_MAX_PAGES\n  (documented in .env.example).\n\nDead code: removed an unreachable trailing archive-status handler, an unused\nscope var, and collapsed a verbose no-op refined-prompt builder to match the\ncanonical generate path.\n\nSmoke 746/0; preflight 8/0.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqOZUdCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAB3sQAIgItEKNrWHpjZzt6gmAzNkj\nTVwYqe3nfXrJnG+6r78FBN6k0IV9shRMDgG/pK0J43EmQw5plVF7eXacjx3NYzdn\nSPcmgPFGxY1ttOK2VxCy3JHaRW3k/gWGR70GAZQPlH1NqdwO9AUPJA/WsOS6uIm9\nTrRnvbDoTD7ZBI/nTm5qRA9w4VrRovoDljkopifCgzqa3MGTDiz2n94r5rLftuJl\n/3s0DiiJ7Np69cRlBI2HjZu+W+qcl0XrCIf3ejhhZyUfEnLUeEpHOT1MYeb+n9hr\n60oYk6Jdqc0QeUDjT3brRXwF5oXJ5OsSdxw2hVt3PgJro36tsIt2vfJ80vM6iJkt\nwXvegx/1vwk0g12bQ0qEWczYbLnbj/oyp/kBgkYEe8OYnqJbDaW5FIQ3RE7HDJzl\nztDztxiq7DVzAuq4F3aASTkY6Wjbultx42sHd7Lgnlt2MmzXZ02Rklds6vk/6mWR\nR0rYIxF/kiGZ9PItFgr3793GEdUViKRAlwV6xcLfkpKrhljb1iZIvjDhEPCOJlXd\n88ixYKCUG5OT/7udWkAQo1qEK45fQHXm5xZfSN2oNmtyiOLmbX6R9k82TTPFWdue\nfFkmi6ti9r9XDN9pBpzbFKjs3AKmam7uolxYESa+DwWlvJokCa8QwfTbOA6kHgMe\nJ+Ze9TI0cvww3++bLiCg\n=DxiU\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-22T20:03:42Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commit/5008c896a592ce72f59995fa3b3210a57e5d0e19","node_id":"C_kwDOSly7ZdoAKDUwMDhjODk2YTU5MmNlNzJmNTk5OTVmYTNiMzIxMGE1N2U1ZDBlMTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commit/440c3a132d70c204abb45b349f551a7d7292484e","sha":"440c3a132d70c204abb45b349f551a7d7292484e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commits/440c3a132d70c204abb45b349f551a7d7292484e"}],"sha":"5008c896a592ce72f59995fa3b3210a57e5d0e19","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commits/5008c896a592ce72f59995fa3b3210a57e5d0e19"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109461996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NathanNeurotic","id":109461996,"login":"NathanNeurotic","node_id":"U_kgDOBoZB7A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commits/440c3a132d70c204abb45b349f551a7d7292484e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-22T19:39:54Z","email":"noahtkevans@gmail.com","name":"NathanNeurotic (Ripto)"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-22T19:39:54Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: wire WS bus instantly (Gemini #256) + HEIC no longer mislabeled AVIF (v10.38.215) (#257)\n\n(1) gui/app.page2.js — the self-healing bus re-check only ran on each poll tick,\nso up to a 5s startup window had the bus live but the gpu.tick/health.tick/_open\nlisteners unwired (early events missed). A 250ms poll now wires them the instant\ndeferred nav.js publishes the bus; bounded to ~10s so it can''t spin forever if\nevents.js never loads (the per-tick re-check stays as the late-load fallback).\n\n(2) lib/image-mime.js — the magic-byte sniffer mapped HEIF/HEIC brands\n(mif1/heic/heix/hevc/hevx) to image/avif, so a HEIC upload passed the supported\ngate mislabeled as AVIF (HEVC bytes tagged AV1) and was forwarded to the server\ninstead of cleanly hitting \"unsupported image format\" (HEIC is in no supported\nextension list). Only true AVIF major brands (avif/avis) map to AVIF now.\n\nSmoke 746/0; preflight 8/0.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2c0347ffeab6679e4467ae3dff639cce7054ecab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/git/trees/2c0347ffeab6679e4467ae3dff639cce7054ecab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/git/commits/440c3a132d70c204abb45b349f551a7d7292484e","verification":{"payload":"tree 2c0347ffeab6679e4467ae3dff639cce7054ecab\nparent a3383214648a82848df2e34eeb067b85ff2dabfb\nauthor NathanNeurotic (Ripto) <noahtkevans@gmail.com> 1782157194 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782157194 -0700\n\nfix: wire WS bus instantly (Gemini #256) + HEIC no longer mislabeled AVIF (v10.38.215) (#257)\n\n(1) gui/app.page2.js — the self-healing bus re-check only ran on each poll tick,\nso up to a 5s startup window had the bus live but the gpu.tick/health.tick/_open\nlisteners unwired (early events missed). A 250ms poll now wires them the instant\ndeferred nav.js publishes the bus; bounded to ~10s so it can''t spin forever if\nevents.js never loads (the per-tick re-check stays as the late-load fallback).\n\n(2) lib/image-mime.js — the magic-byte sniffer mapped HEIF/HEIC brands\n(mif1/heic/heix/hevc/hevx) to image/avif, so a HEIC upload passed the supported\ngate mislabeled as AVIF (HEVC bytes tagged AV1) and was forwarded to the server\ninstead of cleanly hitting \"unsupported image format\" (HEIC is in no supported\nextension list). Only true AVIF major brands (avif/avis) map to AVIF now.\n\nSmoke 746/0; preflight 8/0.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqOY+KCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA8LoQABh8TfB1iOQclVfw2UNHLxul\ndHUxwRMq1gTf+Z0YlEbM2GbfeMreyc4ExiUGZNilSF9V8NhWVRrOiRB4+bLqjnTV\nKxm9Hgv4Kpie2NLxkubCSItHYm/8oPzuvJsEIP/Y4GppEzAYiWB2xa2Yu1hnNbe+\n4OuRn0Uq+KqoKjL5OKqefxvKHSAjXUNpSrlWuyN1k7dErqkKhMFXXR4hFMlov9bc\ndGlMU0uPGxd46vQgYb6z4sPoEzcMeglKAZfJlfNatvliwUPRUrNuOKhym9WPgS+6\nI9NIUiDF9