https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commits/440c3a132d70c204abb45b349f551a7d7292484e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109461996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NathanNeurotic","id":109461996,"login":"NathanNeurotic","node_id":"U_kgDOBoZB7A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commits/a3383214648a82848df2e34eeb067b85ff2dabfb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-22T18:36:05Z","email":"noahtkevans@gmail.com","name":"NathanNeurotic (Ripto)"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-22T18:36:05Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: Gemini review follow-ups on PR #255 + #253 — two real latent bugs (v10.38.214) (#256)\n\nThe split-batch-1 review caught bugs hiding in the pre-existing code extracted\nverbatim:\n\n(1) gui/app.page2.js — the Control Center health probe never used the WS bus.\nLIVE.start() runs at the top of this non-deferred script, but window.SeekDeepEvents\nis created by DEFERRED nav.js (runs later), so the one-shot `hasBus` check was\nalways false: live gpu.tick/health.tick listeners never wired and the poll was\npinned to the 5s fallback (the 30s backstop branch was dead). Bus wiring is now\nself-healing — re-checked each tick, it wires the moment nav.js loads it and\nlifts cadence to 30s.\n\n(2) lib/react-pattern.js — a plain-text auto-react pattern starting/ending with a\nsymbol or emoji (\":tada:\", \"🎉\") was wrapped in \\b…\\b; \\b needs a word-char edge,\nso those never matched. \\b is now applied only on word-char edges.\n\n(3) lib/image-mime.js — Buffer.slice() -> Buffer.subarray() in the magic-byte\nsniffer (former is soft-deprecated; identical bytes).\n\nDeclined: making the image subject-preservation check stricter (Set-of-stems vs\nsubstring) — it would fight the deliberate v10.14 leniency that keeps good prompt\nrefinements from being over-rejected.\n\nSmoke 746/0 (react-pattern + image-mime exercised via __seekdeepTest); preflight 8/0.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bfacd7a6886032df0c2e4f30c1c5b37739589c46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/git/trees/bfacd7a6886032df0c2e4f30c1c5b37739589c46"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/git/commits/a3383214648a82848df2e34eeb067b85ff2dabfb","verification":{"payload":"tree bfacd7a6886032df0c2e4f30c1c5b37739589c46\nparent b0201dc2c17b15196315c54004747a919cafa3b6\nauthor NathanNeurotic (Ripto) <noahtkevans@gmail.com> 1782153365 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782153365 -0700\n\nfix: Gemini review follow-ups on PR #255 + #253 — two real latent bugs (v10.38.214) (#256)\n\nThe split-batch-1 review caught bugs hiding in the pre-existing code extracted\nverbatim:\n\n(1) gui/app.page2.js — the Control Center health probe never used the WS bus.\nLIVE.start() runs at the top of this non-deferred script, but window.SeekDeepEvents\nis created by DEFERRED nav.js (runs later), so the one-shot `hasBus` check was\nalways false: live gpu.tick/health.tick listeners never wired and the poll was\npinned to the 5s fallback (the 30s backstop branch was dead). Bus wiring is now\nself-healing — re-checked each tick, it wires the moment nav.js loads it and\nlifts cadence to 30s.\n\n(2) lib/react-pattern.js — a plain-text auto-react pattern starting/ending with a\nsymbol or emoji (\":tada:\", \"🎉\") was wrapped in \\b…\\b; \\b needs a word-char edge,\nso those never matched. \\b is now applied only on word-char edges.\n\n(3) lib/image-mime.js — Buffer.slice() -> Buffer.subarray() in the magic-byte\nsniffer (former is soft-deprecated; identical bytes).\n\nDeclined: making the image subject-preservation check stricter (Set-of-stems vs\nsubstring) — it would fight the deliberate v10.14 leniency that keeps good prompt\nrefinements from being over-rejected.\n\nSmoke 746/0 (react-pattern + image-mime exercised via __seekdeepTest); preflight 8/0.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqOYCVCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA5OcQAJNM2aMsnFCrGdpe4kCwerWh\ns/TETEk6dk0pxBjq4s/1SN5Iwz43YZA5gjzxuaNVCihX9JYiVhih1DQ/onp9Ocn8\nwpERhdfuezgXzJen80LI4IrpNKgYYmi1KxEpLK+5PakGSkB3Eg0m3+MeMHGFWE7a\nf0GHLBfBvbvw/6L3rUtJIFHiaAAthqI1hQ/G0FTdFbd2UnH6qhVGeLFJjv7L75Lm\nFU9RVTPbsdvFXafIOYE/EaYXISPE2u3J68hpyNHWt5EupbMc4r0K7EYoUVhutYUZ\n9Z0zishqV9qtaZL5gQfQqw7JkI+NNHVqltdM/VQwXdI5sBkcAsBaXU4XbzVGOo/I\n8muepAgeyQA3hMQ6Pwo0ANpTy8ZIzewPeBaYj9UkGITE/cyKGxIiJN0SRt34FJ66\nOzPnQdCDe+V3ApIn/M3mEqzadWCp1CAOPgykSVc7i0YM8EMuu9+Y35HksVley6f1\nqvWHQmUqwZX/K7AbVd8SYbJHqSSC037Lf2SttN62rzK7resO9OIPgyack8sRXZq/\nMGSHUrH2ovpctad0G/BPa/1A8FEh1G0cFQzUK5ewlHJjCvHeaLpQCjzooCCPVNWV\nouQieNXelzjt4BqeAVAZi7KN3z92l5H9Vp8StI8vksjuv2hT3db37Dzd47yheMlZ\nYWX/Wms0HBS6Rsqp6R/q\n=O3qD\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-22T18:36:05Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commit/a3383214648a82848df2e34eeb067b85ff2dabfb","node_id":"C_kwDOSly7ZdoAKGEzMzgzMjE0NjQ4YTgyODQ4ZGYyZTM0ZWViMDY3Yjg1ZmYyZGFiZmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commit/b0201dc2c17b15196315c54004747a919cafa3b6","sha":"b0201dc2c17b15196315c54004747a919cafa3b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commits/b0201dc2c17b15196315c54004747a919cafa3b6"}],"sha":"a3383214648a82848df2e34eeb067b85ff2dabfb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commits/a3383214648a82848df2e34eeb067b85ff2dabfb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109461996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NathanNeurotic","id":109461996,"login":"NathanNeurotic","node_id":"U_kgDOBoZB7A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commits/b0201dc2c17b15196315c54004747a919cafa3b6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-22T18:16:03Z","email":"noahtkevans@gmail.com","name":"NathanNeurotic (Ripto)"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-22T18:16:03Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor(bot): index.js monolith split — batch 1, 5 pure leaf modules (v10.38.213) (#255)\n\nindex.js is ~25.5k lines in one module scope. A 29-agent mapping workflow (each\ncandidate adversarially coupling-checked) found the safe seams; this batch\nextracts five pure, Discord-free, side-effect-free clusters into lib/, imported\nback (matching the existing lib/url-fetch-policy.js precedent):\n\n  lib/pending-image-queue-plan.js   seekdeepPendingImageQueuePlan\n  lib/clean-duration-parse.js       seekdeepParseCleanDuration\n  lib/image-prompt-subject.js       keyword stem/extract + PreservesSubject\n  lib/image-mime.js                 ext/normalize/detect/isSupported MIME\n  lib/react-pattern.js              ReDoS-hardened react-pattern compiler (+2 consts)\n\n~200 lines out of the monolith. Behavior identical: every moved symbol is\nimported back so all callers AND the globalThis.__seekdeepTest surface resolve\nunchanged. The 746-check smoke suite (imports index.js with SEEKDEEP_TEST_MODE\nand exercises these via __seekdeepTest) passes 746/0; each new lib registered in\nscripts/preflight.mjs js targets. Purely structural — no runtime change.\n\nCheckpoint: backup-pre-refactor-v10.38.210. More batches to follow incrementally.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a7f7204a78105f791417caace9306cb5b03a0ed2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/git/trees/a7f7204a78105f791417caace9306cb5b03a0ed2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/git/commits/b0201dc2c17b15196315c54004747a919cafa3b6","verification":{"payload":"tree a7f7204a78105f791417caace9306cb5b03a0ed2\nparent 61c506e41608422e40718d364d809702f3d1267e\nauthor NathanNeurotic (Ripto) <noahtkevans@gmail.com> 1782152163 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782152163 -0700\n\nrefactor(bot): index.js monolith split — batch 1, 5 pure leaf modules (v10.38.213) (#255)\n\nindex.js is ~25.5k lines in one module scope. A 29-agent mapping workflow (each\ncandidate adversarially coupling-checked) found the safe seams; this batch\nextracts five pure, Discord-free, side-effect-free clusters into lib/, imported\nback (matching the existing lib/url-fetch-policy.js precedent):\n\n  lib/pending-image-queue-plan.js   seekdeepPendingImageQueuePlan\n  lib/clean-duration-parse.js       seekdeepParseCleanDuration\n  lib/image-prompt-subject.js       keyword stem/extract + PreservesSubject\n  lib/image-mime.js                 ext/normalize/detect/isSupported MIME\n  lib/react-pattern.js              ReDoS-hardened react-pattern compiler (+2 consts)\n\n~200 lines out of the monolith. Behavior identical: every moved symbol is\nimported back so all callers AND the globalThis.__seekdeepTest surface resolve\nunchanged. The 746-check smoke suite (imports index.js with SEEKDEEP_TEST_MODE\nand exercises these via __seekdeepTest) passes 746/0; each new lib registered in\nscripts/preflight.mjs js targets. Purely structural — no runtime change.\n\nCheckpoint: backup-pre-refactor-v10.38.210. More batches to follow incrementally.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqOXvjCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAKZ0QABBZEIYDJ5X88Bj3E++fKOJR\n+QsdJN6Z7qSyzAGJPfKoU19zB/p+vTg1J+q/BOfMn09lUUtfQIT1tHKSo/7q3CVN\nFeTBYTDPrTNpXdUGD8XmJrjzaQ8R+0nOIECHkYk4UgqPEKqrT5cy1R31cDxainb0\ng8VEr/Lr+q3zNKspWva5l+LSkoWTioMHr70r4SKwIMVxplLDJugxXl7Gf5lS2uq8\noU3Xz436KGOaPS9wwbJ5IEJXDhZHxxOr8vjsH4YENKECwgfMg6fyto7Id20uTe11\nxGCCeP9Xm7M9pjeQhwuLt92syki560Iro/9D10UBqMUgroQjgTwZY+HZCn/uov8l\n7NYYhXTySPWueLioJvM3ZIWvx9cGiPlSHQMK2V3VwoZ2Kp/8o5BdiZCz9gA83fxE\nGHl519E2ulfylGSVvCcFXCHEw5quPdRb9Xlut53qb6jLDMDHDpZZrXOpyFwU9KrX\nC8KcjjBTraACaXL4tD0kll+oeanCVvS5PJihzYp6NjrFhnwWlvoBa4tHRF4ibu3Y\njDpPjRb4LiSFKannRQ+9rna+L1Np9OH9r6tmxcYk+ETpV64bDk9bnI6DrOHHZivE\ntoK7VSRVccQtxEt5nEEfjMlzXHnikcsZcwbKJPtCX5c697iAP6z/05gE7I57f5xH\nX4ojGvNIj2ZSPzkk9BZs\n=6b53\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-22T18:16:04Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commit/b0201dc2c17b15196315c54004747a919cafa3b6","node_id":"C_kwDOSly7ZdoAKGIwMjAxZGMyYzE3YjE1MTk2MzE1YzU0MDA0NzQ3YTkxOWNhZmEzYjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commit/61c506e41608422e40718d364d809702f3d1267e","sha":"61c506e41608422e40718d364d809702f3d1267e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commits/61c506e41608422e40718d364d809702f3d1267e"}],"sha":"b0201dc2c17b15196315c54004747a919cafa3b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commits/b0201dc2c17b15196315c54004747a919cafa3b6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109461996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NathanNeurotic","id":109461996,"login":"NathanNeurotic","node_id":"U_kgDOBoZB7A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commits/61c506e41608422e40718d364d809702f3d1267e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-22T17:24:15Z","email":"noahtkevans@gmail.com","name":"NathanNeurotic (Ripto)"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-22T17:24:15Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(gui): Control Center panes link out to their standalone pages (de-dup) (v10.38.212) (#254)\n\nThe Control Center embeds Chat + Image playgrounds that overlap the standalone\nChat and Image A/B pages, but (unlike the Config pane, which already links to All\nSettings) gave no hint the fuller standalone versions exist. Both panes now carry\na \"⤢\" header link + inline note → chat.html (same engine, full-width) and\nimage-ab.html (the A/B compare lab).\n\nAdditive only — NO pane removed. The panes are live-wired with traces/dirty-\ntracking the standalone pages lack, so physically consolidating them is a\nseparate parity-gated decision (the critic flagged removal as high-regression),\nnot part of this change.\n\nGUI-only; next self-update. Preflight 8/0.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4e5de1c8d50ed6ec55e994dced52a0b92f9c3b60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/git/trees/4e5de1c8d50ed6ec55e994dced52a0b92f9c3b60"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/git/commits/61c506e41608422e40718d364d809702f3d1267e","verification":{"payload":"tree 4e5de1c8d50ed6ec55e994dced52a0b92f9c3b60\nparent e86e50ca870b5047a296538e42f8d3f550a85927\nauthor NathanNeurotic (Ripto) <noahtkevans@gmail.com> 1782149055 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782149055 -0700\n\nfeat(gui): Control Center panes link out to their standalone pages (de-dup) (v10.38.212) (#254)\n\nThe Control Center embeds Chat + Image playgrounds that overlap the standalone\nChat and Image A/B pages, but (unlike the Config pane, which already links to All\nSettings) gave no hint the fuller standalone versions exist. Both panes now carry\na \"⤢\" header link + inline note → chat.html (same engine, full-width) and\nimage-ab.html (the A/B compare lab).\n\nAdditive only — NO pane removed. The panes are live-wired with traces/dirty-\ntracking the standalone pages lack, so physically consolidating them is a\nseparate parity-gated decision (the critic flagged removal as high-regression),\nnot part of this change.\n\nGUI-only; next self-update. Preflight 8/0.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqOW+/CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAMVkQADubtVI2LxQKvbHCgg75HSim\nkHqniThyLjD8PhOHkit79zLv6ZAdLkoFX5fTdz8k+xHaxrnqVt9M7wv802OfTuIa\nj65xYFHjbP6PUHQeXtnrUR4BK2TX2yWqFxxvHnWRDkv1RXhYV1J0dIp+Tg3zLP/o\nnW4cBjf5WF//wBp/FLyej2nvGjsKjzWzlbl3OBYRurz2ZAMdUQkj48sC35AoWmJ+\nXL74vy6emE0rxLl+F1c9nWMMet0+9NjJPKDMCrKPiW+3qSbQ0AnQxElRLZFzHqMy\n28E7FN3XhxJaxRsA48cTgMeJBwWTbZfqasVmYhpI6S1qDWh2JgaC92mQ5UlaFYXz\nB92WjBULNdazrP8K+KFc7EnZYtsy1bCRaDJ3WgGf7eqIQ4c4vVqtDD1hr3EMM0U7\nbJimI2d764ign6Qbm17EMkfYAv4q2E1vZyRzwJnqUbpmBVRSS/ixhNmDPpEzeOOV\nSGeZvxSOIDubejCTPbNHkdZF+VsQD6yN704aflceD+TG3EVTIAKE2sGkn4wOpmHr\n7HSQLjQQFUcMNJqj42NMPiN3013e7/6Ooio2u2b8kaMxrHiOCkEr/XqJzG3Ti0cp\n6nanlLotV8IPEwPP+b4d5XI8nGceSsoZeRe7piXdI1nzl5YbyfwazDCTbF3VGzNV\nUIjuikOrBuTAwO63HwMC\n=X+b+\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-22T17:24:16Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commit/61c506e41608422e40718d364d809702f3d1267e","node_id":"C_kwDOSly7ZdoAKDYxYzUwNmU0MTYwODQyMmU0MDcxOGQzNjRkODA5NzAyZjNkMTI2N2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commit/e86e50ca870b5047a296538e42f8d3f550a85927","sha":"e86e50ca870b5047a296538e42f8d3f550a85927","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commits/e86e50ca870b5047a296538e42f8d3f550a85927"}],"sha":"61c506e41608422e40718d364d809702f3d1267e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commits/61c506e41608422e40718d364d809702f3d1267e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109461996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NathanNeurotic","id":109461996,"login":"NathanNeurotic","node_id":"U_kgDOBoZB7A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commits/e86e50ca870b5047a296538e42f8d3f550a85927/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-22T17:13:44Z","email":"noahtkevans@gmail.com","name":"NathanNeurotic (Ripto)"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-22T17:13:44Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"perf(gui): exponential backoff on the Control Center /health safety-net poll (v10.38.211) (#253)\n\nCloses the last loose end of the \"GUI keeps hammering an offline server\" idle-CPU\ncleanup. LIVE.probe() already tracked `failures` (to flip the OFFLINE pill) but\nnever used it to widen the interval — so with the AI server down in Full mode\n(Safe mode is opt-in), the no-WS-bus fallback re-probed /health every 5s forever\n(~12 dead fetches/min). Replaced the fixed setInterval with a self-rescheduling\nsetTimeout: each consecutive miss doubles the delay up to a 60s cap; the next\nsuccess resets failures so cadence snaps back to base (30s with the WS bus up,\n5s without). await-ing probe() between reschedules also prevents overlap.\n\nGUI-only; next self-update. Preflight 8/0.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"212286c7f38a75aa66efb2abc7a36ca8fd82847d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/git/trees/212286c7f38a75aa66efb2abc7a36ca8fd82847d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/git/commits/e86e50ca870b5047a296538e42f8d3f550a85927","verification":{"payload":"tree 212286c7f38a75aa66efb2abc7a36ca8fd82847d\nparent 0a23b554deb8fba48e5f12078c75de399756f02e\nauthor NathanNeurotic (Ripto) <noahtkevans@gmail.com> 1782148424 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782148424 -0700\n\nperf(gui): exponential backoff on the Control Center /health safety-net poll (v10.38.211) (#253)\n\nCloses the last loose end of the \"GUI keeps hammering an offline server\" idle-CPU\ncleanup. LIVE.probe() already tracked `failures` (to flip the OFFLINE pill) but\nnever used it to widen the interval — so with the AI server down in Full mode\n(Safe mode is opt-in), the no-WS-bus fallback re-probed /health every 5s forever\n(~12 dead fetches/min). Replaced the fixed setInterval with a self-rescheduling\nsetTimeout: each consecutive miss doubles the delay up to a 60s cap; the next\nsuccess resets failures so cadence snaps back to base (30s with the WS bus up,\n5s without). await-ing probe() between reschedules also prevents overlap.\n\nGUI-only; next self-update. Preflight 8/0.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqOW1ICRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAxPsQAEtV27E5ZGzJbC4sxESDOc3F\nnmUaJqy/npGDAIJGkOjhgfsAjM06rMfsccyID2/2ShaLuyGFPXFVBh+oZSj/kWC/\n66yZ2LI4esrWkRslBXG8eps/DiD0gncVIIwWPiXH+e+0WQAaCzB4HiLajVe4Qc2y\n8EU/ppP4UbLWi818ba/VZU+ePXMlRsqM2NDuaoIjWGbmlUXmRTtRLIHqSAj+3Gxc\ndkeKnKmFG2jVx7Uhm7FAEYo+JFbRIwIZbrYNFuORnjzWSuVJxYK961FLlxTExvbt\ncTcIymZXfpOZ5Mhas2yMtApUBhwSojY70iNjBM7YXFdxS+w1/484X1mbkdLL68og\nPL1P8Tnaji9Z4xbRLa+yN3rZa3kgLr1ycp39M9Y0OEVkPsETcEq62hOxTrxOT6Tz\nO2TWkPX6gCr8ZnI+AO5Bb0LmaMdqrZiHhkxkPscPUEeYXA79ljL0kPbw5gEyD1iy\nvskjEgccM7eSFpqp7P7x54dGgk7d5nUuf509/4d2ppB8pAqVA9ZuqXGTQtuWJ4Ip\nHwVvsZYAZJaBuKH4ShEb39uE/V72bbjabOQ/9smanB74Ip37XAXRbsKBWyXUeTqS\nDh1Oqj7VMAEyZnst0xOrr4iw9u5zOSOBJzLO5U5krqtCBw/oQSzzhaYhaANn09S0\ne0Y3KD6RwKhCbJAg6Md8\n=4crP\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-22T17:13:44Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commit/e86e50ca870b5047a296538e42f8d3f550a85927","node_id":"C_kwDOSly7ZdoAKGU4NmU1MGNhODcwYjUwNDdhMjk2NTM4ZTQyZjhkM2Y1NTBhODU5Mjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commit/0a23b554deb8fba48e5f12078c75de399756f02e","sha":"0a23b554deb8fba48e5f12078c75de399756f02e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commits/0a23b554deb8fba48e5f12078c75de399756f02e"}],"sha":"e86e50ca870b5047a296538e42f8d3f550a85927","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commits/e86e50ca870b5047a296538e42f8d3f550a85927"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109461996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NathanNeurotic","id":109461996,"login":"NathanNeurotic","node_id":"U_kgDOBoZB7A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commits/0a23b554deb8fba48e5f12078c75de399756f02e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-22T08:49:23Z","email":"noahtkevans@gmail.com","name":"NathanNeurotic (Ripto)"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-22T08:49:23Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(gui): per-chain retry budget for install-event subscription (Gemini #250) (v10.38.210) (#252)\n\nsubscribeToInstallEvents tracked its retry budget in a shared module counter.\nopenInstallModal calls it twice (immediate + 1s), so two overlapping retry\nchains incremented the same counter and could hit the 20-try cap in ~5s instead\nof the intended ~10s, cutting the bus-hookup window short. The count is now a\nper-call parameter (retries = 0) so each chain counts independently; the\ninstallBusWired guard still stops both the instant the bus wires.\n\nAlso addressed in the same review (no code change needed):\n- Gemini flagged the docker-launch creation_flags as a cross-platform compile\n  break. That code is inside `#[cfg(windows)] fn launch_docker_desktop` — it only\n  compiles on Windows (PR #250 CI was green on ubuntu + macos), and v10.38.209\n  already replaced it with sidecar::quiet_command_str. Nothing to fix.\n\nPreflight 8/0.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"995818e329775a09040ecf9bee0a300f6970828e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/git/trees/995818e329775a09040ecf9bee0a300f6970828e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/git/commits/0a23b554deb8fba48e5f12078c75de399756f02e","verification":{"payload":"tree 995818e329775a09040ecf9bee0a300f6970828e\nparent 4f4f8074010e593649b8433ea62559bbd13a2f4d\nauthor NathanNeurotic (Ripto) <noahtkevans@gmail.com> 1782118163 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782118163 -0700\n\nfix(gui): per-chain retry budget for install-event subscription (Gemini #250) (v10.38.210) (#252)\n\nsubscribeToInstallEvents tracked its retry budget in a shared module counter.\nopenInstallModal calls it twice (immediate + 1s), so two overlapping retry\nchains incremented the same counter and could hit the 20-try cap in ~5s instead\nof the intended ~10s, cutting the bus-hookup window short. The count is now a\nper-call parameter (retries = 0) so each chain counts independently; the\ninstallBusWired guard still stops both the instant the bus wires.\n\nAlso addressed in the same review (no code change needed):\n- Gemini flagged the docker-launch creation_flags as a cross-platform compile\n  break. That code is inside `#[cfg(windows)] fn launch_docker_desktop` — it only\n  compiles on Windows (PR #250 CI was green on ubuntu + macos), and v10.38.209\n  already replaced it with sidecar::quiet_command_str. Nothing to fix.\n\nPreflight 8/0.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqOPcTCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAVe4QAC42+OTxTt0a4lMMj0QDbgE/\n67m3PBQwBDTg/fmFubq6xTKy16L9K5TQMJ0cFqnscaDcp6tB4ewLiUbsD+uhBaZZ\nk6SJl+hBseaz9D3ZLoyJZ3kx2IxroHHToY8mhxH2H7NDNibOT+PacPvHt7niQLOP\n/78PH0S1H0dXR7Z73IfSl40OvwQIIKHP9TcBpIz9u0czaSVnczoKFnzqAcVM0VUS\n/BWTpI8itRS2h4oo9XC4QZQZboL61O1WVLf9NGwIggdhmFcu/8pY2ew/QL3/KPN+\njaiopcKCC4kmzGyZMoeTD/7VzSwdgGNalO+dpe8i4gmzQzScw7tsQ+FbxEnUZ/wK\nmH1rMBDX9qdn0J/fJXUi2OsMz+2VMGZvErGUUN+06WiDpu3ji5zqjyO4zsN/cnl1\n9QRF7tY6YFtH5U0Fp0yDuRUMnCV1djHuLOjyhvTLjricZ3eRuEDS/hVIEwrIFxj0\ngSrQNrPjF82ncfPO6/DDddYpS8n2vuxLbZXkOrqNoahWw3SiBGXMWr8imV74OVBB\nD2/xINagqyBP9P9G1S3QarhaygkbmKAvnzAIk4hAb7hBq/l2UpFCB+HXIZ2ygXmE\nhwsDGsEHZdBWFz9po1Tm95JgaHHKJaSsqvbW0TONoBLH424F7JCIhFRo4WLHw9+1\n/AG3BCINvN66US2vTpuY\n=RSNQ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-22T08:49:24Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commit/0a23b554deb8fba48e5f12078c75de399756f02e","node_id":"C_kwDOSly7ZdoAKDBhMjNiNTU0ZGViOGZiYTQ4ZTVmMTIwNzhjNzVkZTM5OTc1NmYwMmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commit/4f4f8074010e593649b8433ea62559bbd13a2f4d","sha":"4f4f8074010e593649b8433ea62559bbd13a2f4d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commits/4f4f8074010e593649b8433ea62559bbd13a2f4d"}],"sha":"0a23b554deb8fba48e5f12078c75de399756f02e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commits/0a23b554deb8fba48e5f12078c75de399756f02e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109461996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NathanNeurotic","id":109461996,"login":"NathanNeurotic","node_id":"U_kgDOBoZB7A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commits/4f4f8074010e593649b8433ea62559bbd13a2f4d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-22T08:41:05Z","email":"noahtkevans@gmail.com","name":"NathanNeurotic (Ripto)"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-22T08:41:05Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(gui): kill the stray terminal flash on boot / chat page + Gemini #249 follow-ups (v10.38.209) (#251)\n\nTHE TERMINAL POPUP: on Windows the update-check (check_for_update, called on\nevery chat.html load) shelled out to curl via a RAW std::process::Command. A\nconsole program spawned from the windowless Tauri shell pops its own black\nterminal for the call''s duration. Combined with the main-thread block (fixed in\nv10.38.208 via spawn_blocking), that''s the reported \"~5s unresponsive, a terminal\nappears, then recovers\".\n\nFix: route every console-program spawn in lib.rs through the sidecar''s\nquiet_command/quiet_command_str wrappers (made pub(crate)), which set\nCREATE_NO_WINDOW on Windows — the same suppression python/pip already use. That\ncovers the curl update-check (the reported one) plus the five docker spawns\n(daemon check, --version probe x2, SearXNG rm/run) and the launch-Docker cmd, so\nDocker/SearXNG actions no longer flash a terminal either.\n\nNeeds an installer rebuild to take effect (Rust). Pairs with v10.38.208''s\nspawn_blocking fix that removes the freeze itself.\n\nGemini review follow-ups (PR #249):\n- launcher stats empty-state placeholder builds its node with textContent, not\n  an innerHTML string-concat (label is a fixed literal, but injection-proof now).\n- nav.js ctx-menu logger calls console.warn / SeekDeepDebug.warn with their own\n  receiver (if/else, not a detached reference) — avoids a possible \"Illegal\n  invocation\" in engines that require the original `this`.\n- Rejected: the \"missing global tts_engine\" HIGH — it IS declared at the top of\n  tts_voice_download (line 7078), so the under-lock reset already works.\n\nPreflight 8/0 (incl. cargo check); gui-smoke 279/0 (main venv).\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8704b838e104c2366ce8d4b1d836334ffa42f749","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/git/trees/8704b838e104c2366ce8d4b1d836334ffa42f749"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/git/commits/4f4f8074010e593649b8433ea62559bbd13a2f4d","verification":{"payload":"tree 8704b838e104c2366ce8d4b1d836334ffa42f749\nparent 0ff0a5c5e123069934244c89a48ce00e94390d55\nauthor NathanNeurotic (Ripto) <noahtkevans@gmail.com> 1782117665 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782117665 -0700\n\nfix(gui): kill the stray terminal flash on boot / chat page + Gemini #249 follow-ups (v10.38.209) (#251)\n\nTHE TERMINAL POPUP: on Windows the update-check (check_for_update, called on\nevery chat.html load) shelled out to curl via a RAW std::process::Command. A\nconsole program spawned from the windowless Tauri shell pops its own black\nterminal for the call''s duration. Combined with the main-thread block (fixed in\nv10.38.208 via spawn_blocking), that''s the reported \"~5s unresponsive, a terminal\nappears, then recovers\".\n\nFix: route every console-program spawn in lib.rs through the sidecar''s\nquiet_command/quiet_command_str wrappers (made pub(crate)), which set\nCREATE_NO_WINDOW on Windows — the same suppression python/pip already use. That\ncovers the curl update-check (the reported one) plus the five docker spawns\n(daemon check, --version probe x2, SearXNG rm/run) and the launch-Docker cmd, so\nDocker/SearXNG actions no longer flash a terminal either.\n\nNeeds an installer rebuild to take effect (Rust). Pairs with v10.38.208''s\nspawn_blocking fix that removes the freeze itself.\n\nGemini review follow-ups (PR #249):\n- launcher stats empty-state placeholder builds its node with textContent, not\n  an innerHTML string-concat (label is a fixed literal, but injection-proof now).\n- nav.js ctx-menu logger calls console.warn / SeekDeepDebug.warn with their own\n  receiver (if/else, not a detached reference) — avoids a possible \"Illegal\n  invocation\" in engines that require the original `this`.\n- Rejected: the \"missing global tts_engine\" HIGH — it IS declared at the top of\n  tts_voice_download (line 7078), so the under-lock reset already works.\n\nPreflight 8/0 (incl. cargo check); gui-smoke 279/0 (main venv).\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqOPUhCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA028QAAp5goEHqwzZSPfsqPh2n0jy\n6cGnkJNPdTIgPpYn+rmpZIug+NfRdsxouCRt1km5dD2XwbZZZ60IkKxJSnEIPMor\nKoF+IvXb7ci/u4ftN99uwfOYSMNWx6f9DW5rxGtYXKCC/UQHNXRTpZart0RoVMlL\ncg2/6YE/KY8RyW+JHQ+nThztX+m5vzOYxzCH1asFa/hc9+AAAOKb05Wjh9kyFuJx\nUT/XRu6ssmOS7n3YTkjMpkiAyoGLMdAVPHsvrRwUaJpZk38r52Kp6X6hCgsgtBS4\ncc/PAw0+K2I/Gy/Eb4bWmk53ycPLcqX/TaQF2AcrVhEJYrsqrKdMeaQcqd5MONRn\nthY4P2dzUbES14WVMPTCRBTVZku0WshaN+hLAXCXbhMYBBCRZXjle6F0om74rie2\n0mY7XdGGYvavJcRJfSD5VnZV5XdWqC+IRVfN4VfKpuQcgY/jrkg+bburlqJJR/Er\nqcljEt/x46V0PfM2scXMgFeH+KG6kbUTeL/dSncF0vNzfAgtuwoesR6jU8NRByy9\nVPgKkwU2ZNT7YWgKrbWPvuLxEsv1VREbgM6ZGwiujWdZ8LEPx9m4i6vmGpfcSP9H\nSaSbi4BO0/QmgZ/WdlpcA0T1kO5RCas6g6J8lll2+t2ZcDxqcgzF7GKCyM0/Y/e6\nnGgtsWOsidefIVFxiKEu\n=Uqt9\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-22T08:41:06Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/event