tions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commits/0ff0a5c5e123069934244c89a48ce00e94390d55/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-22T08:30:08Z","email":"noahtkevans@gmail.com","name":"NathanNeurotic (Ripto)"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-22T08:30:08Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: verified low/nit sweep — 22 fixes across bot/server/GUI/Rust (v10.38.208) (#250)\n\nA fresh multi-agent discovery pass over the whole codebase, each finding\nadversarially re-verified against the live code before applying. 23 candidates\n-> 22 confirmed (1 wrong-premise rejected); 1 more was a false positive caught\nat apply time (an already-clean apostrophe).\n\nGUI (next self-update):\n- prompts.page: `+ New` pushed to window.TEMPLATES (never assigned) so the draft\n  was never added and select() fell back to template #0 — clicking New silently\n  opened the first existing template. Now pushes the module-local list + seeds\n  uses/lastUsed like the empty-state seed.\n- image-ab: blob: object URL leaked on every re-generation (the GENERATING\n  placeholder wiped the old <img> before the revoke could find it). Revoke\n  up-front now, covering the JSON/error branches too.\n- fetch: a persistent 5xx on the FINAL retry reported connected:true to\n  liveStatus. Only 2xx/3xx/4xx now count as a live link.\n- events: reconnect() now detaches the old socket''s handlers before close()\n  (same orphaned-callback race applyMode already guards — was flashing PROBING\n  + arming a stray reconnect timer).\n- model-install: cross-tab install subscription re-arms for ~10s if the event\n  bus loads late (was giving up after 2 tries -> rows stuck).\n- model-install + ml-deps: success status color falls back to the real green\n  token (#58e6a1) not cyan if styles.css fails to load (6 sites).\n\nBot (next restart):\n- fixed double-encoded apostrophe (\"Iâ€™ll\") in a table-offer reply.\n- Buffer.from(image_b64) guards a malformed 200 (clear msg vs cryptic TypeError).\n- anti-loop retry no longer drops a custom persona back to default.\n- image-edit reply whose needed mode isn''t the enabled one now explains instead\n  of silently falling through to generic chat routing.\n- collapse an identical-arm ternary; remove a duplicate thread-context fetch;\n  drop a redundant 30s bot-status timer (15s heartbeat already covers it).\n\nServer (next server update):\n- /chart matplotlib figure closed in finally (a mid-plot raise leaked it).\n- upscale fails cleanly instead of IndexError if the first PNG encode raises.\n- auto-reactions no longer drops a real emoji configured only in a later guild\n  (a \"?\" placeholder seed blocked cross-guild adoption).\n- corrected a misleading \"fill gaps with zeros\" comment.\n\nDesktop-shell/Rust (next installer rebuild):\n- check_for_update (curl ~8s) and try_start_docker_desktop (docker probes ~22s)\n  were sync #[tauri::command]s on the main thread -> froze the window; both now\n  run via spawn_blocking like the other long commands.\n- system-Python fallback no longer re-accepts the MS Store python.exe stub after\n  positively identifying it.\n- \"launch Docker Desktop\" cmd shell-out gets CREATE_NO_WINDOW (no console flash).\n- venv-detection rule de-duplicated into one helper (was copy-pasted x3).\n\nRejected: a /model/uninstall ollama-prefix \"bug\" (premise doesn''t occur — the\nGUI sends the bare tag) and a 2nd apostrophe site (already clean ASCII).\n\nPreflight 8/0 (incl. cargo check); gui-smoke 279/0 (main venv).\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"60ad0b2917de24898b7a859cfad330b27cf69729","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/git/trees/60ad0b2917de24898b7a859cfad330b27cf69729"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/git/commits/0ff0a5c5e123069934244c89a48ce00e94390d55","verification":{"payload":"tree 60ad0b2917de24898b7a859cfad330b27cf69729\nparent edbef33d3fa0e46108cab247216bf40c89142a74\nauthor NathanNeurotic (Ripto) <noahtkevans@gmail.com> 1782117008 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782117008 -0700\n\nfix: verified low/nit sweep — 22 fixes across bot/server/GUI/Rust (v10.38.208) (#250)\n\nA fresh multi-agent discovery pass over the whole codebase, each finding\nadversarially re-verified against the live code before applying. 23 candidates\n-> 22 confirmed (1 wrong-premise rejected); 1 more was a false positive caught\nat apply time (an already-clean apostrophe).\n\nGUI (next self-update):\n- prompts.page: `+ New` pushed to window.TEMPLATES (never assigned) so the draft\n  was never added and select() fell back to template #0 — clicking New silently\n  opened the first existing template. Now pushes the module-local list + seeds\n  uses/lastUsed like the empty-state seed.\n- image-ab: blob: object URL leaked on every re-generation (the GENERATING\n  placeholder wiped the old <img> before the revoke could find it). Revoke\n  up-front now, covering the JSON/error branches too.\n- fetch: a persistent 5xx on the FINAL retry reported connected:true to\n  liveStatus. Only 2xx/3xx/4xx now count as a live link.\n- events: reconnect() now detaches the old socket''s handlers before close()\n  (same orphaned-callback race applyMode already guards — was flashing PROBING\n  + arming a stray reconnect timer).\n- model-install: cross-tab install subscription re-arms for ~10s if the event\n  bus loads late (was giving up after 2 tries -> rows stuck).\n- model-install + ml-deps: success status color falls back to the real green\n  token (#58e6a1) not cyan if styles.css fails to load (6 sites).\n\nBot (next restart):\n- fixed double-encoded apostrophe (\"Iâ€™ll\") in a table-offer reply.\n- Buffer.from(image_b64) guards a malformed 200 (clear msg vs cryptic TypeError).\n- anti-loop retry no longer drops a custom persona back to default.\n- image-edit reply whose needed mode isn''t the enabled one now explains instead\n  of silently falling through to generic chat routing.\n- collapse an identical-arm ternary; remove a duplicate thread-context fetch;\n  drop a redundant 30s bot-status timer (15s heartbeat already covers it).\n\nServer (next server update):\n- /chart matplotlib figure closed in finally (a mid-plot raise leaked it).\n- upscale fails cleanly instead of IndexError if the first PNG encode raises.\n- auto-reactions no longer drops a real emoji configured only in a later guild\n  (a \"?\" placeholder seed blocked cross-guild adoption).\n- corrected a misleading \"fill gaps with zeros\" comment.\n\nDesktop-shell/Rust (next installer rebuild):\n- check_for_update (curl ~8s) and try_start_docker_desktop (docker probes ~22s)\n  were sync #[tauri::command]s on the main thread -> froze the window; both now\n  run via spawn_blocking like the other long commands.\n- system-Python fallback no longer re-accepts the MS Store python.exe stub after\n  positively identifying it.\n- \"launch Docker Desktop\" cmd shell-out gets CREATE_NO_WINDOW (no console flash).\n- venv-detection rule de-duplicated into one helper (was copy-pasted x3).\n\nRejected: a /model/uninstall ollama-prefix \"bug\" (premise doesn''t occur — the\nGUI sends the bare tag) and a 2nd apostrophe site (already clean ASCII).\n\nPreflight 8/0 (incl. cargo check); gui-smoke 279/0 (main venv).\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATU