":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commits/85ae453eab6cd85323dc6e7728ee6449fd1c27a1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-22T06:35:17Z","email":"109461996+NathanNeurotic@users.noreply.github.com","name":"NathanNeurotic (Ripto)"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-22T06:35:17Z","email":"109461996+NathanNeurotic@users.noreply.github.com","name":"NathanNeurotic (Ripto)"},"message":"fix(gui): nav.js low/nit audit cleanup — 5 fixes (v10.38.205)\n\ngui/nav.js, from the codebase audit:\n\n- CPU-only banner thrash: after dismissal (sessionStorage), every health\n  tick (~5s) recreated the banner then removed it again because the\n  dismissed-flag check sat INSIDE the create block. Now reads the flag\n  before creating and skips entirely.\n- applyGpuMode null-guard: `if (!h) return;` — a payload-less health.tick\n  no longer derefs h.cuda_available (was swallowed but real).\n- setLiveState: null-guard the .sd-live-label lookup so a pill adopted\n  from page markup without the label span can''t throw.\n- promptOpen: HTML-escape field metadata (key/value/placeholder/\n  description) before innerHTML — a quote in a value/placeholder broke\n  the input attribute markup.\n- context-menu action errors are logged (SeekDeepDebug.warn/console.warn)\n  instead of silently swallowed.\n\n(Deferred: the ~9x inline base-resolver dedup — pure maintainability nit,\nbehavior-identical, not worth a 9-site refactor.) node --check +\npreflight 8/0; GUI-only.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e7975b935937f71b64380b2c1f0bf9505e344009","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/git/trees/e7975b935937f71b64380b2c1f0bf9505e344009"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/g