Deep-DiscordBot/commits/7bf5cb18768f6e232e77216c2e1fd2c9f80bce57/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-22T06:26:10Z","email":"109461996+NathanNeurotic@users.noreply.github.com","name":"NathanNeurotic (Ripto)"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-22T06:26:10Z","email":"109461996+NathanNeurotic@users.noreply.github.com","name":"NathanNeurotic (Ripto)"},"message":"fix(gui): launcher/stats low/nit audit cleanup — 7 fixes (v10.38.204)\n\ngui/launcher.js, from the codebase audit:\n\n- Live stats staleness: renderBreakdown (persona/style/model), the 30-day\n  activity bars, and the top-contributors leaderboard only re-rendered on\n  non-empty data, so a stats.tick snapshot that dropped to all-zero left\n  the prior rows stale. Added empty-clears to all three.\n- Lock-cache /health poll (a 4th background poller) + the WS-reconnect\n  bus-drop pump are now Safe-mode/hidden-tab gated (_skipBackgroundPoll).\n- The \"restarting\" toast-suppression window now only fires for the AI\n  server (svc === ''ai-server''); a failed bot/searxng start no longer\n  hides behind it.\n- Offline launcher badge clears a prior ''warn'' before adding ''bad'' (one\n  status colour).\n- Leaderboard avatar derives the initial from the @-stripped tag, so a\n  plain display name (''Nathan'') shows ''N'' not ''a''.\n\nnode --check + preflight 8/0; GUI-only, next self-update.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a207d9283b770053a9a3f9b0f60d991dc47357be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/git/trees/a207d9283b770053a9a3f9b0f60d991dc47357be"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/git/commits/7bf5cb18768f6e232e77216c2e1fd2c9f80bce57","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109461996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeu