"109461996+NathanNeurotic@users.noreply.github.com","name":"NathanNeurotic (Ripto)"},"message":"fix(server): gui_endpoints low/nit audit cleanup — 6 fixes (v10.38.203)\n\ngui_endpoints.py, from the codebase audit:\n\n- get_logs_tail (async) did its file I/O — _find_active_log (glob +\n  per-file stat) and _tail (backward block reads) — directly on the\n  asyncio loop. On a large/active log that stalls the loop (the chronic\n  wedge class). Offloaded to asyncio.to_thread (traversal check kept\n  inside).\n- _find_active_log stat''d files inside the sort key, so a daily-rotating\n  log deleted between glob() and stat() raised FileNotFoundError -> 500.\n  Now stats tolerantly and skips files that rotated away mid-scan.\n- The 3 emoji-vault Discord helpers had `import requests` outside the\n  try, so a minimal install without `requests` got an opaque 500. Now a\n  guarded import -> clean 503.\n- Discord >=400 responses were flattened to a bare \"Discord API error\n  <code>\"; now surface Discord''s own JSON `message`.\n- _now_iso read the clock twice (seconds + millis could straddle a second\n  boundary); read once.\n\nPreflight 8/0; server-side, next server update.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4f5b333fe700fe056a20bba8e9694a8ac9e863df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/git/trees/4f5b333fe700fe056a20bba8e9694a8ac9e863df"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/git/commits/94730e9f1d8f3e93e3682f638472fc277dc45050","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109461996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https: