NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commit/a6900fc8eaa24024676bf158db3762108c1dd3a5","sha":"a6900fc8eaa24024676bf158db3762108c1dd3a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commits/a6900fc8eaa24024676bf158db3762108c1dd3a5"}],"sha":"432cb7390faa55ab225f8378d8e3c816a0645945","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commits/432cb7390faa55ab225f8378d8e3c816a0645945"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109461996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NathanNeurotic","id":109461996,"login":"NathanNeurotic","node_id":"U_kgDOBoZB7A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commits/a6900fc8eaa24024676bf158db3762108c1dd3a5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-22T06:03:36Z","email":"109461996+NathanNeurotic@users.noreply.github.com","name":"NathanNeurotic (Ripto)"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-22T06:03:36Z","email":"109461996+NathanNeurotic@users.noreply.github.com","name":"NathanNeurotic (Ripto)"},"message":"fix(server): AI-server low/nit audit cleanup — 10 fixes (v10.38.202)\n\nlocal_ai_server.py, all from the codebase audit:\n\nSecurity:\n- SSRF provider guard now FAILS CLOSED on a DNS-resolution failure (an\n  unresolvable host can''t be verified safe; a selectively-failing\n  resolver is itself an SSRF vector).\n- HF install `revision` is shape-validated (reject ''..'', alnum-start ref)\n  before it flows to snapshot_download as a URL path / cache-dir segment.\n\nRobustness:\n- 4 user-settable numeric env knobs (OUTPUTS_MAX_FILES/_AGE_HOURS,\n  CHAT_MAX_INPUT_CHARS/_TOKENS) no longer crash the server at import on a\n  non-numeric value (try/except, matching the existing tunable pattern).\n- request-metrics middleware records its sample in `finally` so a raising\n  handler still counts (error spikes were invisible before).\n\nConcurrency:\n- lazy TTS-engine build now guarded by a dedicated double-checked lock\n  (two concurrent first /tts calls could both build + double-assign the\n  global). /tts deliberately stays off the VRAM singleflight lock.\n\nPerf:\n- _output_path prunes at most once/60s instead of a full iterdir+stat on\n  both dirs every image request.\n- upscaler reuses the already-encoded PNG instead of re-PNG-encoding the\n  (up to 20MP) image a second time (both lanczos + realesrgan branches).\n\nCleanup: dead `mapped` double-assignment removed; max_bytes annotations\nint -> int|None.\n\nPreflight 8/0; server-side, next server update.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fa9ef58714aa75721ecee2e05bb38a95638ca23b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/git/trees/fa9ef58714aa75721ecee2e05bb38a95638ca23b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/git/commits/a6900fc8eaa24024676bf158db3762108c1dd3a5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109461996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/events{/privacy}","