b.com","name":"NathanNeurotic (Ripto)"},"message":"perf(gui): gate the last per-page pollers on Safe mode (idle-load follow-up) (v10.38.201)\n\nSafe mode pauses the WS bus so the server tick loop idles, but several\nControl Center pages still ran standalone setInterval HTTP polls — the\nonly thing left hitting the server in the zero-background tier. Now gated\non Safe mode + hidden tab (only the cadence; initial/manual/WS still run):\n\n- app.page2.js: GPU/health probe (30/5s), searxng-status pull (15s),\n  issues-banner load (60s), launcher onActive (30s) via a local\n  seekdeepSkipBgPoll(); the clock skips repaint on a hidden tab.\n- app.page5.js: logs fallback poll now also checks Safe mode.\n- app.page1.js: archive snapshot re-fetch (60s).\n\nCompletes the per-page poller follow-up (launcher.js was done in .192).\noperations.page.js''s interval is a short-lived mount-retry — left alone.\nPreflight 8/0; GUI-only.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9c5d6d7f40c4f77443c8f75df228d8baacb8211b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/git/trees/9c5d6d7f40c4f77443c8f75df228d8baacb8211b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/git/commits/8d94ffdd906ae0678e55d16509ab92e24da32896","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109461996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NathanNeurotic","id":109461996,"login":"NathanNeurotic","node_id":"U_kgDOBoZB7A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/or