ecent\n  SearXNG refuses to start on — and the container entrypoint only\n  auto-generates a key when settings.yml is ABSENT, which it no longer is\n  once we write the seed. So a fresh install bringing up web search via\n  the desktop button before the Python server seeded the config could\n  crash-loop the container. Now generates a key (time-seeded LCG; no RNG\n  crate; loopback-only search just needs a non-placeholder value). The\n  Python path already used secrets.token_hex; the patch path is\n  unaffected (existing settings.yml already has a key).\n- #241 (perf nit, app.page5.js): newLinesStart now starts the loop at\n  Math.max(0, prevSigs.length - newSigs.length) — the first d whose\n  overlap fits within newSigs — skipping iterations the old\n  `overlap > newSigs.length` guard would only `continue` past. Removed\n  that now-dead guard. Behavior identical.\n\ncargo check + preflight 8/0. Rust ships next installer rebuild; JS self-update.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cdeb493485e0d40513779f0e2267cc91b8081390","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/git/trees/cdeb493485e0d40513779f0e2267cc91b8081390"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/git/commits/8a28a2dd31fe99c0b8fcfe0ab582bd3eb33ab408","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109461996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NathanNeurotic","id":109461996,"login":"NathanNeurotic","node_id":"U_kgDOBoZB7A","organizations_url":"https://api.gith