s.length` so the loop checks only real overlaps\n(>=1) and the no-overlap case falls through to the explicit return.\nIdentical behavior; no dead code.\n\nGUI-only; next GUI self-update.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e243a019a885420cae9484e260ad916c9928a7b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/git/trees/e243a019a885420cae9484e260ad916c9928a7b3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/git/commits/1cca82597e1da64fc2a41c00d24db52fce769ba5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109461996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NathanNeurotic","id":109461996,"login":"NathanNeurotic","node_id":"U_kgDOBoZB7A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commit/1cca82597e1da64fc2a41c00d24db52fce769ba5","node_id":"C_kwDOSly7ZdoAKDFjY2E4MjU5N2UxZGE2NGZjMmE0MWMwMGQyNGRiNTJmY2U3NjliYTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commit/1f75193de5fd0d6f5eb5773522d1e3879c