:"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commit/1f75193de5fd0d6f5eb5773522d1e3879c90e4e8","node_id":"C_kwDOSly7ZdoAKDFmNzUxOTNkZTVmZDBkNmY1ZWI1NzczNTIyZDFlMzg3OWM5MGU0ZTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commit/c66958aa4a7ce04b1af37ce200810faa6e61fed0","sha":"c66958aa4a7ce04b1af37ce200810faa6e61fed0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commits/c66958aa4a7ce04b1af37ce200810faa6e61fed0"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commit/5c4fbbb505948ad87a86606fed9b42a84c7bba99","sha":"5c4fbbb505948ad87a86606fed9b42a84c7bba99","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commits/5c4fbbb505948ad87a86606fed9b42a84c7bba99"}],"sha":"1f75193de5fd0d6f5eb5773522d1e3879c90e4e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commits/1f75193de5fd0d6f5eb5773522d1e3879c90e4e8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109461996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NathanNeurotic","id":109461996,"login":"NathanNeurotic","node_id":"U_kgDOBoZB7A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commits/5c4fbbb505948ad87a86606fed9b42a84c7bba99/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T23:33:59Z","email":"109461996+NathanNeurotic@users.noreply.github.com","name":"NathanNeurotic (Ripto)"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T23:33:59Z","email":"109461996+NathanNeurotic@users.noreply.github.com","name":"NathanNeurotic (Ripto)"},"message":"fix(search): enable SearXNG json format — web search was 403-broken (v10.38.198)\n\nRoot cause of \"web search returns generic answers / inference is shit\":\nthe bot queries SearXNG with ?format=json, but SearXNG''s auto-generated\ndefault settings.yml enables ONLY the html output format. So EVERY web\nsearch got 403 Forbidden, searchWeb() threw, askChat fell back to empty\ncontext, and the model answered from training-cutoff knowledge. The\nengines were fine all along (HTML found 25 results for the exact query\nthat failed live).\n\n- gui_endpoints._seekdeep_ensure_searxng_json_format(searxng_dir): seeds\n  a use_default_settings override with json if no settings.yml exists,\n  else inserts `- json` after the formats `- html`. Called before all 4\n  `docker run seekdeep-searxng` sites (auto-start + the start/restart\n  endpoints).\n- Rust ensure_searxng_json_format() mirrors it for the desktop-shell''s\n  start_searxng_stack (shared config dir; whichever runs first wins).\n- Verified live: enabling json + restarting the container turned the\n  failing \"Dream Router 7 vs Express 7\" query into 25 real results\n  (RTINGS / Dong Knows Tech / r/Ubiquiti / ...). The running container''s\n  config was also fixed in place so search works now.\n\nServer applies on next server update; desktop-shell half on next\ninstaller rebuild. cargo check + preflight 8/0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0ac02ffa70d6de302f441461db8622de9884f73c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/git/trees/0ac02ffa70d6de302f441461db8622de9884f73c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/git/commits/5c4fbbb505948ad87a86606fed9b42a84c7bba99","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109461996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NathanNeurotic","id":109461996,"login":"NathanNeurotic","node_id":"U_kgDOBoZB7A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commit/5c4fbbb505948ad87a86606fed9b42a84c7bba99","node_id":"C_kwDOSly7ZdoAKDVjNGZiYmI1MDU5NDhhZDg3YTg2NjA2ZmVkOWI0MmE4NGM3YmJhOTk","parents":[{"htm