ub.com/NathanNeurotic","id":109461996,"login":"NathanNeurotic","node_id":"U_kgDOBoZB7A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commits/26653b600ae2ae7db0be76be82297db1b2956917/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T22:13:24Z","email":"109461996+NathanNeurotic@users.noreply.github.com","name":"NathanNeurotic (Ripto)"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T22:13:24Z","email":"109461996+NathanNeurotic@users.noreply.github.com","name":"NathanNeurotic (Ripto)"},"message":"fix: Gemini review follow-ups on the audit batches — 7 verified fixes (v10.38.197)\n\nAll 7 valid; several catch regressions the audit fixes themselves\nintroduced:\n\n- #233 (HIGH, app.page4.js): Add-Model wizard broke on reopen — the\n  success handler removeEventListener(''click'', advance) + swapped onclick;\n  a Cancel/backdrop close (no reload) then reopen left the Next button\n  dead. Now an installDone flag routes the terminal step through advance()\n  (reset on open()); listener stays bound.\n- #230 (MED, gui_endpoints.py): the launcher finally blocks recompute\n  service state; a raise there propagated out and SUPPRESSED the primary\n  exception (the real launcher/kill failure). Wrapped both in try/except\n  + log.\n- #233 (HIGH, app.page5.js): poll-mode log dedup matched a single\n  last-line signature, dropping a genuinely-new line identical to the\n  prior one (repeated warning/heartbeat). Replaced with sliding-window\n  overlap alignment of the whole batch.\n- #235 (security-high, url-fetch-policy.js): NAT64 decode now requires the\n  exact /96 (groups 2-5 == 0, RFC 6052) — a non-/96 64:ff9b:* prefix\n  embeds IPv4 elsewhere, so decoding the last 32 bits mis-classified.\n  Non-/96 treated as opaque public. + case-insensitive hex regex.\n- #236 (HIGH, datadash.game.js): localStorage at top level throws in a\n  restricted Discord-Activity iframe -> whole game fails to load. All\n  read/write access try-guarded.\n- #234 (MED, playground.js): chat-history trim rounds the remove count up\n  to even so it can''t leave a lone leading assistant turn.\n\n+2 SSRF smoke tests (744 -> 746); preflight 8/0. Mixed GUI/bot/server.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"640cabd660b2a54e900b0ad0fd04fe33dfc6c1bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/git/trees/640cabd660b2a54e900b0ad0fd04fe33dfc6c1bd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/git/commits/26653b600ae2ae7db0be76be82297db1b2956917","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109461996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NathanNeurotic","id":109461996,"login":"NathanNeurotic","node_id":"U_kgDOBoZB7A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/starred{/owner