","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NathanNeurotic","id":109461996,"login":"NathanNeurotic","node_id":"U_kgDOBoZB7A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commits/1e7ad2983268fa09d3af69c6ca8a81e3795dd267/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T21:53:41Z","email":"109461996+NathanNeurotic@users.noreply.github.com","name":"NathanNeurotic (Ripto)"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T21:53:41Z","email":"109461996+NathanNeurotic@users.noreply.github.com","name":"NathanNeurotic (Ripto)"},"message":"fix(bot): index.js low/nit audit cleanups — 5 fixes (v10.38.196)\n\nLow/nit audit findings, all clean + low-risk:\n\n- Rotating presence no longer stomps an in-progress activity status:\n  seekdeepApplyNextStatus now early-returns while seekdeepActivityOverride\n  Count > 0 (the post-task revert still fires since clear() calls it at 0).\n- Reaction shortcuts (archive/delete/regen) now de-duped via\n  seekdeepClaimEventOnce(reaction:<msg>:<user>:<emoji>) — Discord can\n  redeliver reaction events (gateway resume), which could double-archive.\n- seekdeepIncrementTemplateUse keys via seekdeepTemplateNameSanitize like\n  the save/delete/share helpers, so use-counts increment for templates\n  whose names contain special chars (previously silently never bumped).\n- Removed an unreachable line after `return false` in isNaturalImagePrompt\n  (refactor leftover; the same check runs reachably near the top).\n- Dropped a precedence-confused `content.includes(botId.slice(-4))`\n  prefilter clause in conversation search — behavior-preserving (the inner\n  gate already requires mentionsBot && words.every).\n\nPreflight 8/0; smoke 744/0. Bot-side; next bot restart.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fcc3aea23c92ffa8f12d93ef83a742d9d8382dba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/git/trees/fcc3aea23c92ffa8f12d93ef83a742d9d8382dba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/git/commits/1e7ad2983268fa09d3af69c6ca8a81e3795dd267","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109461996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NathanNeurotic","id":109461996,"login":"NathanNeurotic","node_id":"U_kgDOBoZB7A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/user