 game.boss only, so they stopped when boss1 died while boss2 fought on.\n  Now (game.boss || game.boss2).\n- M1: buildTiles (6 levels x 2 offscreen 1500xH circuit canvases) ran on\n  every resize event; tiles only depend on H, so rebuild only when H\n  changes (skips width-only drag events).\n- M1: best = ... || 0 guards a corrupted localStorage value (NaN would\n  make the bytes>best test always false -> best never saves again).\n- M1: removed dead `nextPepe` field (only nextPepeT is read).\n\nnode --check clean; preflight 8/0. GUI-only; next GUI self-update.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"05fc47d9582ab64516222e62cc3bd0e873bb6b95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/git/trees/05fc47d9582ab64516222e62cc3bd0e873bb6b95"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/git/commits/805a93540aba25dcd27cccd82b1f3f241da52a50","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109461996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NathanNeurotic","id":109461996,"login":"NathanNeurotic","node_id":"U_kgDOBoZB7A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://