https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NathanNeurotic","id":109461996,"login":"NathanNeurotic","node_id":"U_kgDOBoZB7A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commits/de002332fd74a63a9c2dd5f689003a90f8ee0697/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T21:20:38Z","email":"109461996+NathanNeurotic@users.noreply.github.com","name":"NathanNeurotic (Ripto)"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T21:20:38Z","email":"109461996+NathanNeurotic@users.noreply.github.com","name":"NathanNeurotic (Ripto)"},"message":"fix(security): classify NAT64 / 6to4 IPv6 by embedded IPv4 (SSRF) (v10.38.193)\n\nAudit M16. The URL-safety policy (lib/url-fetch-policy.js) extracted the\nembedded IPv4 only from ::ffff:-mapped IPv6 forms. NAT64 (64:ff9b::/96)\nand 6to4 (2002::/16) addresses — which also embed an IPv4 — fell through\nas routable-public. On an IPv6-only / NAT64 network they translate to\nthat embedded IPv4, so 64:ff9b::a9fe:a9fe (169.254.169.254) or\n2002:7f00:1::1 (127.0.0.1) could slip past the loopback/metadata guard.\n\n- New seekdeepExpandIpv6() (8-group expansion, handles :: + dotted tail)\n  + seekdeepTranslatedV4FromIpv6() (NAT64 last 32 bits, 6to4 bits after\n  2002:).\n- seekdeepClassifyBlockedIp recurses on the extracted v4 so a\n  private/metadata/RFC1918 embed blocks while a genuinely-public embed\n  (2002:808:808:: = 8.8.8.8) still resolves.\n- Mirrored in seekdeepEmbeddedIPv4 so the always-on metadata guard\n  catches them too.\n- 8 new SSRF regression tests (736 -> 744).\n\nBot-side; takes effect on the next bot restart.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"76aa584abe9082cb21870030553b9126435546c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/git/trees/76aa584abe9082cb21870030553b9126435546c1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/git/commits/de002332fd74a63a9c2dd5f689003a90f8ee0697","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109461996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NathanNeurotic","id":109461996,"login":"NathanNeurotic","node_id":"U_kgDOBoZB7A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commit/de002332fd74a63a9c2dd5f689003a90f8ee0697","node_id":"C_kwDOSly7ZdoAKGRlMDAyMzMyZmQ3NGE2M2E5YzJkZDVmNjg5MDAzYTk