/NathanNeurotic","id":109461996,"login":"NathanNeurotic","node_id":"U_kgDOBoZB7A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commits/65654c2b5d565fd07e2458e36fd889a14b690262/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T21:11:11Z","email":"109461996+NathanNeurotic@users.noreply.github.com","name":"NathanNeurotic (Ripto)"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T21:11:11Z","email":"109461996+NathanNeurotic@users.noreply.github.com","name":"NathanNeurotic (Ripto)"},"message":"fix(gui): audit batch 2 — chat history + 8 GUI correctness/UX/perf fixes (v10.38.192)\n\nAudit batches E+F, all adversarially verified:\n\n- H8/M11 (playground.js): each chat turn sent the current message twice\n  (history array + prompt; server appends both) -> two identical user\n  turns corrupting context; and an errored/offline turn left a dangling\n  user turn. Commit user+assistant only on success; send prior turns +\n  prompt once.\n- H7 (memory.page.js): fmtAgo did Date.now()-ts with no parse, so an ISO\n  updatedAt rendered \"updated NaNd ago\". Normalize numeric|ISO first.\n- H9 (setup-wizard.page.js): `error || exit_code ? ... : ...` precedence\n  discarded the real error text (always \"exit undefined\"). Parenthesized.\n- M8 (installer.page7.js): wrote literal ''none'' for a skipped vision/\n  image model -> server from_pretrained(''none'') crashes the role. Blank\n  ('''') would also crash (os.getenv returns it), so Skip now leaves the\n  key unchanged.\n- M9 (launcher.js): safety-net status/gpu/stats polls ignored Safe mode\n  (the WS is paused there, so these were the only background work left).\n  Added a _skipBackgroundPoll() guard on the HTTP-fetch path only.\n- M10 (notify.js): modal() leaked a document keydown listener on every\n  non-Escape close (~50 call sites). finish() now detaches it on every\n  path + is idempotent.\n- M12 (styles.css): --hull-1 used ~30x but never defined -> invalid color\n  decls. Aliased to var(--hull).\n- M13 (styles.css): reduced-motion / Lite only cut background layers,\n  leaving traceFlow/blink/livePulse looping. Explicit (non-blanket) stop;\n  verified no functional animations exist to break.\n\nCompletes all 12 high-severity audit findings. Preflight 8/0. GUI-only;\nnext GUI self-update.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7bfc1a4e47bd99181ce748364056021419716a0b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/git/trees/7bfc1a4e47bd99181ce748364056021419716a0b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/git/commits/65654c2b5d565fd07e2458e36fd889a14b690262","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109461996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NathanNeurotic","id":109461996,"login":"NathanNeurotic","node_id":"U_kgDOBoZB7A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commit/65654c2b5d565fd07e2458e36fd889a14b690262","node_id":"C_kwDOSly7ZdoAKDY1NjU0YzJiNWQ1NjVmZDA3ZTI0NThlMzZmZDg4OWExNGI2OTAyNjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commit/6999d2a964529961f107845239f802108c840067","sha":"6999d2a964529961f107845239f802108c840067","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commits/6999d2a964529961f107845239f802108c840067"}],"sha":"65654c2b5d565fd07e2458e36fd889a14b690262","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commits/65654c2b5d565fd07e2458e36fd889a14b690262"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109461996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NathanNeurotic","id":109461996,"login":"NathanNeurotic","node_id":"U_kgDOBoZB7A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.gith