40067"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109461996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NathanNeurotic","id":109461996,"login":"NathanNeurotic","node_id":"U_kgDOBoZB7A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commits/4057fa71cf7a522c4613128afe9809983cfec116/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T20:56:46Z","email":"109461996+NathanNeurotic@users.noreply.github.com","name":"NathanNeurotic (Ripto)"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T20:56:46Z","email":"109461996+NathanNeurotic@users.noreply.github.com","name":"NathanNeurotic (Ripto)"},"message":"fix(gui): Control Center audit batch — 8 fixes (v10.38.191)\n\nAudit batch D (app.page*.js), all adversarially verified:\n\n- H4: model-row WARM buttons were double-wired (page1 by text + page4 by\n  data-act) -> two concurrent /model/warm POSTs per click. Removed the\n  redundant page1 text loop (its EVICT/UNLOAD branch was also dead — no\n  button says EVICT/UNLOAD). page4 [data-act] is the single owner.\n- H5: Add-Model wizard success branch never re-enabled the \"Done · close\"\n  button (stuck disabled) and left the stale `advance` submit listener\n  attached. Re-enable + removeEventListener.\n- H6: /logs/tail poll re-appended the same lines every 3s (no cursor) —\n  ~100 dupes/min flooding the 500-line ring. Added signature dedup.\n- M4: image-playground blob: URLs were never revoked (pinned by history\n  thumbnails) -> unbounded WebView memory. Revoke on thumb eviction;\n  data:/http URLs untouched.\n- M5: server-returned seed was captured then unconditionally overwritten\n  by the client seed -> Copy-seed / Regen-same-seed used the wrong one.\n- M6: log source-filter chips hid every file-format line (src=''file''\n  matches no chip) -> blank viewer. Treat ''file'' as matching all sources.\n- M7: querySelectorAll(''.abyss::before'') is a SyntaxError -> aborted\n  applyAppTweaks before the no-motion/persona/panel-blur lines. Dropped\n  the unreachable pseudo-element (abyss handled via the no-motion class).\n- M3: archive search re-flattened the whole multi-MB snapshot per\n  keystroke. Memoized the flatten keyed on snapshot identity.\n\nCoverage doc regen (/model/warm now attributed to page4). Preflight 8/0.\nGUI-only; applies on next GUI self-update.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8fa51ad395fae15740309c58ef7cdf90f181b76b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/git/trees/8fa51ad395fae15740309c58ef7cdf90f181b76b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/git/commits/4057fa71cf7a522c4613128afe9809983cfec116","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109461996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanN