/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commit/7cd5cb200cf93051ff7e37d7fd536b1191a4a6f3","sha":"7cd5cb200cf93051ff7e37d7fd536b1191a4a6f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commits/7cd5cb200cf93051ff7e37d7fd536b1191a4a6f3"}],"sha":"eb2517889143b36e2c6520ca1c799b59d917bd02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commits/eb2517889143b36e2c6520ca1c799b59d917bd02"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109461996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NathanNeurotic","id":109461996,"login":"NathanNeurotic","node_id":"U_kgDOBoZB7A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commits/7cd5cb200cf93051ff7e37d7fd536b1191a4a6f3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T20:43:19Z","email":"109461996+NathanNeurotic@users.noreply.github.com","name":"NathanNeurotic (Ripto)"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T20:43:19Z","email":"109461996+NathanNeurotic@users.noreply.github.com","name":"NathanNeurotic (Ripto)"},"message":"fix(shell): Rust supervisor recovery hardening — 4 audit fixes (v10.38.190)\n\nAudit batch C (src-tauri). Fix locations adjusted from the audit''s\nsuggestions where they''d have regressed behavior:\n\n- H12: intentional_kill leaked across a generation bump (old watchdog\n  retired on the generation gate before consuming it), so a later\n  genuine crash of the fresh server was misread as intentional and never\n  respawned -> dead server. Cleared on every successful spawn, AFTER the\n  child is live (not at boot_sequence top, which would race the boot\n  window''s child=None check and miscount a crash).\n- M22: respawn_attempts only reset after HEALTHY_RESET_SEC uptime, so a\n  manual restart after CRASH_GAVE_UP inherited the saturated counter and\n  re-gave-up on the first crash. Reset in kill_child (covers restart/\n  install) + retry_spawn — NOT in boot_sequence (the audit''s suggestion),\n  which is shared by crash-respawn and would defeat the crash-loop budget.\n- M21: install_ml_deps/install_torch_variant spawned the post-install\n  respawn AFTER a `?` that returned early on a JoinError (task panic),\n  leaving the just-killed sidecar dead. Respawn is now unconditional;\n  join error propagates after.\n- M20: try_start_docker_desktop wrapped its docker info/--version in the\n  bounded docker_daemon_up (12s) / run_capture_within (10s) runners so a\n  half-started Docker Desktop / WSL2 backend can''t hang the probe forever.\n\ncargo check clean; preflight 8/0. Desktop-shell/Rust — next installer\nrebuild only, not self-update.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6b396941c666731e34e4c032ab91a9db59138144","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/git/trees/6b396941c666731e34e4c032ab91a9db59138144"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/git/commits/7cd5cb200cf93051ff7e37d7fd536b1191a4a6f3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109461996?v=4","events