DiscordBot/commit/e58982c1ad0ad9cfa5139f7108f086e238b5e1b6","sha":"e58982c1ad0ad9cfa5139f7108f086e238b5e1b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commits/e58982c1ad0ad9cfa5139f7108f086e238b5e1b6"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commit/6c82455ae42c3358d40d534e32d5ab77610cfa3f","sha":"6c82455ae42c3358d40d534e32d5ab77610cfa3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commits/6c82455ae42c3358d40d534e32d5ab77610cfa3f"}],"sha":"7a35f53e86e52711e44bf9a6b4dca42f222a7ec9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commits/7a35f53e86e52711e44bf9a6b4dca42f222a7ec9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109461996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NathanNeurotic","id":109461996,"login":"NathanNeurotic","node_id":"U_kgDOBoZB7A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commits/6c82455ae42c3358d40d534e32d5ab77610cfa3f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T18:54:31Z","email":"109461996+NathanNeurotic@users.noreply.github.com","name":"NathanNeurotic (Ripto)"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T18:54:31Z","email":"109461996+NathanNeurotic@users.noreply.github.com","name":"NathanNeurotic (Ripto)"},"message":"fix(bot): graceful handling when the AI server drops the connection mid-reply (v10.38.187)\n\nA reply got \"SeekDeep request failed / Error: / fetch failed\" with a\nmisleading \"Model Used: local command (no AI model)\" footer when the\nlocal AI server crashed/restarted ~70s into generating (socket reset,\nnot a timeout — chat timeout is 300s). The circuit breaker only\nsuppresses this after 3 straight failures, so a one-off transient drop\nalways hit the scary public wall.\n\n- New seekdeepIsServerUnreachableError(): classifies transport-level\n  failures (undici \"fetch failed\", ECONNRESET/REFUSED/etc, UND_ERR_*\n  socket errors, AbortError, and postLocal''s timeout wrapper) as\n  \"server unreachable\", while a real HTTP 4xx/5xx-with-detail is NOT\n  (keeps its diagnostic message so genuine bugs stay visible).\n- Message + slash chat paths now reply to a transient drop with one\n  friendly line (\"server may be restarting — try again\") instead of the\n  multi-line wall; fall back to the existing circuit-open 🔌 reaction.\n- seekdeepShouldHideCommandFooter() now suppresses the footer on failure\n  replies, so a failed request never reports a bogus generation time /\n  \"local command\" model.\n- 14 new smoke assertions (722 -> 736); server /chat verified to run in\n  FastAPI''s threadpool (sync def), so generation does not block the\n  event loop — the drop was a genuine server crash/restart, not a wedge.\n\nBot-side; takes effect on the next bot restart.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c2fac806ec06dec0859c7508c0665aa8256e3c71","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/git/trees/c2fac806ec06dec0859c7508c0665aa8256e3c71"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/git/commits/6c82455ae42c3358d40d534e32d5ab77610cfa3f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109461996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NathanNeurotic","id":109461996,"login":"NathanNeurotic","node_id":"U_kgDOBoZB7A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commit/6c82455ae42c3358d40d534e32d5ab77610cfa3f","node_id":"C_kwDOSly7ZdoAKDZjODI0NTVhZTQyYzMzNThkNDBkNTM0ZTMyZDVhYjc3NjEwY2ZhM2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commit/e58982c1ad0ad9cfa5139f7108f086e238b5e1b6","sha":"e58982c1ad0ad9cfa5139f7108f086e238b5e1b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commits/e58982c1ad0ad9cfa5139f7108f086e238b5e1b6"}],"sha":"6c82455ae42c3358d40d534e32d5ab77610cfa3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commits/6c82455ae42c3358d40d534e32d5ab77610cfa3f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109461996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nat