c3efaa87b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commits/1e665db9b755606af3fd1eef78421b2c3efaa87b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109461996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NathanNeurotic","id":109461996,"login":"NathanNeurotic","node_id":"U_kgDOBoZB7A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commits/6839b0843689a170d3a96b927e2bd4d27cbaf913/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T11:48:40Z","email":"109461996+NathanNeurotic@users.noreply.github.com","name":"NathanNeurotic (Ripto)"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T11:48:40Z","email":"109461996+NathanNeurotic@users.noreply.github.com","name":"NathanNeurotic (Ripto)"},"message":"feat(gui): Safe mode — a near-zero-background FX tier below Lite (v10.38.184)\n\nThe topnav FX toggle now cycles Full -> Lite -> Safe. Lite already drops the\nanimated background + blur (idle GPU/CPU). Safe goes further: it PAUSES the live\nevent bus (events.js). That''s the high-leverage part — the live WS is what makes\nthe SERVER''s tick loop run (nvidia-smi / ollama / HF-cache probes every few\nseconds) and what fans out the launcher/gpu status pumps, so with no GUI\nsubscriber the server tick loop idles itself and the app does almost no\nbackground work. App-wide (every page loads events.js -> one WS), so the bus\npause idles the server regardless of which page is open.\n\nEverything stays functional: chat, playground, all pages load on open, manual\nrefresh works, Discord unaffected. Only the live dashboards stop auto-ticking;\nthe live pill shows PAUSED and a corner badge marks the mode so static panes\nread as intentional.\n\nImplementation:\n- nav.js: FX toggle is now a 3-state cycle; persists seekdeep.safeMode; applies\n  body.sd-safe (+ sd-lite for the visual cuts); exposes window.SeekDeepSafeMode;\n  dispatches seekdeep:fxmode (same-window) + storage event (cross-window). Live\n  pill gains a ''paused'' state.\n- events.js: connect() no-ops when safe mode is on (emits _paused); applyMode()\n  closes/reopens the bus on toggle flips (custom event + cross-window storage).\n- styles.css: body.sd-safe corner badge (pointer-events:none).\n\nPersisted like the Lite choice. GUI-only -> GUI self-update. preflight 8/0.\n(Follow-up: gate the standalone per-page pollers on Control Center etc. via\nwindow.SeekDeepSafeMode — the bus pause already idles the dominant cost.)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"78738221c98588c83e0334e6f46ee703db3ecc95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/git/trees/78738221c98588c83e0334e6f46ee703db3ecc95"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/git/commits/6839b0843689a170d3a96b927e2bd4d27cbaf913","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109461996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NathanNeurotic","id":109461996,"login":"NathanNeurotic","node_id":"U_kgDOBoZB7A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commit/6839b0843689a170d3a96b927e2bd4d27cbaf913","node_id":"C_kwDOSly7ZdoAKDY4MzliMDg0MzY4OWExNzBkM2E5NmI5MjdlMmJkNGQyN2NiYWY5MTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commit/00398a7b6666604a7331e60ea98915cdd9ac3701","sha":"00398a7b6666604a7331e60ea98915cdd9ac3701","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commits/00398a7b6666604a7331e60ea98915cdd9ac3701"}],"sha":"6839b0843689a170d3a96b927e2bd4d27cbaf913","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commits/6839b0843689a170d3a96b927e2bd4d27cbaf913"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109461996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NathanNeurotic","id":109461996,"login":"NathanNeurotic","node_id":"U_kgDOBoZB7A","organizations_url":"https://ap