rl":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commits/5d5fd541fd8d94cdd7b34366f27974097e564f33"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109461996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NathanNeurotic","id":109461996,"login":"NathanNeurotic","node_id":"U_kgDOBoZB7A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commits/fe4a4cce7187ab8f2c4432f1027ad53369beb517/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T02:02:58Z","email":"109461996+NathanNeurotic@users.noreply.github.com","name":"NathanNeurotic (Ripto)"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T02:02:58Z","email":"109461996+NathanNeurotic@users.noreply.github.com","name":"NathanNeurotic (Ripto)"},"message":"fix(server): tick-loop review follow-ups — lock service-state, TTL-cache the HF scan (v10.38.181)\n\nTwo Gemini follow-ups on the #222 tick-loop wedge fix:\n\n1. THREAD-SAFETY. Now that _build_launchers_tick_payload runs in a worker thread\n   (asyncio.to_thread), _emit_state_change_if_any''s read-modify-write of the\n   shared _LAST_SERVICE_STATE could race the launcher state machine''s writes\n   (_end_transition''s pop, etc.). Added _LAST_SERVICE_STATE_LOCK around the\n   get->set and the pop; the change event is published OUTSIDE the lock.\n\n2. STOP RE-SCANNING THE HF CACHE EVERY TICK. The stats provider ran\n   _safe_scan_hf_cache (whole-cache scan, tens of seconds on a big cache) on\n   every stats tick. Even off the event loop that''s real idle CPU/IO, and since\n   the tick loop awaits providers sequentially a slow stats scan could still\n   delay the faster gpu/health ticks. The HF scan is now TTL-cached\n   (_cached_hf_scan_for_stats, 300s — cache size changes slowly), so the stats\n   provider stays fast. This addresses Gemini''s \"slow provider starves others\"\n   at the root (make stats fast) rather than refactoring the just-stabilized\n   loop into concurrent create_task fire-and-forget — lower risk on a hot path,\n   and it also cuts idle load (ties into the GUI-idle-drain thread).\n\nServer-side only -> self-update. preflight 8/0, gui-smoke (main venv) 279/0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1a09e418b5214c2b55d6394ee8591cddfe096314","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/git/trees/1a09e418b5214c2b55d6394ee8591cddfe096314"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/git/commits/fe4a4cce7187ab8f2c4432f1027ad53369beb517","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109461996?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NathanNeurotic","id":109461996,"login":"NathanNeurotic","node_id":"U_kgDOBoZB7A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanNeurotic","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commit/fe4a4cce7187ab8f2c4432f1027ad53369beb517","node_id":"C_kwDOSly7ZdoAKGZlNGE0Y2NlNzE4N2FiOGYyYzQ0MzJmMTAyN2FkNTMzNjliZWI1MTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commit/70ebdf6f4039622af7fabdef472d360d1c2b78b9","sha":"70ebdf6f4039622af7fabdef472d360d1c2b78b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commits/70ebdf6f4039622af7fabdef472d360d1c2b78b9"}],"sha":"fe4a4cce7187ab8f2c4432f1027ad53369beb517","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commits/fe4a4cce7187ab8f2c4432f1027ad53369beb517"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/NathanNeurotic/SeekDeep-DiscordBot/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=5dfbaa2d687b12698812b00c24d8fb91f8b804b3&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T16%3A25%3A07.628Z"}');
