, msw, cypress, playwright at root\n- TASK-6.2: Unit tests for CatalogMapper (6 tests), OrderMapper (6 tests), VALID_TRANSITIONS state machine (8 tests)\n- TASK-6.3: MSW handlers/server scaffolding in order-mfe; jest.globals.js polyfill for jsdom\n- TASK-6.4: Component tests — RestaurantCard (8), CartDrawer (5), useCreateOrder (3), RestaurantList (4), RestaurantPanel (4), DocsPortal (2)\n- TASK-6.5: Cypress config + fixtures + checkout-flow E2E test in shell\n- TASK-6.6: Playwright config at root + accessibility spec with axe-core\n- Fix DocsPortal.tsx TS errors (Record<string,boolean>, Record<string,FC>, mainRef type)\n- Add jest test script to bff; EventSource mock in panel-mfe jest setup\n\nTotal: 46 unit/component tests passing across 7 packages\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"30784916bf222cf32c6b0899b81f82da71c62216","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/priscilla-morimitsu/delivery-app/git/trees/30784916bf222cf32c6b0899b81f82da71c62216"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/priscilla-morimitsu/delivery-app/git/commits/a80deb7c8d32bca07f81d2cb54193840e7f6a0cc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81304954?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/priscilla-morimitsu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/priscilla-morimitsu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/priscilla-morimitsu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/priscilla-morimitsu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/priscilla-morimitsu","id":81304954,"login":"priscilla-morimitsu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMzA0OTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/priscilla-morimitsu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/priscilla-morimitsu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/priscilla