JulioCRFilho"},"message":"feat: add system prompt defining MDDD protocol\n\nAdd a comprehensive system prompt that establishes the Mermaid Diagram Driven Development (MDDD) protocol. This prompt includes a state diagram, co-location architecture tree, parent interaction logic, behavioral framework matrix, and anti-hallucination guardrails. The protocol guides the engineering agent to use visual topologies and truth tables, eliminating text-based specification ambiguity and enforcing spec-first, full-file output rules.","tree":{"sha":"58a25a0fc97bd83a53db3343078590bf1d83adbf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/byte-od/mermaid-diagram-driven-development/git/trees/58a25a0fc97bd83a53db3343078590bf1d83adbf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/byte-od/mermaid-diagram-driven-development/git/commits/1ca5fba49bd48796bdba2247e6ef981f94882bff","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47756842?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/byte-od/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/byte-od/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/byte-od/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/byte-od/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/byte-od","id":47756842,"login":"byte-od","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzU2ODQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/byte-od/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/byte-od/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/byte-od/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/byte-od/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/byte-od/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/byte-od","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/byte-od/mermaid-diagram-driven-development/commit/1ca5fba49bd48796bdba2247e6ef981f