,"message":"feat(cli): add auto-repair rule for missing spec files in audit prompt\n\nAdded a new rule to the audit prompt instructing the system to auto-generate a co-located `.spec.md` file when a production file (e.g., `.dart`) is found without one. The auto-generated spec must include `SPEC_VERSION`, a `stateDiagram-v2`, and a decision matrix if conditional branches exist. Also bumped the CLI version from 1.0.12 to 1.0.13.","tree":{"sha":"f2fe5441e9bc6d8f6c0c236850121ad40c870860","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/byte-od/mermaid-diagram-driven-development/git/trees/f2fe5441e9bc6d8f6c0c236850121ad40c870860"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/byte-od/mermaid-diagram-driven-development/git/commits/e5d7fdf5ec0eb8ec9ad5a4d367861076e2974b6a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47756842?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/byte-od/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/byte-od/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/byte-od/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/byte-od/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/byte-od","id":47756842,"login":"byte-od","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzU2ODQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/byte-od/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/byte-od/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/byte-od/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/byte-od/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/byte-od/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/byte-od","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/byte-od/mermaid-diagram-driven-development/commit/e5d7fdf5ec0eb8ec9ad5a4d367861076e2974b6a","node_id":"C_kwDOSl5mtdoAKGU1ZDdmZGY1ZWMwZWI4ZWM5YWQ1YTRkMzY3ODYxMDc2ZTI5NzRiNmE","