":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Steven0414/tractor-store-frontend/commits/a9dd081405a4e002bcff5062c36230788e43f2be/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-24T00:40:50Z","email":"steven@pop-os.localdomain","name":"Steven"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-24T00:40:50Z","email":"steven@pop-os.localdomain","name":"Steven"},"message":"feat(mfe-explore): implement Historia 1 - Catálogo y Tiendas\n\n- Initialize Angular 19 standalone project (mfe-explore)\n- Add lazy-loaded routes: HomePage (/), CategoryPage (/category/:filter), StoresPage (/stores)\n- Create CatalogStore with Angular Signals (WritableSignal state, computed selectors, actions)\n- Create CatalogService consuming REST contracts: GET /api/catalog/home, GET /api/catalog/categories/{filter}, GET /api/catalog/stores\n- Implement HomeComponent with hero banner, featured categories and products\n- Implement CategoryComponent with classic/autonomous/all filter bar and products grid\n- Implement StoresComponent with real-time search by name/city\n- Implement Header and Footer standalone components (global layout)\n- Add provideHttpClient(withFetch()) and withComponentInputBinding() to app config\n- Add global styles with responsive layout, cards grid, loading/error states\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"4c9e9bf8e43ba37df36d5f0ec84397bce3af352c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Steven0414/tractor-store-frontend/git/trees/4c9e9bf8e43ba37df36d5f0ec84397bce3af352c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Steven0414/tractor-store-frontend/git/commits/a9dd081405a4e002bcff5062c36230788e43f2be","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Steven0414/tractor-store-frontend/commit/a9dd081405a4e002bcff5062c36230788e43f2be","node_id":"C_kwDOSmDgB9oAKGE5ZGQwODE0MDVhNGUwMDJiY2ZmNTA2MmMzNjIzMDc4OGU0M2YyYmU","parents":[],"sha":"a