491544f23b09be187978d610abc968"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redefynliving/MatchbyBirth/commits/d9301e0d1b75525e43e1706e4a65f43bd3d19e30/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T07:02:42Z","email":"bot@matchbybirth.com","name":"Blog Automation"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T07:03:03Z","email":"bot@matchbybirth.com","name":"Blog Automation"},"message":"fix(seo): replace catch-all SPA fallback with real 404 page\n\nRemove { source: /(.*)/, destination: /index.html } from vercel.json\nso unknown URLs return proper 404s instead of serving the homepage\nshell with homepage canonical. This was the root cause of 142 soft 404s\nin Google Search Console.\n\nWire a /404 page into the SSG pipeline with noindex,nofollow robots\nmeta and a canonical to /404, add a /404 rewrite, and set\nX-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow, noarchive on /404.\n\nAffected URLs like /blog/moon-signs-intro, /blog/numerology-1,\n/blog/relationships-love, /blog/sign-guide-2 (not pre-rendered,\nnot in sitemap) now 404 cleanly instead of being soft 404s.\n\nNo existing pages affected — all working routes have explicit\nrewrites or pre-rendered HTML and are untouched.","tree":{"sha":"372768efad3e21fbde342f7dd25a38196a376c34","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redefynliving/MatchbyBirth/git/trees/372768efad3e21fbde342f7dd25a38196a376c34"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redefynliving/MatchbyBirth/git/commits/d9301e0d1b75525e43e1706e4a65f43bd3d19e30","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/redefynliving/MatchbyBirth/commit/d9301e0d1b75525e43e1706e4a65f43bd3d19e30","node_id":"C_kwDOSmN8wtoAKGQ5MzAxZTBkMWI3NTUyNWU0M2UxNzA2ZTRhNjVmNDNiZDNkMTllMzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/redefynliving/MatchbyBirth/commit/764955d5d83f664b3c14adb1f1f60fb79d6c83a6","sha":"764955d5d83f664b3c14adb1f1f60fb79d6c83a6","url":"https://api.githu