"Nyk"},"message":"fix: improve installation, Docker gateway connectivity, and error reporting\n\nAddresses #491, #492, #493.\n\n- Detect better-sqlite3 NODE_MODULE_VERSION mismatch at startup with\n  actionable error message instead of generic \"Internal server error\"\n- Add postinstall check in package.json to catch native module issues\n- Add pnpm rebuild better-sqlite3 step to install.sh\n- Surface native module errors in /api/status?action=health endpoint\n\n- Treat Docker-internal hostnames (host.docker.internal, host-gateway,\n  172.x bridge IPs) as non-browser-reachable in gateway URL resolution,\n  so browser WebSocket connects to the correct host\n- Update docker-compose.yml: use host.docker.internal instead of\n  host-gateway, add documented OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_HOST/PORT env vars\n- Add standalone Docker Compose profile for gateway-free deployments\n\n- Restructure .env.example with deployment-mode sections (Local, Docker,\n  Server/VPS, Standalone) explaining the two gateway variable sets\n- Add gateway debug logging when falling back to openclaw.json\n- Add troubleshooting section to README and docs/deployment.md\n- Add PR #487 routes to API contract parity ignore list","tree":{"sha":"05fd0aa4e86bf4c5fa1b10df641bba338a9ef67d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbergo/mission-control-plus/git/trees/05fd0aa4e86bf4c5fa1b10df641bba338a9ef67d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbergo/mission-control-plus/git/commits/4eda03a66ed4ac4c89edfe73d4bcefe976098d44","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93952610?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0xN