vent to audit trail\n  - Hints toward agent-scoped keys for least-privilege\n\nFR-D3: Add durable spawn history persistence\n  - New migration 043_spawn_history with indexed table\n  - spawn-history.ts with recordSpawnStart/Finish, getSpawnHistory,\n    getSpawnStats functions\n  - Replaces log-scraping fallback with DB-backed tracking\n\nFR-D4: Document rate-limit backend strategy\n  - Current in-memory Map approach documented\n  - Pluggable backend plan for multi-instance (Redis, SQLite WAL)\n  - Per-agent rate limiter details documented\n\nAlso fixes MCP test type annotation (content: string → any).","tree":{"sha":"90bfad83e120f4f5c30d9beea760cf13eb0558d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbergo/mission-control-plus/git/trees/90bfad83e120f4f5c30d9beea760cf13eb0558d3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbergo/mission-control-plus/git/commits/f12aac13c3fd8fc76d989463e6312adf534a82b9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93952610?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0xNyk","id":93952610,"login":"0xNyk","node_id":"U_kgDOBZmaYg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mbergo/mission-control-plus/commit/f12aac13c3fd8fc76d98946