thub.com/repos/baymaxLeee/monorepo/commits/6d6917f02f5d2ee4645a934d59164e1f8160a169/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T06:54:20Z","email":"baymaxlee.001@bytedance.com","name":"baymaxlee.001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T06:54:20Z","email":"baymaxlee.001@bytedance.com","name":"baymaxlee.001"},"message":"fix(iam): quote reserved-word \"User\" join alias in login lookup\n\nUserByAccount''s raw WHERE referenced the GORM belongs-to alias unquoted\n(`User.account`); USER is a reserved word in PostgreSQL, so the query\nfailed with SQLSTATE 42601 and login swallowed it into a 401. MySQL\ntolerated the unquoted alias.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"925339ecded55b0188e1403f246bdc791b2dda83","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baymaxLeee/monorepo/git/trees/925339ecded55b0188e1403f246bdc791b2dda83"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baymaxLeee/monorepo/git/commits/6d6917f02f5d2ee4645a934d59164e1f8160a169","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/baymaxLeee/monorepo/commit/6d6917f02f5d2ee4645a934d59164e1f8160a169","node_id":"C_kwDOSmRKmtoAKDZkNjkxN2YwMmY1ZDJlZTQ2NDVhOTM0ZDU5MTY0ZTFmODE2MGExNjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/baymaxLeee/monorepo/commit/fec97c64684ae53d05455168b1538e07abe10da6","sha":"fec97c64684ae53d05455168b1538e07abe10da6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baymaxLeee/monorepo/commits/fec97c64684ae53d05455168b1538e07abe10da6"}],"sha":"6d6917f02f5d2ee4645a934d59164e1f8160a169","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baymaxLeee/monorepo/commits/6d6917f02f5d2ee4645a934d59164e1f8160a169"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baymaxLeee/monorepo/commits/fec97c64684ae53d05455168b1538e07abe10da6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T06:00:55Z","email":"baymaxlee.001@bytedance.com","name":"baymaxlee.001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T06:00:55Z","email":"baymaxlee.001@bytedance.com","name":"baymaxlee.001"},"message":"chore(infra): rename shared postgres container/service to postgres\n\nThe shared Postgres instance is no longer workflow-only (all business DBs\nwere consolidated onto it in ADR-0029), so drop the workflow- prefix:\ncontainer_name monorepo-workflow-postgres -> monorepo-postgres, compose\nservice/hostname workflow-postgres -> postgres, volume workflow_postgres_data\n-> postgres_data. Update dev/prod compose, scripts (incl. rename\nwait-for-workflow-postgres.sh -> wait-for-postgres.sh), justfile, and\ncurrent-behavior docs. Workflow World''s own workflow user/db and the\nworkflow-postgres-bootstrap.sh setup (npx workflow-postgres-setup) keep\ntheir workflow-specific names.\n\nVolume rename is destructive (fresh empty volume on next up); acceptable\nin demo phase, no data migration.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"1fcc2c147306230fd85ff1f9d7a3a880789b94b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baymaxLeee/monorepo/git/trees/1fcc2c147306230fd85ff1f9d7a3a880789b94b4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baymaxLeee/monorepo/git/commits/fec97c64684ae53d05455168b1538e07abe10da6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/baymaxLeee/monorepo/commit/fec97c64684ae53d05455168b1538e07abe10da6","node_id":"C_kwDOSmRKmtoAKGZlYzk3YzY0Njg0YWU1M2QwNTQ1NTE2OGIxNTM4ZTA3YWJlMTBkYTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/baymaxLeee/monorepo/commit/ea5a8a8219bd82ba7a55063740e475a14e6327e2","sha":"ea5a8a8219bd82ba7a55063740e475a14e6327e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baymaxLeee/monorepo/commits/ea5a8a8219bd82ba7a55063740e475a14e6327e2"}],"sha":"fec97c64684ae53d05455168b1538e07abe10da6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baymaxLeee/monorepo/commits/fec97c64684ae53d05455168b1538e07abe10da6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baymaxLeee/monorepo/commits/ea5a8a8219bd82ba7a55063740e475a14e6327e2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T05:44:59Z","email":"baymaxlee.001@bytedance.com","name":"baymaxlee.001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T05:44:59Z","email":"baymaxlee.001@bytedance.com","name":"baymaxlee.001"},"message":"refactor(db): consolidate business databases from MySQL onto shared Postgres\n\nMigrate the 6 MySQL business DBs (gateway, iam, admin, telemetry, chat,\nexecutor) onto the existing shared Postgres instance and drop MySQL. See\ndocs/ADR/0029.\n\n- gateway: remove its unused DB (stateless; Redis only)\n- iam: GORM postgres + pgx; unique conflict via SQLSTATE 23505 + name\n- admin/telemetry: SQLAlchemy asyncpg; telemetry upsert -> ON CONFLICT\n- chat/executor: Drizzle postgres-js; upserts -> onConflict*/JSONB/timestamptz\n- translate the 26 MySQL migrations to Postgres (per-file, version axis kept)\n- unify migrations under scripts/db-migrate.sh (single-txn DDL + version bump,\n  per-service login role, least-privilege); only knowledge installs pgvector\n- single-vps db-init: network psql image, fold in knowledge, drop mysql-init\n- k8s/compose/scripts/docs updated; remove wait-for-mysql.sh + knowledge migrate.py\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"31230346c8daeac46f709a43fbe3c6076819de5a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baymaxLeee/monorepo/git/trees/31230346c8daeac46f709a43fbe3c6076819de5a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baymaxLeee/monorepo/git/commits/ea5a8a8219bd82ba7a55063740e475a14e6327e2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/baymaxLeee/monorepo/commit/ea5a8a8219bd82ba7a55063740e475a14e6327e2","node_id":"C_kwDOSmRKmtoAKGVhNWE4YTgyMTliZDgyYmE3YTU1MDYzNzQwZTQ3NWExNGU2MzI3ZTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/baymaxLeee/monorepo/commit/94059223664d439848fa0750243e929715a4bb4a","sha":"94059223664d439848fa0750243e929715a4bb4a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baymaxLeee/monorepo/commits/94059223664d439848fa0750243e929715a4bb4a"}],"sha":"ea5a8a8219bd82ba7a55063740e475a14e6327e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baymaxLeee/monorepo/commits/ea5a8a8219bd82ba7a55063740e475a14e6327e2"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baymaxLeee/monorepo/commits/94059223664d439848fa0750243e929715a4bb4a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T04:05:37Z","email":"baymaxlee.001@bytedance.com","name":"baymaxlee.001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T04:05:37Z","email":"baymaxlee.001@bytedance.com","name":"baymaxlee.001"},"message":"fix","tree":{"sha":"167133450cd508878a7d70ff615c6db3a873fc6c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baymaxLeee/monorepo/git/trees/167133450cd508878a7d70ff615c6db3a873fc6c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baymaxLeee/monorepo/git/commits/94059223664d439848fa0750243e929715a4bb4a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/baymaxLeee/monorepo/commit/94059223664d439848fa0750243e929715a4bb4a","node_id":"C_kwDOSmRKmtoAKDk0MDU5MjIzNjY0ZDQzOTg0OGZhMDc1MDI0M2U5Mjk3MTVhNGJiNGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/baymaxLeee/monorepo/commit/e2b5304a0ab05373f598c1e5761936103cb6dd35","sha":"e2b5304a0ab05373f598c1e5761936103cb6dd35","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baymaxLeee/monorepo/commits/e2b5304a0ab05373f598c1e5761936103cb6dd35"}],"sha":"94059223664d439848fa0750243e929715a4bb4a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baymaxLeee/monorepo/commits/94059223664d439848fa0750243e929715a4bb4a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baymaxLeee/monorepo/commits/e2b5304a0ab05373f598c1e5761936103cb6dd35/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T03:58:54Z","email":"baymaxlee.001@bytedance.com","name":"baymaxlee.001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"20