o/commits/c19666e594850aecd5a71fc16b81ce0f3e254232"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baymaxLeee/monorepo/commits/2a8ca787443e58112653188f41620559ac749703/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-27T08:40:13Z","email":"baymaxlee.001@bytedance.com","name":"baymaxlee.001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-27T08:40:13Z","email":"baymaxlee.001@bytedance.com","name":"baymaxlee.001"},"message":"fix(chat): make v1.7.0 migration idempotent so single-vps redeploy succeeds\n\nmysql-init.sh replays every migration on each `docker compose up`, but\nv1.7.0 used a raw `ALTER TABLE ... ADD COLUMN/ADD UNIQUE KEY` with no guard.\nOn the second deploy the columns already exist, so the ALTER fails with\n\"Duplicate column name\", db-init exits 1, and the deploy aborts.\n\nWrap each column/index add in the same information_schema guard pattern the\nother chat migrations (v1.1.0, v1.4.0) already use. Schema effect is\nunchanged; the migration is now safe to replay. Verified by applying it\ntwice against a fresh MySQL 8.4 (both runs exit 0).","tree":{"sha":"eb7a74f9d44b7ecb20deca4b33aa39737aaa44d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baymaxLeee/monorepo/git/trees/eb7a74f9d44b7ecb20deca4b33aa39737aaa44d7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baymaxLeee/monorepo/git/commits/2a8ca787443e58112653188f41620559ac749703","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/baymaxLeee/monorepo/commit/2a8ca787443e58112653188f41620559ac749703","node_id":"C_kwDOSmRKmtoAKDJhOGNhNzg3NDQzZTU4MTEyNjUzMTg4ZjQxNjIwNTU5YWM3NDk3MDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/baymaxLeee/monorepo/commit/90e80a63ffbc0fcf03ba6d38ec00560e84e9e893","sha":"90e80a63ffbc0fcf03ba6d38ec00560e84e9e893","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baymaxLeee/monorepo/commits/90e80a63ffbc0fcf03ba6d38ec00560e84e9e893"}],"sha":"2a8ca787443e58112653188f41620559ac749703","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baymaxLeee/monorepo/commits/2a8ca787443e58112653188f41620559ac749703"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baymaxLeee/monorepo/commits/90e80a63ffbc0fcf03ba6d38ec00560e84e9e893/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-27T08:15:11Z","email":"baymaxlee.001@bytedance.com","name":"baymaxlee.001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-27T08:15:11Z","email":"baymaxlee.001@bytedance.com","name":"baymaxlee.001"},"message":"feat","tree":{"sha":"3e305560d682e267201b105d60cf467d57ea253f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baymaxLeee/monorepo/git/trees/3e305560d682e267201b105d60cf467d57ea253f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baymaxLeee/monorepo/git/commits/90e80a63ffbc0fcf03ba6d38ec00560e84e9e893","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/baymaxLeee/monorepo/commit/90e80a63ffbc0fcf03ba6d38ec00560e84e9e893","node_id":"C_kwDOSmRKmtoAKDkwZTgwYTYzZmZiYzBmY2YwM2JhNmQzOGVjMDA1NjBlODRlOWU4OTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/baymaxLeee/monorepo/commit/7dd7c3ef7a6ddda8f8043577d2e7a74f7e5799de","sha":"7dd7c3ef7a6ddda8f8043577d2e7a74f7e5799de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baymaxLeee/monorepo/commits/7dd7c3ef7a6ddda8f8043577d2e7a74f7e5799de"}],"sha":"90e80a63ffbc0fcf03ba6d38ec00560e84e9e893","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baymaxLeee/monorepo/commits/90e80a63ffbc0fcf03ba6d38ec00560e84e9e893"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baymaxLeee/monorepo/commits/7dd7c3ef7a6ddda8f8043577d2e7a74f7e5799de/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-27T08:08:17Z","email":"baymaxlee.001@bytedance.com","name":"baymaxlee.001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-27T08:08:17Z","email":"baymaxlee.001@bytedance.com","name":"baymaxlee.001"},"message":"fix(chat): bundle transport-ts deps into nitro output so prod chat boots\n\nThe single-VPS runtime image copies only `.output` (no node_modules), but\nnitro left `openapi-fetch` (a transitive dep of the source-only\n`@backend/transport-ts` workspace package) external, so the container\ncrash-looped with ERR_MODULE_NOT_FOUND. The gateway then failed DNS lookup\nfor `chat` and returned 502 on /api/chat-server/*.\n\n- nitro.config.ts: inline @backend/transport-ts + openapi-fetch; trace\n  @vercel/oidc (runtime-resolved, can''t be bundled)\n- Dockerfile: install chat with hoisted node-linker so nitro can resolve\n  and inline the workspace package''s transitive dep","tree":{"sha":"fd5ca643500c32912b7325682b3d9883786d4b67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baymaxLeee/monorepo/git/trees/fd5ca643500c32912b7325682b3d9883786d4b67"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baymaxLeee/monorepo/git/commits/7dd7c3ef7a6ddda8f8043577d2e7a74f7e5799de","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/baymaxLeee/monorepo/commit/7dd7c3ef7a6ddda8f8043577d2e7a74f7e5799de","node_id":"C_kwDOSmRKmtoAKDdkZDdjM2VmN2E2ZGRkYThmODA0MzU3N2QyZTdhNzRmN2U1Nzk5ZGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/baymaxLeee/monorepo/commit/b82ce7c071101d6d91df48a729cb2fbc7cb1b4fb","sha":"b82ce7c071101d6d91df48a729cb2fbc7cb1b4fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baymaxLeee/monorepo/commits/b82ce7c071101d6d91df48a729cb2fbc7cb1b4fb"}],"sha":"7dd7c3ef7a6ddda8f8043577d2e7a74f7e5799de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baymaxLeee/monorepo/commits/7dd7c3ef7a6ddda8f8043577d2e7a74f7e5799de"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baymaxLeee/monorepo/commits/b82ce7c071101d6d91df48a729cb2fbc7cb1b4fb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-27T07:26:23Z","email":"baymaxlee.001@bytedance.com","name":"baymaxlee.001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-27T07:26:23Z","email":"baymaxlee.001@bytedance.com","name":"baymaxlee.001"},"message":"feat","tree":{"sha":"ffcb500cd12001a52d2e258e411950d63080354d","url