/git/trees/bff286db59099c08e7ce419b13d7769ddd169ae1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baymaxLeee/monorepo/git/commits/004a02a80b35d5694c3ba9de88bfb96e7692e8a7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/baymaxLeee/monorepo/commit/004a02a80b35d5694c3ba9de88bfb96e7692e8a7","node_id":"C_kwDOSmRKmtoAKDAwNGEwMmE4MGIzNWQ1Njk0YzNiYTlkZTg4YmZiOTZlNzY5MmU4YTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/baymaxLeee/monorepo/commit/c4374955a99dcb9b4ba2824e7f2d50825aec8c5d","sha":"c4374955a99dcb9b4ba2824e7f2d50825aec8c5d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baymaxLeee/monorepo/commits/c4374955a99dcb9b4ba2824e7f2d50825aec8c5d"}],"sha":"004a02a80b35d5694c3ba9de88bfb96e7692e8a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baymaxLeee/monorepo/commits/004a02a80b35d5694c3ba9de88bfb96e7692e8a7"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baymaxLeee/monorepo/commits/c4374955a99dcb9b4ba2824e7f2d50825aec8c5d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-28T06:04:29Z","email":"baymaxlee.001@bytedance.com","name":"baymaxlee.001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-28T06:04:29Z","email":"baymaxlee.001@bytedance.com","name":"baymaxlee.001"},"message":"refactor(frontend): biome migration + FileWorkspace tailwind + trigger forwardRef\n\n- Migrate lint/format from ESLint+Prettier to Biome (single binary, faster)\n  - Add `apps/frontend/biome.json`; flip `useExhaustiveDependencies` off,\n    keep `useHookAtTopLevel` strict.\n  - Replace `pnpm lint` / `pnpm fmt` to `biome check` / `biome check --write`.\n- Restore narrow `useEffect` / `useCallback` / `useMemo` deps that were\n  over-broadened to satisfy Biome (XmindPreviewer, CodeEditor, FileWorkspace,\n  MarkdownEditor toolbar/editor/extensions, PdfPreviewer, Sidebar,\n  useHoverTrigger, platform layout). Adds inline comments at hot spots.\n- Revert route-level lazy back to react-router `lazy` (lazyPage / lazyRemote)\n  to keep navigation atomic; component-level `<Lazy>` stays for in-tree\n  code splitting.\n- Migrate FileWorkspace from `bemClassFactory` BEM strings to inline\n  Tailwind utilities (high-fidelity port from styles.css). Drop\n  `utils/bem.ts` and the dead `*-lazy-mask` / `*-state` aliases.\n- Fix `Function components cannot be given refs` warning when nesting\n  `asChild` triggers (e.g. TooltipTrigger > DropdownMenuTrigger > Button)\n  by wrapping all `*Trigger` exports in `forwardRef`: Tooltip, Popover,\n  DropdownMenu, HoverCard, Sheet, Dialog, Select.\n- Misc: zodResolver(schema as never) for zod 4 + hookform/resolvers 5\n  overload mismatch; biome-ignore for RegExp.exec idiom and ts-ignore\n  on simple-mind-map internal modules; `void _xxx` to keep MF eager\n  anchors un-treeshaken.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"8612a5e9223b7a075b7ec6eedc064aeba9ea7d39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baymaxLeee/monorepo/git/trees/8612a5e9223b7a075b7ec6eedc064aeba9ea7d39"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baymaxLeee/monorepo/git/commits/c4374955a99dcb9b4ba2824e7f2d50825aec8c5d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/baymaxLeee/monorepo/commit/c4374955a99dcb9b4ba2824e7f2d50825aec8c5d","node_id":"C_kwDOSmRKmtoAKGM0Mzc0OTU1YTk5ZGNiOWI0YmEyODI0ZTdmMmQ1MDgyNWFlYzhjNWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/baymaxLeee/monorepo/commit/18fd9cf12147f42b2978cb166b12b64aa7c7b99c","sha":"18fd9cf12147f42b2978cb166b12b64aa7c7b99c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baymaxLeee/monorepo/commits/18fd9cf12147f42b2978cb166b12b64aa7c7b99c"}],"sha":"c4374955a99dcb9b4ba2824e7f2d50825aec8c5d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baymaxLeee/monorepo/commits/c4374955a99dcb9b4ba2824e7f2d50825aec8c5d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baymaxLeee/monorepo/commits/18fd9cf12147f42b2978cb166b12b64aa7c7b99c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-28T03:42:19Z","email":"baymaxlee.001@bytedance.com","name":"baymaxlee.001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-28T03:42:19Z","email":"baymaxlee.001@bytedance.com","name":"baymaxlee.001"},"message":"chore(backend): version-bump cleanup + asyncmy cp314 build fix\n\n- Install build-essential in admin/telemetry Dockerfiles so asyncmy\n  0.2.11 (no cp314 wheel yet) can compile from sdist on\n  python:3.14.5-slim.\n- Drop 4 unused stub libs: auth_sdk, audit_sdk, observability, transport\n  (8-28 line placeholders, zero business imports).\n- Drop unused declared deps:\n  - alembic (project uses raw SQL via mysql-init.sh, not alembic)\n  - greenlet (transitive of sqlalchemy[asyncio])\n  - python-dotenv (pydantic-settings already reads .env via\n    SettingsConfigDict(env_file=\".env\"))\n- Fix justfile build-image: Python services need apps/backend as the\n  docker build context (not services/<svc>/), aligning with COPY paths\n  in their Dockerfiles.\n\nNet: 18 files, -304 lines, uv.lock -145 lines, 10 packages dropped.\nVerified: uv sync --frozen --no-dev passes for admin & telemetry,\nmain.py import smoke clean, ruff clean.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"29b28362091936608e41704cd412123c85864099","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baymaxLeee/monorepo/git/trees/29b28362091936608e41704cd412123c85864099"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baymaxLeee/monorepo/git/commits/18fd9cf12147f42b2978cb166b12b64aa7c7b99c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/baymaxLeee/monorepo/commit/18fd9cf12147f42b2978cb166b12b64aa7c7b99c","node_id":"C_kwDOSmRKmtoAKDE4ZmQ5Y2YxMjE0N2Y0MmIyOTc4Y2IxNjZiMTJiNjRhYTdjN2I5OWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/baymaxLeee/monorepo/commit/63d319b1ad7c456270c048ffc9fb8bb747111197","sha":"63d319b1ad7c456270c048ffc9fb8bb747111197","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baymaxLeee/monorepo/commits/63d319b1ad7c456270c048ffc9fb8bb747111197"}],"sha":"18fd9cf12147f42b2978cb166b12b64aa7c7b99c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baymaxLeee/monorepo/commits/18fd9cf12147f42b2978cb166b12b64aa7c7b99c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baymaxLeee/monorepo/commits/63d319b1ad7c456270c048ffc9fb8bb747111197/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-28T03:09:26Z","email":"baymaxlee.001@bytedance.com","name":"baymaxlee.001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-28T03:09:26Z","email":"baymaxlee.001@bytedance.com","name":"baymaxlee.001"},"message":"feat: update py & go version, rebuild images","tree":{"sha":"56abcf6b6991a3e3754a2c6b27e5c6abaf7d6b49","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baymaxLeee/monorepo/git/trees/56abcf6b6991a3e3754a2c6b27e5c6abaf7d6b49"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baymaxLeee/monorepo/git/commits/63d319b1ad7c456270c048ffc9fb8bb747111197","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/baymaxLeee/monorepo/commit/63d319b1ad7c456270c048ffc9fb8bb747111197","node_id":"C_kwDOSmRKmtoAKDYzZDMxOWIxYWQ3YzQ1NjI3MGMwNDhmZmM5ZmI4YmI3NDcxMTExOTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/baymaxLeee/monorepo/commit/9469407231119906a1694bc2a9deded5f87cb86e","sha":"9469407231119906a1694bc2a9deded5f87cb86e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baymaxLeee/monorepo/commits/9469407231119906a1694bc2a9deded5f87cb86e"}],"sha":"63d319b1ad7c456270c048ffc9fb8bb747111197","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baymaxLeee/monorepo/commits/63d319b1ad7c456270c048ffc9fb8bb747111197"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baymaxLeee/monorepo/commits/9469407231119906a1694bc2a9deded5f87cb86e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-27T09:58:52Z","email":"baymaxlee.001@bytedance.com","name":"baymaxlee.001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-27T09:58:52Z","email":"baymaxlee.001@bytedance.com","name":"baymaxlee.001"},"message":"refactor(components): drop compat shim, migrate to shadcn/ui + lucide\n\nReplaces all uses of the Arco compat layer (Button / Input / Select /\nTooltip / Trigger / Dropdown / Spin / Message + the @arco-iconbox alias\ntable + slotClassNameFactory) with native shadcn primitives, lucide-react\nicons and sonner toasts, then deletes packages/components/src/compat/* in\nits entirety.\n\nHighlights:\n\n- New components: Menu (lightweight visual menu — Menu / MenuItem /\n  MenuItemGroup / MenuLabel / MenuSeparator) and HoverCard wrapper.\n- High-fidelity rebuild of MarkdownEditor BlockMenu, BubbleToolbar,\n  TopToolbar, Toolbar (incl. AIPolishContent), LinkMenu, DragHandler,\n  TableSelector, Image extension and CodeBlock extension — inline\n  Tailwind translated 1:1 from the original Less rules.\n- BlockMenu \"+\" trigger + Popover popup + HoverCard subs (\"其他标题\",\n  table picker) match the legacy floating-menu styling.\n- AIPolishContent now uses shadcn Popover/Button/Tooltip and a\n  data-empty hook for the contentEditable placeholder.\n- Move slotClassNameFactory helper to utils/bem.ts as bemClassFactory.\n- Split admin ComponentsDemoPage into per-tab modules + DemoCard\n  wrapper so each component demo fills the remaining viewport height.\n- Hide native scrollbars (scrollbar-hide utility) across PdfPreviewer\n  and MarkdownEditor; narrow className typing on CodeEditor /\n  FileWorkspace / PdfPreviewer / XmindPreviewer.\n- styles.css cleanup: remove the markdown-editor BEM fall-back rules\n  (block-menu / drag-handle / table-selector / link-bubble-menu /\n  toolbar-* / table-menu-*) now that every consumer is inline.\n\n52 files changed, +3565 / -2675.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"a67f304f0cb508cb27d262e53c27e50301e57eeb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baymaxLeee/monorepo/git/trees/a67f304f0cb508cb27d262e53c27e50301e57eeb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ba