view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nobuenhombre/goxus/commits/80c55455bff16b7d4b9baf0f9786e55c1c7040d7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T17:17:05Z","email":"ivan.sukharev@siarion.net","name":"Ivan Sukharev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T17:17:05Z","email":"ivan.sukharev@siarion.net","name":"Ivan Sukharev"},"message":"feat: roles management dialog, role filter in users table, URL-backed query params\n\n    Backend:\n      - GET /api/v1/roles, POST/DELETE /api/v1/entity/user/:id/roles — new role\n        management endpoints (ListAllRoles, AssignUserRole, RevokeUserRole)\n      - ListUsers now returns user roles (user_with_role view)\n\n    Frontend (new):\n      - src/lib/role.ts — API client (fetchAllRoles, fetchUserRoles, assignUserRole, revokeUserRole)\n      - src/lib/permission.ts — Permission slug constants\n      - src/app/(dashboard)/users/roles-dialog.tsx — Roles management dialog\n        (checkbox list, dirty-state tracking, assign/revoke via API)\n      - e2e/nav-links-users-filters.spec.ts — E2E: sidebar/header links preserve filter params\n      - e2e/users-role-filter.spec.ts — E2E: role filter via combobox\n\n    Frontend (modified):\n      - Users page: URL-backed filters (q, status, email, roles, page, pageSize),\n        role column with coloured badges, role filter combobox, RolesDialog\n      - AppHeader + AppSidebar: removed /roles link, Users href embeds saved query\n      - UI components: cursor-pointer on ComboboxTrigger/Item, CommandItem,\n        DropdownMenuTrigger, SidebarMenuButton\n      - MSW handlers: added roles field to mock user response\n      - E2E tests refactored: dynamic test user creation, 8081 port, seed constants\n\n    Chore:\n      - playwright.config.ts: E2E port separation (8080→8081), NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL env\n      - Coverage: Go 12.5%→13.3% (domain/user 86.6%, rbac 97.3%),\n        TS 9.52%→7.35% (lib/ 43.87%, role.ts/permission.ts untested)","tree":{"