":"sawadasuiren@gmail.com","name":"sawa-zen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-01T03:47:33Z","email":"sawadasuiren@gmail.com","name":"sawa-zen"},"message":"feat: ステンシルバッファによるポータル型VR180表示\n\n映像球を巨大化(radius=500)し、小さな半球(radius=2)をステンシルマスクとして\nポータル構造にすることで、左右移動時の視差を解消する。\n深度バッファとrenderOrderの制御により、ポータル後方のオブジェクト遮蔽にも対応。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cb31f57719b15f4da6f63bee0cf29fadd427abea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sawa-zen/xrift-item-vr180/git/trees/cb31f57719b15f4da6f63bee0cf29fadd427abea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sawa-zen/xrift-item-vr180/git/commits/1482fdb29a155c82b4e6524cbb92870dd8a2cb89","verification":{"payload":"tree cb31f57719b15f4da6f63bee0cf29fadd427abea\nparent c722e8000841373bf7eb4621a230d87ded9c8466\nauthor sawa-zen <sawadasuiren@gmail.com> 1775015253 +0900\ncommitter sawa-zen <sawadasuiren@gmail.com> 1775015253 +0900\n\nfeat: ステンシルバッファによるポータル型VR180表示\n\n映像球を巨大化(radius=500)し、小さな半球(radius=2)をステンシルマスクとして\nポータル構造にすることで、左右移動時の視差を解消する。\n深度バッファとrenderOrderの制御により、ポータル後方のオブジェクト遮蔽にも対応。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQKVTm3Q7nPPZqH7kSujh8MBTKX\nj5yl3j8MmaSRg8tpwAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQFCDlkORc3IU4fDp2qZ9jktIJqdmZOFnwbehdAlvLeRhdVp07G0eGqwxLIwMal1jxA\nymHIq1rIBW8sbsWBuJggU=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-24T11:55:46Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3971271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sawa-zen","id":3971271,"login":"sawa-zen","node_id":"MDQ6VXN