om/users/sawa-zen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sawa-zen/xrift-item-vr180/commits/c722e8000841373bf7eb4621a230d87ded9c8466/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-31T15:31:19Z","email":"sawadasuiren@gmail.com","name":"sawa-zen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-31T15:31:19Z","email":"sawadasuiren@gmail.com","name":"sawa-zen"},"message":"feat: VR180 HLS配信環境構築（Cloudflare R2）\n\n- FFmpegでVR180素材をHLS変換（3840x1920, H.264 Level 5.1）\n- Cloudflare R2バケット（vr180-hls）にアップロード・CORS設定\n- video.loop = true でループ再生対応\n- Interactableを使った3D Play/Stopボタン追加\n- R2パブリックURL経由でHLSストリーム配信\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fb6a1d4b97cb279fcd64cbeb3a5e90ec140fe394","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sawa-zen/xrift-item-vr180/git/trees/fb6a1d4b97cb279fcd64cbeb3a5e90ec140fe394"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sawa-zen/xrift-item-vr180/git/commits/c722e8000841373bf7eb4621a230d87ded9c8466","verification":{"payload":"tree fb6a1d4b97cb279fcd64cbeb3a5e90ec140fe394\nauthor sawa-zen <sawadasuiren@gmail.com> 1774971079 +0900\ncommitter sawa-zen <sawadasuiren@gmail.com> 1774971079 +0900\n\nfeat: VR180 HLS配信環境構築（Cloudflare R2）\n\n- FFmpegでVR180素材をHLS変換（3840x1920, H.264 Level 5.1）\n- Cloudflare R2バケット（vr180-hls）にアップロード・CORS設定\n- video.loop = true でループ再生対応\n- Interactableを使った3D Play/Stopボタン追加\n- R2パブリックURL経由でHLSストリーム配信\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQKVTm3Q7nPPZqH7kSujh8MBTKX\nj5yl3j8MmaSRg8tpwAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQDyCx6yLj6lTQF68FIY4kJmtEzYRePODZSpeSFGCgHnqzAGU3jbXyeCfCLzzDMLMtN\n65x80+xDSXsnVIKdMxbwA=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-24T11:55:46Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3971271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/events{/priv