se,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commit/b390aee29b8de6afdfac0e7e4e8f0ba69b270dce","node_id":"C_kwDOSmd9G9oAKGIzOTBhZWUyOWI4ZGU2YWZkZmFjMGU3ZTRlOGYwYmE2OWIyNzBkY2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commit/87609191ac895f03b7fe86bcfe951c2066c5aca3","sha":"87609191ac895f03b7fe86bcfe951c2066c5aca3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commits/87609191ac895f03b7fe86bcfe951c2066c5aca3"}],"sha":"b390aee29b8de6afdfac0e7e4e8f0ba69b270dce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commits/b390aee29b8de6afdfac0e7e4e8f0ba69b270dce"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commits/87609191ac895f03b7fe86bcfe951c2066c5aca3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-24T09:23:37Z","email":"james@devdoneright.co.uk","name":"James Chapman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-24T09:23:37Z","email":"james@devdoneright.co.uk","name":"James Chapman"},"message":"Add Altair GraphQL client for authenticated API testing\n\nReplaces GraphiQL with Altair at /altair. Pre-configures the GraphQL\nendpoint and Auth0 environment variables so devs can paste a Bearer\ntoken from the host app and test authenticated queries.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"081b35d51a70dd3b01588e3026f63f2553a58145","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/git/trees/081b35d51a70dd3b01588e3026f63f2553a58145"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/git/commits/87609191ac895f03b7fe86bcfe951c2066c5aca3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commit/87609191ac895f03b7fe86bcfe951c2066c5aca3","node_id":"C_kwDOSmd9G9oAKDg3NjA5MTkxYWM4OTVmMDNiN2ZlODZiY2ZlOTUxYzIwNjZjNWFjYTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commit/ae2297c642516ca27d13aa396add4e1ec81db5b5","sha":"ae2297c642516ca27d13aa396add4e1ec81db5b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commits/ae2297c642516ca27d13aa396add4e1ec81db5b5"}],"sha":"87609191ac895f03b7fe86bcfe951c2066c5aca3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commits/87609191ac895f03b7fe86bcfe951c2066c5aca3"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commits/ae2297c642516ca27d13aa396add4e1ec81db5b5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-24T09:01:46Z","email":"james@devdoneright.co.uk","name":"James Chapman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-24T09:01:46Z","email":"james@devdoneright.co.uk","name":"James Chapman"},"message":"Pass audience to Auth0Provider to fix consent required error\n\nAuth0 requires the audience to be set at the provider level so the\ninitial login flow requests the correct scopes upfront. Without this,\ngetAccessTokenSilently throws \"Consent required\" on every silent\ntoken renewal.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a443d3f32a7d4e5913d003f5b0b5a1f9eea916c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/git/trees/a443d3f32a7d4e5913d003f5b0b5a1f9eea916c9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/git/commits/ae2297c642516ca27d13aa396add4e1ec81db5b5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commit/ae2297c642516ca27d13aa396add4e1ec81db5b5","node_id":"C_kwDOSmd9G9oAKGFlMjI5N2M2NDI1MTZjYTI3ZDEzYWEzOTZhZGQ0ZTFlYzgxZGI1YjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commit/55010d7615f91c39c5923d2acfaa3adfa1f8e1f8","sha":"55010d7615f91c39c5923d2acfaa3adfa1f8e1f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commits/55010d7615f91c39c5923d2acfaa3adfa1f8e1f8"}],"sha":"ae2297c642516ca27d13aa396add4e1ec81db5b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commits/ae2297c642516ca27d13aa396add4e1ec81db5b5"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commits/55010d7615f91c39c5923d2acfaa3adfa1f8e1f8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-24T09:01:40Z","email":"james@devdoneright.co.uk","name":"James Chapman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-24T09:01:40Z","email":"james@devdoneright.co.uk","name":"James Chapman"},"message":"Wire Auth0 token into GraphQL client via async requestMiddleware\n\ngraphqlClient accepts an async token getter and awaits it in\nrequestMiddleware, eliminating the race between TokenSync and the\nwidget''s first query. The host passes its token-bearing client to\nUsersWidget as a prop; the widget falls back to its own unauthenticated\nclient when running standalone.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6ca2f5ed87e2bf52959f4309f343c509447d79b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/git/trees/6ca2f5ed87e2bf52959f4309f343c509447d79b6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/git/commits/55010d7615f91c39c5923d2acfaa3adfa1f8e1f8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commit/55010d7615f91c39c5923d2acfaa3adfa1f8e1f8","node_id":"C_kwDOSmd9G9oAKDU1MDEwZDc2MTVmOTFjMzljNTkyM2QyYWNmYWEzYWRmYTFmOGUxZjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commit/12be65833de6b983d27cdb8810fb0b2510417186","sha":"12be65833de6b983d27cdb8810fb0b2510417186","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commits/12be65833de6b983d27cdb8810fb0b2510417186"}],"sha":"55010d7615f91c39c5923d2acfaa3adfa1f8e1f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commits/55010d7615f91c39c5923d2acfaa3adfa1f8e1f8"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commits/12be65833de6b983d27cdb8810fb0b2510417186/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-24T09:01:32Z","email":"james@devdoneright.co.uk","name":"James Chapman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-24T09:01:32Z","email":"james@devdoneright.co.uk","name":"James Chapman"},"message":"Add CORS support to backend via @fastify/cors\n\nAllows requests from http://localhost:3000 so the host app can reach\nthe GraphQL endpoint.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f0eec7ea5b3c9cc68786f85379a45d974acb8870","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/git/trees/f0eec7ea5b3c9cc68786f85379a45d974acb8870"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/git/commits/12be65833de6b983d27cdb8810fb0b2510417186","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commit/12be65833de6b983d27cdb8810fb0b2510417186","node_id":"C_kwDOSmd9G9oAKDEyYmU2NTgzM2RlNmI5ODNkMjdjZGI4ODEwZmIwYjI1MTA0MTcxODY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commit/ab43187dd30f7d88e35b1f4d99f76389f3c72459","sha":"ab43187dd30f7d88e35b1f4d99f76389f3c72459","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commits/ab43187dd30f7d88e35b1f4d99f76389f3c72459"}],"sha":"12be65833de6b983d27cdb8810fb0b2510417186","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commits/12be65833de6b983d27cdb8810fb0b2510417186"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commits/ab43187dd30f7d88e35b1f4d99f76389f3c72459/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-24T08:39:58Z","email":"james@devdoneright.co.uk","name":"James Chapman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-24T08:39:58Z","email":"james@devdoneright.co.uk","name":"James Chapman"},"message":"Wire Auth0 token into GraphQL client\n\nTokenSync component registers getAccessTokenSilently with the graphql\nclient on login and pre-fetches the token into a module-level cache.\nThe client''s requestMiddleware reads the cached token synchronously on\nevery request, injecting it as a Bearer header.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9140ec3c721ee0994213e4960c1ca162e8ff19cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/git/trees/9140ec3c721ee0994213e4960c1ca162e8ff19cc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/git/commits/ab43187dd30f7d88e35b1f4d99f76389f3c72459","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commit/ab43187dd30f7d88e35b1f4d99f76389f3c72459","node_id":"C_kwDOSmd9G9oAKGFiNDMxODdkZDMwZjdkODhlMzViMWY0ZDk5Zjc2Mzg5ZjNjNzI0NTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commit/eaeacdf96c91d83acb840889c024c4e3c22c6b76","sha":"eaeacdf96c91d83acb840889c024c4e3c22c6b76","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commits/eaeacdf96c91d83acb840889c024c4e3c22c6b76"}],"sha":"ab43187dd30f7d88e35b1f4d99f76389f3c72459","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commits/ab43187dd30f7d88e35b1f4d99f76389f3c72459"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commits/eaeacdf96c91d83acb840889c024c4e3c22c6b76/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-24T08:37:39Z","email":"james@devdoneright.co.uk","name":"James Chapman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-24T08:37:39Z","email":"james@devdoneright.co.uk","name":"James Chapman"},"message":"Update docs to reflect auth MFE and root dev workflow\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"36d3e6e887417e191d869d164e03922a8b51e8c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/git/trees/36d3e6e887417e191d869d164e03922a8b51e8c7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/git/commits/eaeacdf96c91d83acb840889c024c4e3c22c6b76","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commit/eaeacdf96c91d83acb840889c024c4e3c22c6b76","node_id":"C_kwDOSmd9G9oAKGVhZWFjZGY5NmM5MWQ4M2FjYjg0MDg4OWMwMjRjNGUzYzIyYzZiNzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commit/b0e2928955b03cdb60b4405faa5cb4eebe750878","sha":"b0e2928955b03cdb60b4405faa5cb4eebe750878","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commits/b0e2928955b03cdb60b4405faa5cb4eebe750878"}],"sha":"eaeacdf96c91d83acb840889c024c4e3c22c6b76","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commits/eaeacdf96c91d83acb840889c024c4e3c22c6b76"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commits/b0e2928955b03cdb60b4405faa5cb4eebe750878/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-24T08:30:27Z","email":"james@devdoneright.co.uk","name":"James Chapman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-24T08:30:27Z","email":"james@devdoneright.co.uk","name":"James Chapman"},"message":"Add root dev/build/typecheck scripts and fix sirv precompression\n\nAdds concurrently-based npm scripts at the root to start all three MFEs\nin one command. Also adds --no-brotli --no-gzip to sirv invocations —\nsirv was returning 404 for federation chunks because it looked for\npre-compressed .br files that don''t exist alongside the build output.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"db0e2ecb52134c8514141a5bf8a4226fe3cde1bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/git/trees/db0e2ecb52134c8514141a5bf8a4226fe3cde1bc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/git/commits/b0e2928955b03cdb60b4405faa5cb4eebe750878","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commit/b0e2928955b03cdb60b4405faa5cb4eebe750878","node_id":"C_kwDOSmd9G9oAKGIwZTI5Mjg5NTViMDNjZGI2MGI0NDA1ZmFhNWNiNGVlYmU3NTA4Nzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commit/9909364583b7b8118b497d2fa1f0e194ab38cf4d","sha":"9909364583b7b8118b497d2fa1f0e194ab38cf4d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commits/9909364583b7b8118b497d2fa1f0e194ab38cf4d"}],"sha":"b0e2928955b03cdb60b4405faa5cb4eebe750878","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commits/b0e2928955b03cdb60b4405faa5cb4eebe750878"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commits/9909364583b7b8118b497d2fa1f0e194ab38cf4d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-24T08:30:20Z","email":"james@devdoneright.co.uk","name":"James Chapman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-24T08:30:20Z","email":"james@devdoneright.co.uk","name":"James Chapman"},"message":"Wire auth MFE into host — guard app behind Auth0 login\n\nHost lazily loads auth/Provider and auth/LoginPage via federation.\nApp renders LoginPage when unauthenticated and the main content once\nlogged in. @auth0/auth0-react added as a federation singleton so the\nremote widget shares the same Auth0 context.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2f116f3738f1939ef27c64c71bc49d3eb209f852","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/git/trees/2f116f3738f1939ef27c64c71bc49d3eb209f852"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/git/commits/9909364583b7b8118b497d2fa1f0e194ab38cf4d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commit/9909364583b7b8118b497d2fa1f0e194ab38cf4d","node_id":"C_kwDOSmd9G9oAKDk5MDkzNjQ1ODNiN2I4MTE4YjQ5N2QyZmExZjBlMTk0YWIzOGNmNGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commit/4a39f2be50954c0bbeee1a4584e77f24e1217a78","sha":"4a39f2be50954c0bbeee1a4584e77f24e1217a78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commits/4a39f2be50954c0bbeee1a4584e77f24e1217a78"}],"sha":"9909364583b7b8118b497d2fa1f0e194ab38cf4d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commits/9909364583b7b8118b497d2fa1f0e194ab38cf4d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commits/4a39f2be50954c0bbeee1a4584e77f24e1217a78/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-24T08:30:13Z","email":"james@devdoneright.co.uk","name":"James Chapman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-24T08:30:13Z","email":"james@devdoneright.co.uk","name":"James Chapman"},"message":"Add auth microfrontend with Auth0 login\n\nNew ui/auth MFE (port 3002) exposes two federation modules: Provider\n(wraps Auth0Provider, accepts domain/clientId as props) and LoginPage\n(centered login button). Credentials are passed as props from the host\nso each app''s Vite env is the source of truth.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5af7c56038828b0b4d9ce1f41666cf8b2faa2fc9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/git/trees/5af7c56038828b0b4d9ce1f41666cf8b2faa2fc9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/git/commits/4a39f2be50954c0bbeee1a4584e77f24e1217a78","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commit/4a39f2be50954c0bbeee1a4584e77f24e1217a78","node_id":"C_kwDOSmd9G9oAKDRhMzlmMmJlNTA5NTRjMGJiZWVlMWE0NTg0ZTc3ZjI0ZTEyMTdhNzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commit/2135176b70f7670baea25f53f47454c3a4d450de","sha":"2135176b70f7670baea25f53f47454c3a4d450de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commits/2135176b70f7670baea25f53f47454c3a4d450de"}],"sha":"4a39f2be50954c0bbeee1a4584e77f24e1217a78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commits/4a39f2be50954c0bbeee1a4584e77f24e1217a78"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commits/2135176b70f7670baea25f53f47454c3a4d450de/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-24T08:06:59Z","email":"james@devdoneright.co.uk","name":"James Chapman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-24T08:06:59Z","email":"james@devdoneright.co.uk","name":"James Chapman"},"message":"Fix Rollup resolution of graphql-request and @tanstack/react-query\n\nWhen Rollup bundles shared source files via the @ui/shared alias, it\nresolves imports relative to ui/shared/ which has no node_modules.\nExplicit vite aliases pin both packages to each app''s own node_modules,\nmirroring the tsconfig paths fix applied earlier.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a50ba72259c8229bc5d26511291fada3ae243356","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/git/trees/a50ba72259c8229bc5d26511291fada3ae243356"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/git/commits/2135176b70f7670baea25f53f47454c3a4d450de","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commit/2135176b70f7670baea25f53f47454c3a4d450de","node_id":"C_kwDOSmd9G9oAKDIxMzUxNzZiNzBmNzY3MGJhZWEyNWY1M2Y0NzQ1NGMzYTRkNDUwZGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commit/a2de4f392e949c3c9f7b55400186b2f78f9dfb6a","sha":"a2de4f392e949c3c9f7b55400186b2f78f9dfb6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commits/a2de4f392e949c3c9f7b55400186b2f78f9dfb6a"}],"sha":"2135176b70f7670baea25f53f47454c3a4d450de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commits/2135176b70f7670baea25f53f47454c3a4d450de"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commits/a2de4f392e949c3c9f7b55400186b2f78f9dfb6a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-24T08:06:03Z","email":"james@devdoneright.co.uk","name":"James Chapman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-24T08:06:03Z","email":"james@devdoneright.co.uk","name":"James Chapman"},"message":"Add TanStack Query + graphql-request infrastructure via @ui/shared\n\nWires up @tanstack/react-query and graphql-request as shared query\ninfrastructure: a GraphQL client factory, QueryProvider wrapper, and\nuseGraphQLQuery hook factory live in @ui/shared and are consumed by\nboth host and users apps. @tanstack/react-query is configured as a\nfederation singleton so the users widget can share the host''s QueryClient\nat runtime.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"33b0605072cd81dd1b938f8af6b0be6ceb4ba974","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/git/trees/33b0605072cd81dd1b938f8af6b0be6ceb4ba974"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/git/commits/a2de4f392e949c3c9f7b55400186b2f78f9dfb6a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commit/a2de4f392e949c3c9f7b55400186b2f78f9dfb6a","node_id":"C_kwDOSmd9G9oAKGEyZGU0ZjM5MmU5NDljM2M5ZjdiNTU0MDAxODZiMmY3OGY5ZGZiNmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commit/d00e0b1ac52daa8483689961951beb53c693d253","sha":"d00e0b1ac52daa8483689961951beb53c693d253","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commits/d00e0b1ac52daa8483689961951beb53c693d253"}],"sha":"a2de4f392e949c3c9f7b55400186b2f78f9dfb6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commits/a2de4f392e949c3c9f7b55400186b2f78f9dfb6a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commits/d00e0b1ac52daa8483689961951beb53c693d253/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-24T07:53:38Z","email":"james@devdoneright.co.uk","name":"James Chapman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-24T07:53:38Z","email":"james@devdoneright.co.uk","name":"James Chapman"},"message":"Update docs to reflect port changes and sirv dev workflow\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1320b84daf108c1634638c3597d73de6e669ff8f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/git/trees/1320b84daf108c1634638c3597d73de6e669ff8f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/git/commits/d00e0b1ac52daa8483689961951beb53c693d253","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commit/d00e0b1ac52daa8483689961951beb53c693d253","node_id":"C_kwDOSmd9G9oAKGQwMGUwYjFhYzUyZGFhODQ4MzY4OTk2MTk1MWJlYjUzYzY5M2QyNTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commit/734c3270219a3cb25bcc5d954d0b1c739ac2b6d4","sha":"734c3270219a3cb25bcc5d954d0b1c739ac2b6d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commits/734c3270219a3cb25bcc5d954d0b1c739ac2b6d4"}],"sha":"d00e0b1ac52daa8483689961951beb53c693d253","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commits/d00e0b1ac52daa8483689961951beb53c693d253"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commits/734c3270219a3cb25bcc5d954d0b1c739ac2b6d4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-24T07:53:34Z","email":"james@devdoneright.co.uk","name":"James Chapman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-24T07:53:34Z","email":"james@devdoneright.co.uk","name":"James Chapman"},"message":"Fix module federation by replacing vite preview with sirv\n\nvite preview serves index.html for any URL with an unknown query string,\nso remoteEntry.js?import (added by Vite''s federation runtime) returned\nHTML instead of JS, causing ERR_CONNECTION_REFUSED / failed dynamic import.\nsirv correctly serves static files regardless of query params.\n\nAlso moves users MFE to port 3001.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4ed5516698759ab2b5f3c4802af55dcd4baeb895","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/git/trees/4ed5516698759ab2b5f3c4802af55dcd4baeb895"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/git/commits/734c3270219a3cb25bcc5d954d0b1c739ac2b6d4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commit/734c3270219a3cb25bcc5d954d0b1c739ac2b6d4","node_id":"C_kwDOSmd9G9oAKDczNGMzMjcwMjE5YTNjYjI1YmNjNWQ5NTRkMGIxYzczOWFjMmI2ZDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commit/68fbd13448bfd50dc7930a29551a0d9918a4f5d4","sha":"68fbd13448bfd50dc7930a29551a0d9918a4f5d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commits/68fbd13448bfd50dc7930a29551a0d9918a4f5d4"}],"sha":"734c3270219a3cb25bcc5d954d0b1c739ac2b6d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commits/734c3270219a3cb25bcc5d954d0b1c739ac2b6d4"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commits/68fbd13448bfd50dc7930a29551a0d9918a4f5d4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-24T07:53:26Z","email":"james@devdoneright.co.uk","name":"James Chapman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-24T07:53:26Z","email":"james@devdoneright.co.uk","name":"James Chapman"},"message":"Move host to port 3000 to avoid macOS AirPlay conflict\n\nmacOS Control Center claims port 5000 (AirPlay Receiver), causing 403s.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e585820a3f2f19273aa6f47653043ef0a54a29c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/git/trees/e585820a3f2f19273aa6f47653043ef0a54a29c9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/git/commits/68fbd13448bfd50dc7930a29551a0d9918a4f5d4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commit/68fbd13448bfd50dc7930a29551a0d9918a4f5d4","node_id":"C_kwDOSmd9G9oAKDY4ZmJkMTM0NDhiZmQ1MGRjNzkzMGEyOTU1MWEwZDk5MThhNGY1ZDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commit/1168f71fda6fc16444f79a710044f35380e345d5","sha":"1168f71fda6fc16444f79a710044f35380e345d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commits/1168f71fda6fc16444f79a710044f35380e345d5"}],"sha":"68fbd13448bfd50dc7930a29551a0d9918a4f5d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commits/68fbd13448bfd50dc7930a29551a0d9918a4f5d4"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commits/1168f71fda6fc16444f79a710044f35380e345d5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-24T07:42:45Z","email":"james@devdoneright.co.uk","name":"James Chapman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-24T07:42:45Z","email":"james@devdoneright.co.uk","name":"James Chapman"},"message":"Add microfrontend UI with Vite Module Federation and React 19\n\nSets up host shell app, users microfrontend, and shared component library\nunder ui/. Updates CLAUDE.md and adds README with setup and architecture docs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b432662fd56fc5e6e83983b18f3174df9861f64f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/git/trees/b432662fd56fc5e6e83983b18f3174df9861f64f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/git/commits/1168f71fda6fc16444f79a710044f35380e345d5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commit/1168f71fda6fc16444f79a710044f35380e345d5","node_id":"C_kwDOSmd9G9oAKDExNjhmNzFmZGE2ZmMxNjQ0NGY3OWE3MTAwNDRmMzUzODBlMzQ1ZDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commit/daaddc5af0382ec6e0e48fe8a61444915d68dc2e","sha":"daaddc5af0382ec6e0e48fe8a61444915d68dc2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commits/daaddc5af0382ec6e0e48fe8a61444915d68dc2e"}],"sha":"1168f71fda6fc16444f79a710044f35380e345d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commits/1168f71fda6fc16444f79a710044f35380e345d5"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/commits/daaddc5af0382ec6e0e48fe8a61444915d68dc2e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-24T07:20:31Z","email":"james@devdoneright.co.uk","name":"James Chapman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-24T07:20:31Z","email":"james@devdoneright.co.uk","name":"James Chapman"},"message":"Add tsc type-check to pre-commit hook\n\nRuns tsc --noEmit in the backend before every commit to catch type errors early.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e28e8a266bfac17d24784e1ab39d6f6678b40b5b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uijim/microfrontend-practice/git/trees/e28e8a266bfac17d24784e1ab39d6f6