":"2026-07-01T21:01:09Z","email":"corelio@gmail.com","name":"Marco Mendes"},"message":"feat(deploy): orquestrador de deploy dos MFEs para ambiente limpo\n\nAdiciona `npm run deploy` na raiz (scripts/deploy.ts) que publica todos\nos MFEs no S3 (LocalStack) a partir de um clone limpo: sobe o LocalStack\nvia docker compose se estiver fora do ar, roda `npm ci` por MFE quando\nfaltam dependências, builda, delega o upload ao deploy do próprio MFE e\nvalida que cada bundle responde 200.\n\n- Sincroniza os package-lock.json dos MFEs, que estavam fora de sync com\n  o package.json e quebravam o `npm ci` num clone limpo\n- Atualiza README.md e infra/README.md com o novo fluxo de deploy\n- Corrige erros de TypeScript strict (noUncheckedIndexedAccess) nos\n  testes que bloqueavam o build\n- Remove menções órfãs a superpowers nos docs e no .gitignore\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1010f64689d01f3b9d8ea0773b1ef002cbff5f54","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhibr/frontend-react/git/trees/1010f64689d01f3b9d8ea0773b1ef002cbff5f54"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhibr/frontend-react/git/commits/24da93771c72ebd562a9cc6da4c64f41524c8e3d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/140483?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marco-mendes/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marco-mendes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marco-mendes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marco-mendes/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marco-mendes","id":140483,"login":"marco-mendes","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MDQ4Mw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marco-mendes/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marco-mendes/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.githu