6e987f8d62d9f3055a85a8d6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-30T17:39:04Z","email":"corelio@gmail.com","name":"Marco Mendes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-30T17:39:04Z","email":"corelio@gmail.com","name":"Marco Mendes"},"message":"docs(perf): relatório de carga dinâmica do MFE de empréstimo\n\nExecuta o harness de performance (tests/perf, projeto Playwright `perf`)\npara o MFE `emprestimo` e publica os resultados em docs/performance/, com\na metodologia do teste (instrumentação por fase, perfis de rede via CDP,\ngarantia de carga a frio, mediana de 5 execuções) e as ressalvas.\n\nCorrige também um bug latente no harness: `waitForSelector` no estado\ndefault `visible` escolhia o `<style data-emprestimo-theme>` prepended\npelo contrato visual da ADR-014 e esperava por sua visibilidade — que\nnunca ocorre — estourando o timeout só para o `emprestimo`. Troca para\n`state: ''attached''`; o sinal de \"montou\" segue sendo o measure\n`mfe:emprestimo:total`.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9a5bc86364be96f6631895e33776678995a81497","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhibr/frontend-react/git/trees/9a5bc86364be96f6631895e33776678995a81497"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhibr/frontend-react/git/commits/b39d60ec6c06699a6e987f8d62d9f3055a85a8d6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/140483?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marco-mendes/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marco-mendes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marco-mendes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marco-mendes/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marco-mendes","id":140483,"login":"marco-mendes","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MDQ4Mw==","organizations_url":"https://api.githu