/raghavapollo7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raghavapollo7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raghavapollo7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/raghavapollo7","id":187610545,"login":"raghavapollo7","node_id":"U_kgDOCy61sQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raghavapollo7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raghavapollo7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raghavapollo7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raghavapollo7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raghavapollo7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/raghavapollo7","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/raghavapollo7/Finsight/commits/0fd54ff0607da7205ebc8b4f62e613a83b944d6f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T00:58:55Z","email":"raghav.rocks453@gmail.com","name":"raghavapollo7"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T00:58:55Z","email":"raghav.rocks453@gmail.com","name":"raghavapollo7"},"message":"fix: repair chatbot + document extraction; add free Groq provider\n\nThe chatbot returned one canned reply and every document produced the\nsame extraction output because the deployed backend had no API keys and\nthe code hardcoded retired models (text-embedding-004, gemini-2.0-flash-lite).\n\n- Add backend/llm.py: single source of truth for model config, provider\n  priority Groq (free, no card) -> OpenAI -> Gemini, env-overridable\n- Chat: real RAG answers, general-knowledge fallback when no document is\n  indexed, accurate error surfacing, /chat/status endpoint\n- Add BM25 keyword retriever fallback so Groq-only setups (no embedding\n  API) still get document Q&A\n- Analyzer: doc-type-specific prompts (statement/invoice/GST/balance\n  sheet), PDF extraction chain (PyPDF -> pdfplumber -> PyMuPDF -> OCR),\n  Tesseract OC