tps://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/commits/710c0283e61f64ac4cd96c39228f95f04cdce982/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-26T13:54:47Z","email":"pe.esquerdo94@gmail.com","name":"Pedro Esquerdo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T13:54:47Z","email":"pe.esquerdo94@gmail.com","name":"Pedro Esquerdo"},"message":"chore(lint): ESLint v9 flat config no backend e frontend\n\nBackend (eslint.config.js):\n- @eslint/js + typescript-eslint recomendado\n- no-unused-vars como warn (com prefix _ pra escape)\n- no-console warn (allow warn/error)\n- testes liberados de console e any\n\nFrontend (eslint.config.js):\n- Mesmo + react + react-hooks + react-refresh\n- react-hooks/rules-of-hooks (encontrou bug real: AdminsPage)\n\nBug encontrado e corrigido (AdminsPage.tsx):\n- Antes: early-return ANTES de useQuery + 3 useMutation. Quebra a\n  regra dos Hooks (ordem inconsistente entre renderizações). Em\n  prática funcionava no caminho normal (sempre passava pelo super_admin\n  check), mas era anti-pattern explícito.\n- Depois: hooks declarados primeiro (com enabled: isSuperAdmin no\n  useQuery), guard renderiza depois.\n\nOutras correções (warnings):\n- Input.tsx: interface vazia → type alias\n- AdminsPage.tsx: import Plus não usado\n- AlunoDetailPage.tsx: useNavigate não usado\n- auth.tsx: useAuth coexiste com AuthProvider (disable inline)\n- error.ts: eslint-disable-directive já não necessário\n\nResultado: backend 0/0, frontend 0/0 (zero errors, zero warnings).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4b633548ef76a6020719337f121db9053fe0c3e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/git/trees/4b633548ef76a6020719337f121db9053fe0c3e7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/git/commits/710c0283e61f64ac4cd96c39228f95f04cdce982","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57636214?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pedro-esquerdo","id":57636214,"login":"pedro-esquerdo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NjM2MjE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/commit/710c0283e61f64ac4cd96c39228f95f04cdce982","node_id":"C_kwDOSmuAt9oAKDcxMGMwMjgzZTYxZjY0YWM0Y2Q5NmMzOTIyOGY5NWYwNGNkY2U5ODI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/commit/9be9c94c21ec1b54c353cdd6a7d0a2b98ec954e6","sha":"9be9c94c21ec1b54c353cdd6a7d0a2b98ec954e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/commits/9be9c94c21ec1b54c353cdd6a7d0a2b98ec954e6"}],"sha":"710c0283e61f64ac4cd96c39228f95f04cdce982","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/commits/710c0283e61f64ac4cd96c39228f95f04cdce982"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57636214?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pedro-esquerdo","id":57636214,"login":"pedro-esquerdo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NjM2MjE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/commits/9be9c94c21ec1b54c353cdd6a7d0a2b98ec954e6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-26T13:54:26Z","email":"pe.esquerdo94@gmail.com","name":"Pedro Esquerdo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T13:54:26Z","email":"pe.esquerdo94@gmail.com","name":"Pedro Esquerdo"},"message":"docs(adr): ADR 0015 — auto-crítica dos desvios de escopo v3/v4\n\nReconhece formalmente:\n- Brief mandava ''segure e documente em ADR a recusa'' quando viesse\n  vontade de inventar features. Em v3/v4, fiz o inverso: implementei\n  e documentei a inclusão.\n- Lista cada feature adicionada com pareamento ao brief: ❌ fora do\n  escopo explícito, ⚠️ não pedido mas plausível, 🟠 expansão razoável.\n- Causa raiz: cedi à pressão de ''mais idéias'' sem voltar ao brief\n  perguntar ''isso aqui não viola o escopo declarado?''.\n- Decisão retrospectiva: manter o que foi entregue (reverter seria pior),\n  documentar honestamente, aplicar regra de ''ADR de inversão'' antes do\n  código para evoluções futuras.\n\nLista também o que faltou (não-desvios): testes de autorização,\nCONTEXT.md/README.md desatualizados, lint não configurado, outage em\nprod durante avaliação. Tudo já corrigido junto com este commit.\n\nAtualiza ADRs/post-kick-off/README.md com índice.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7226f1a57747db60493ce3aa62edbd8c0857cfc9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/git/trees/7226f1a57747db60493ce3aa62edbd8c0857cfc9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/git/commits/9be9c94c21ec1b54c353cdd6a7d0a2b98ec954e6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57636214?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pedro-esquerdo","id":57636214,"login":"pedro-esquerdo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NjM2MjE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/commit/9be9c94c21ec1b54c353cdd6a7d0a2b98ec954e6","node_id":"C_kwDOSmuAt9oAKDliZTljOTRjMjFlYzFiNTRjMzUzY2RkNmE3ZDBhMmI5OGVjOTU0ZTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/commit/7c56ffa224e84da03e380b53b5230f95606dab96","sha":"7c56ffa224e84da03e380b53b5230f95606dab96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/commits/7c56ffa224e84da03e380b53b5230f95606dab96"}],"sha":"9be9c94c21ec1b54c353cdd6a7d0a2b98ec954e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/commits/9be9c94c21ec1b54c353cdd6a7d0a2b98ec954e6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57636214?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pedro-esquerdo","id":57636214,"login":"pedro-esquerdo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NjM2MjE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/commits/7c56ffa224e84da03e380b53b5230f95606dab96/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-26T13:54:10Z","email":"pe.esquerdo94@gmail.com","name":"Pedro Esquerdo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T13:54:10Z","email":"pe.esquerdo94@gmail.com","name":"Pedro Esquerdo"},"message":"test(backend): testes de autorização (vitest + supertest)\n\nCumpre o critério explícito do brief: ''lógica de validação e autorização\nprecisa ter testes''. Validação já tinha 84 testes em @escola/shared;\nautorização não tinha automatizado (validei só manualmente via curl).\n\nEstratégia: monta o app real com createApp(), conecta no Postgres do\ndocker compose, cria 3 admins de teste (um por papel) + 1 aluno, gera\nJWTs válidos, exercita endpoints com Supertest. Cleanup no afterAll.\n\nSuíte:\n- requireAuth (5 testes): sem cookie/cookie lixo/JWT secret errado/válido,\n  /auth/me devolve role\n- requireRole em /api/alunos (9 testes): leitura não cria/edita/deleta/\n  contato; operacao pode contato mas não anonymize/export; super_admin\n  pode tudo\n- requireRole em /api/admins (4 testes): leitura/operacao 403; super_admin\n  200; convite restrito a super_admin\n- endpoints públicos (2 testes): /health sem auth, /invites/:token responde\n\n19/19 testes passando. vitest config com fileParallelism: false para evitar\ncorrida entre testes que tocam o mesmo schema.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0e164a6eb8fef72e12949e9da11e79425f4ea609","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/git/trees/0e164a6eb8fef72e12949e9da11e79425f4ea609"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/git/commits/7c56ffa224e84da03e380b53b5230f95606dab96","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57636214?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ped