,"type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/commits/77db0288986f209952ade5258890508c1376661a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-25T02:05:07Z","email":"pe.esquerdo94@gmail.com","name":"Pedro Esquerdo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-25T02:05:07Z","email":"pe.esquerdo94@gmail.com","name":"Pedro Esquerdo"},"message":"feat(frontend v4): avatares, perfil rico, checklist, cohort, /admins\n\nAvatar component (Avatar.tsx) — DiceBear url ou fallback de iniciais.\n\nAlunosPage:\n- Coluna ''nome'' agora tem avatar + cidade + profissão\n- Contato mostra ''via [origem]'' como subtexto\n- Coluna trilha ganha mini-progress bar com pct concluído\n\nAlunoDetailPage:\n- Header com avatar grande (size lg)\n- Badge de origem ao lado de status/trilha/plano\n- Linha ''origemDetalhe'' e ''aniversário'' nos detalhes\n- Bloco ''uso do produto'': totalLogins + último login + dias na plataforma\n  + disclaimer sobre webhook futuro\n- Bloco ''progresso da trilha'': barra + checklist interativa\n  (PATCH /alunos/:id com array de keys completed; invalida cache)\n\nTopbar:\n- Nav ampliada: /retention e /admins (este último só para super_admin)\n- Exibe email + role do admin atual no canto direito\n\nAuth lib:\n- Admin type ganha role\n- AuthContext adiciona helper can(...roles)\n\nNovas páginas:\n- RetentionPage (/retention): tabela cohort por mês com bars + cores\n  graduais (verde 90%+, amarelo 50-70%, vermelho <30%)\n- AdminsPage (/admins): super_admin only via Navigate guard.\n  Lista de ativos com select de role inline. Lista de convites pendentes.\n  Dialog ''novo admin'' → backend gera token → modal ''invite criado'' exibe link\n  uma única vez com botão ''copiar link''. Revoga convite ou remove admin.\n- AcceptInvitePage (/admin-convite/:token): rota pública.\n  Preview do convite com email + role + expiração; form de senha (mín 8);\n  POST /admins/invites/:token/accept; redireciona para /login após sucesso.\n\nRefs ADR 0014.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"176e8bd9788752048ee10946848220b867808369","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/git/trees/176e8bd9788752048ee10946848220b867808369"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/git/commits/77db0288986f209952ade5258890508c1376661a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57636214?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pedro-esquerdo","id":57636214,"login":"pedro-esquerdo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NjM2MjE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/commit/77db0288986f209952ade5258890508c1376661a","node_id":"C_kwDOSmuAt9oAKDc3ZGIwMjg4OTg2ZjIwOTk1MmFkZTUyNTg4OTA1MDhjMTM3NjY2MWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/commit/384f5d539bc774bc861f4195fa812ded5978ab18","sha":"384f5d539bc774bc861f4195fa812ded5978ab18","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/commits/384f5d539bc774bc861f4195fa812ded5978ab18"}],"sha":"77db0288986f209952ade5258890508c1376661a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/commits/77db0288986f209952ade5258890508c1376661a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57636214?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pedro-esquerdo","id":57636214,"login":"pedro-esquerdo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NjM2MjE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/commits/384f5d539bc774bc861f4195fa812ded5978ab18/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-25T01:57:09Z","email":"pe.esquerdo94@gmail.com","name":"Pedro Esquerdo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-25T01:57:09Z","email":"pe.esquerdo94@gmail.com","name":"Pedro Esquerdo"},"message":"feat: v4 — perfil rico, multi-admin, cohort, checklist da trilha\n\nADR 0014 (post-kickoff).\n\nSchema (migration rich_profile_multi_admin):\n- Admin: +role enum (super_admin/operacao/leitura, default operacao)\n- Nova tabela admin_invite (email, role, tokenHash bcrypt, expiresAt, acceptedAt, createdById)\n- Aluno: +avatarUrl, origemCanal/Detalhe (enum + texto), cidade, profissao,\n  aniversario, totalLogins, ultimoLoginEm, progressoItensCompletos (String[])\n- Index em origemCanal\n\n@escola/shared:\n- Enums: OrigemCanal, AdminRole; labels ROLE_LABEL/DESCRIPTION\n- TRILHA_CHECKLISTS: catálogo de itens por trilha (vocabulário próprio\n  Escola do Breno em cada fase)\n- trilhaProgressPct helper\n- AlunoDTO ganha: avatar, origem, perfil, métricas (logins, dias),\n  progressoChecklist + progressoPct (computed)\n- Schemas admin: invite, accept, updateRole\n- 5 testes novos (84 total passando)\n\nBackend:\n- middleware requireRole(roles[]) — checa role em DB após auth\n- Aluno routes protegidas por role:\n  - POST/PATCH/DELETE/contact/restore: super_admin OR operacao\n  - anonymize/export: SOMENTE super_admin (PII sensível)\n  - GETs: qualquer admin (incluindo leitura)\n- /auth/me agora retorna role\n- /api/admins (super_admin only):\n  - GET / : admins + convites pendentes\n  - PATCH /:id/role : promove/rebaixa (não permite alterar próprio role)\n  - DELETE /:id : remove (não permite último super_admin ou si mesmo)\n  - POST /invites : gera token aleatório, retorna LINK uma única vez\n  - DELETE /invites/:id : revoga pendente\n  - GET /invites/:token : preview do convite (sem auth)\n  - POST /invites/:token/accept : cria admin + marca aceito (transação)\n- /dashboard/cohort: agrega por mês de matrícula (date_trunc PostgreSQL),\n  computa % retenção on-demand\n\nSeed: alunos com avatares DiceBear, origens variadas (instagram, indicação,\nyoutube, eventos, anúncio, busca), cidades, profissões, aniversários,\ntotalLogins simulando engajamento real (de 4 a 287), progressoTrilha\ncom 0-4 itens por aluno.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e2b1c5b8ca9ecf101ae889edb863f86a5408b001","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/git/trees/e2b1c5b8ca9ecf101ae889edb863f86a5408b001"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/git/commits/384f5d539bc774bc861f4195fa812ded5978ab18","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57636214?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pedro-esquerdo","id":57636214,"login":"pedro-esquerdo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NjM2MjE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/commit/384f5d539bc774bc861f4195fa812ded5978ab18","node_id":"C_kwDOSmuAt9oAKDM4NGY1ZDUzOWJjNzc0YmM4NjFmNDE5NWZhODEyZGVkNTk3OGFiMTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/commit/b652398be43ef341cb9cd740c83ca908e1c455ab","sha":"b652398be43ef341cb9cd740c83ca908e1c455ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/commits/b652398be43ef341cb9cd740c83ca908e1c455ab"}],"sha":"384f5d539bc774bc861f4195fa812ded5978ab18","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/commits/384f5d539bc774bc861f4195fa812ded5978ab18"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57636214?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pedro-esquerdo","id":57636214,"login":"pedro-esquerdo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NjM2MjE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/commits/b652398be43ef341cb9cd740c83ca908e1c455ab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-25T01:11:22Z","email":"pe.esquerdo94@gmail.com","name":"Pedro Esquerdo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-25T01:11:22Z","email":"pe.esquerdo94@gmail.com","name":"Pedro Esquerdo"},"message":"feat(frontend v3): consent, contato, MRR/atenção, /audit/login, /lgpd\n\nDashboard:\n- 10 KPI cards em 2 linhas:\n  Linha 1 (negócio): ativos, MRR, ARR, ticket médio, novos 30d\n  Linha 2 (alerta): cancelados 30d, vencendo 30d, vencidos, sem contato 60d+,\n  LGPD abertos (com badge de vencidos quando aplicável)\n- Cards de LGPD/atenção linkam direto pras páginas relevantes\n\nAlunoDetailPage:\n- Botão ''registrar contato'' destacado (primary) no header\n- Bloco ''consentimento (LGPD)'': checkmarks por canal + data de aceite\n- Bloco ''último contato'': badge do canal, data, dias atrás, nota (se houver)\n- ''há Xd'' fica amarelo quando > 60 dias\n- Detail DTO completo com campos v3\n\nAlunoFormDialog:\n- Campo ''Valor anual'' (centavos) com preview em BRL\n- Fieldset ''consentimentos LGPD'' com 3 checkboxes (email, WhatsApp, ofertas)\n\nAlunosPage:\n- AlunoDTO atualizado com campos v3 (compatibilidade do prop initial do form)\n\nNovos components/pages:\n- RegisterContactDialog: form com canal (select) + nota (input)\n- LoginAuditPage (/audit/login): tabela de tentativas com filtro por\n  sucesso/falha, summary 24h, destaque vermelho em falhas\n- LgpdRequestsPage (/lgpd/requests): lista + KPIs (abertos, vencidos),\n  badge de prazo dinâmico (vencido/vencendo/normal), botões iniciar/concluir,\n  modal pra registrar novo pedido com prazo de 15d calculado\n\nTopbar: navegação ampliada (dashboard, alunos, LGPD, auditoria).\n\nRefs ADR 0013.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1a4e8e20edf4818da3512a1aea846f6b2e971f56","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/git/trees/1a4e8e20edf4818da3512a1aea846f6b2e971f56"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/git/commits/b652398be43ef341cb9cd740c83ca908e1c455ab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57636214?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pedro-esquerdo","id":57636214,"login":"pedro-esquerdo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NjM2MjE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/commit/b652398be43ef341cb9cd740c83ca908e1c455ab","node_id":"C_kwDOSmuAt9oAKGI2NTIzOThiZTQzZWYzNDFjYjljZDc0MGM4M2NhOTA4ZTFjNDU1YWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/commit/b192d113918077518d6010445c1b030cf80c9a62","sha":"b192d113918077518d6010445c1b030cf80c9a62","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/commits/b192d113918077518d6010445c1b030cf80c9a62"}],"sha":"b652398be43ef341cb9cd740c83ca908e1c455ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/commits/b652398be43ef341cb9cd740c83ca908e1c455ab"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57636214?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pedro-esquerdo","id":57636214,"login":"pedro-esquerdo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NjM2MjE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/commits/b192d113918077518d6010445c1b030cf80c9a62/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-25T01:01:28Z","email":"pe.esquerdo94@gmail.com","name":"Pedro Esquerdo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-25T01:01:28Z","email":"pe.esquerdo94@gmail.com","name":"Pedro Esquerdo"},"message":"feat: v3 — consent, contato, valor, login audit, LGPD requests\n\nADR 0013 (post-kickoff).\n\nSchema (migration consent_contato_finance_audit):\n- Aluno: +valorAnualCentavos (default 29880 = R$ 298,80)\n- Aluno: +consentEmail, consentWhatsapp, consentOfertas, termsAcceptedAt\n- Aluno: +ultimoContatoEm, ultimoContatoCanal, ultimoContatoNota\n- AuditAction enum: +contact\n- Nova tabela login_attempt (auditoria de login: email, ip, ua, success, reason)\n- Nova tabela lgpd_request (tracking de pedidos LGPD com prazo de 15d)\n- Enums: canal_contato, lgpd_request_type, lgpd_request_status\n\n@escola/shared:\n- Schemas: registerContactSchema, createLgpdRequestSchema, updateLgpdRequestSchema,\n  listLgpdRequestsQuerySchema\n- Labels: CANAL_LABEL, LGPD_TYPE_LABEL, LGPD_STATUS_LABEL\n- AlunoDTO ganha: valorAnualCentavos, valorAnualFormatado (BRL), consent flags,\n  ultimoContato*, diasDesdeUltimoContato\n- LgpdRequestDTO: novo tipo\n- 4 testes novos (79 total passando)\n\nBackend:\n- POST /auth/login agora registra login_attempt em sucesso E falha (com reason),\n  mensagem ao cliente continua neutra (ADR 0006 preservado)\n- POST /alunos/:id/contact — registra contato manual com audit event ''contact''\n- POST /alunos anonymize: zera consents + contato nota (PII total)\n- GET /audit/login — histórico paginado + summary 24h\n- GET|POST|PATCH /lgpd/requests — CRUD com SLA tracking (dueAt = received + 15d)\n- Dashboard /stats ganha:\n  - financeiro: ARR, MRR, ticket médio (soma valorAnual dos ativos)\n  - atencao: semContatoHa60d, lgpdAbertos, lgpdVencidos\n\nSeed: alunos com consent variado, último contato variável, 2 LGPD requests\nde exemplo (1 em andamento, 1 recebido).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d1cb5fbaff12ef7a7e85c7f6e679dfd6333d0ff6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/git/trees/d1cb5fbaff12ef7a7e85c7f6e679dfd6333d0ff6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/git/commits/b192d113918077518d6010445c1b030cf80c9a62","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57636214?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pedro-esquerdo","id":57636214,"login":"pedro-esquerdo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NjM2MjE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/commit/b192d113918077518d6010445c1b030cf80c9a62","node_id":"C_kwDOSmuAt9oAKGIxOTJkMTEzOTE4MDc3NTE4ZDYwMTA0NDVjMWIwMzBjZjgwYzlhNjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/commit/b4929c17f7fd57a430857e1564694984bad0622c","sha":"b4929c17f7fd57a430857e1564694984bad0622c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/commits/b4929c17f7fd57a430857e1564694984bad0622c"}],"sha":"b192d113918077518d6010445c1b030cf80c9a62","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/commits/b192d113918077518d6010445c1b030cf80c9a62"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57636214?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pedro-esquerdo","id":57636214,"login":"pedro-esquerdo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NjM2MjE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/commits/b4929c17f7fd57a430857e1564694984bad0622c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-25T00:19:51Z","email":"pe.esquerdo94@gmail.com","name":"Pedro Esquerdo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-25T00:19:51Z","email":"pe.esquerdo94@gmail.com","name":"Pedro Esquerdo"},"message":"feat(frontend): dashboard, trilha, vencimento, detalhe c/ timeline LGPD\n\nNova rota /dashboard:\n- 5 KPI cards (total ativos, novos 30d, churn 30d, vencendo, vencidos)\n- Distribuição por status (3 bars) e por trilha (4 bars com cores graduais)\n- Auto-refresh a cada 30s via TanStack Query staleTime\n\nNova rota /alunos/:id (detalhe + timeline):\n- Card de identificação com badges (status, trilha, plano, deletado/anonimizado)\n- Ações contextuais: editar, restaurar, exportar (LGPD), anonimizar, remover\n- Timeline visual de auditoria com diff de campos por evento\n- Modal de confirmação de anonimização explicando consequência\n\nAtualizações em /alunos:\n- Filtro adicional por trilha (4 opções + ''todas'')\n- Coluna ''trilha'' com badge laranja (TRILHA_LABEL vocabulário oficial)\n- Coluna ''vencimento'' com badge dinâmico:\n  - vencido (vermelho), vencendo 30d (amarelo), normal (cinza)\n- Linha contém link pro detalhe (clique no nome OU ícone Info)\n\nAlunoFormDialog:\n- Campos novos: trilha (select), dataInicio, dataVencimento (date inputs),\n  renovacaoAutomatica (checkbox)\n- Layout em 2 colunas pra densidade\n- Invalida queries de dashboard ao salvar (mantém KPIs frescos)\n\nTopbar:\n- Navegação entre /dashboard e /alunos com indicador de ativo\n\nBadge variants novos: trilha, vencido, vencendo, anonimizado.\n\nRefs ADR 0012.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"04b1dbf811f2d5f9ccc401baebb0675aeda314f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/git/trees/04b1dbf811f2d5f9ccc401baebb0675aeda314f2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/git/commits/b4929c17f7fd57a430857e1564694984bad0622c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57636214?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pedro-esquerdo","id":57636214,"login":"pedro-esquerdo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NjM2MjE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/commit/b4929c17f7fd57a430857e1564694984bad0622c","node_id":"C_kwDOSmuAt9oAKGI0OTI5YzE3ZjdmZDU3YTQzMDg1N2UxNTY0Njk0OTg0YmFkMDYyMmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/commit/141fea8db7f37e92405286f445716bf2181bb7f0","sha":"141fea8db7f37e92405286f445716bf2181bb7f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/commits/141fea8db7f37e92405286f445716bf2181bb7f0"}],"sha":"b4929c17f7fd57a430857e1564694984bad0622c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/commits/b4929c17f7fd57a430857e1564694984bad0622c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57636214?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pedro-esquerdo","id":57636214,"login":"pedro-esquerdo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NjM2MjE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/commits/141fea8db7f37e92405286f445716bf2181bb7f0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-25T00:14:31Z","email":"pe.esquerdo94@gmail.com","name":"Pedro Esquerdo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-25T00:14:31Z","email":"pe.esquerdo94@gmail.com","name":"Pedro Esquerdo"},"message":"feat: realinhamento ao produto real (trilha, assinatura, LGPD, audit)\n\nRefs ADR 0012 (post-kickoff).\n\nSchema (migration realinhamento_produto_real):\n- Plano enum: basic/premium → anual (produto tem 1 plano)\n- Aluno: + dataInicio, dataVencimento, renovacaoAutomatica (assinatura)\n- Aluno: + trilha enum (saindo_da_divida → ... → construindo_patrimonio)\n- Aluno: + anonymizedAt (LGPD marker)\n- Nova tabela audit_event (alunoId, adminId, action, before, after, createdAt)\n\n@escola/shared:\n- Novos enums: PlanoSchema, TrilhaSchema (+ STATUS_LABEL, TRILHA_LABEL)\n- createAlunoSchema aceita trilha + datas (opcionais com defaults)\n- listAlunosQuerySchema: filtro de trilha + includeDeleted\n- AlunoDTO: trilha, datas ISO, renovacaoAutomatica, diasParaVencimento,\n  anonimizado, deletedAt\n- 4 testes novos (75 total, todos passando)\n\nBackend:\n- GET /api/dashboard/stats — total, por status, por trilha, churn 30d,\n  vencendo próximos 30d, vencidos\n- POST /api/alunos/:id/restore — reverte soft delete\n- POST /api/alunos/:id/anonymize — LGPD direito ao esquecimento; zera PII\n  preservando unicidade + soft-delete + audit trail\n- GET /api/alunos/:id/export — LGPD portabilidade (JSON download)\n- GET /api/alunos/:id/history — timeline de auditoria por aluno\n- Audit log: every create/update/delete/restore/anonymize gera event\n  com snapshots ANTES e DEPOIS (CPF mascarado no snapshot — audit não\n  vira vazamento secundário de PII)\n\nSeed atualizado com trilhas variadas + datas de assinatura realistas\n(1 aluno vencido, 1 vencendo próximos 30 dias — destaca no dashboard).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"83e35da03ed87910986a95dfef989b186573f5ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/git/trees/83e35da03ed87910986a95dfef989b186573f5ec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/git/commits/141fea8db7f37e92405286f445716bf2181bb7f0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57636214?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pedro-esquerdo","id":57636214,"login":"pedro-esquerdo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NjM2MjE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/commit/141fea8db7f37e92405286f445716bf2181bb7f0","node_id":"C_kwDOSmuAt9oAKDE0MWZlYThkYjdmMzdlOTI0MDUyODZmNDQ1NzE2YmYyMTgxYmI3ZjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/commit/3f2a6af6544758c1196a6c217b6c1581271818c7","sha":"3f2a6af6544758c1196a6c217b6c1581271818c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/commits/3f2a6af6544758c1196a6c217b6c1581271818c7"}],"sha":"141fea8db7f37e92405286f445716bf2181bb7f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/commits/141fea8db7f37e92405286f445716bf2181bb7f0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57636214?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pedro-esquerdo","id":57636214,"login":"pedro-esquerdo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NjM2MjE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/commits/3f2a6af6544758c1196a6c217b6c1581271818c7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-24T19:42:23Z","email":"pe.esquerdo94@gmail.com","name":"Pedro Esquerdo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-24T19:42:23Z","email":"pe.esquerdo94@gmail.com","name":"Pedro Esquerdo"},"message":"feat(prod): pipeline Socium-SF para escola-breno (multi-imagem)\n\nAplica overlay prod-deploy-pipeline customizado para a stack do case:\n3 serviços (web + api + postgres) em vez do default 1-imagem.\n\ndocker-compose.prod.yml:\n- web (frontend nginx) em escola-breno.app.socium-sf.com\n- api (backend express) em api.escola-breno.app.socium-sf.com\n- postgres em rede ''internal'' (sem exposição)\n- Traefik labels para SSL automático Let''s Encrypt\n- Volumes/redes com prefixo ''escola-breno'' (isolamento por cliente)\n\n.env.example.prod:\n- IMAGE_TAG (sobrescrito a cada deploy pelo CI)\n- POSTGRES_USER/PASSWORD/DB (operador edita 1x na VPS)\n- JWT_SECRET (operador edita 1x)\n- SEED_ADMIN_EMAIL/PASSWORD (idem)\n\n.github/workflows/deploy.yml:\n- Builda 2 imagens: client-escola-breno-web (com VITE_API_URL build-arg)\n  e client-escola-breno-api\n- SCP envia *.prod para a VPS; deploy script renomeia para nomes\n  canônicos da convenção Socium-SF (docker-compose.yml + .env.example)\n- IMAGE_TAG atualizado por sed; restante do .env preservado\n\nConvenção: dev local usa docker-compose.yml + .env.example\n(brief avalia ''docker compose up'' do zero), prod usa *.prod.yml.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7f8ffd4d77c6f1d9cdd35c1f317dc7e8bc0e60a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/git/trees/7f8ffd4d77c6f1d9cdd35c1f317dc7e8bc0e60a8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/git/commits/3f2a6af6544758c1196a6c217b6c1581271818c7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57636214?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pedro-esquerdo","id":57636214,"login":"pedro-esquerdo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NjM2MjE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esq