ent-escola-breno/commits/c9bc34da665d4d1aed5acb6fbd353e830c1704dd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-24T19:38:19Z","email":"pe.esquerdo94@gmail.com","name":"Pedro Esquerdo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-24T19:38:19Z","email":"pe.esquerdo94@gmail.com","name":"Pedro Esquerdo"},"message":"feat(docker): multistage Dockerfiles para backend e frontend\n\nbackend/Dockerfile:\n- builder stage: instala monorepo via npm ci, gera Prisma client\n- runtime alpine + dumb-init para sinal forwarding\n- entrypoint: prisma migrate deploy + seed (idempotente) + start\n- Build context = raiz do monorepo (acesso a packages/shared)\n\nfrontend/Dockerfile:\n- builder stage: vite build com VITE_API_URL injetado via build-arg\n- runtime nginx alpine servindo dist/ na porta 80\n- Multi-stage final image ~50MB\n\nfrontend/nginx.conf:\n- SPA fallback (try_files $uri $uri/ /index.html)\n- Cache-Control immutable para /assets/, no-store para index.html\n- Gzip básico\n\ndocker-compose.yml:\n- frontend agora mapeia 5174:80 (host:container)\n- VITE_API_URL passa como build-arg\n- 3 containers: postgres healthy → backend (migrate+seed+start) → frontend\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5c4c0bbf1e8dad94a9f573a4d39e92298130ffa8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/git/trees/5c4c0bbf1e8dad94a9f573a4d39e92298130ffa8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/git/commits/c9bc34da665d4d1aed5acb6fbd353e830c1704dd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57636214?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.git