pedro-esquerdo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/commits/92d68931b2ab1ba1fd1c5ed63135a3b378258409/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-24T19:38:06Z","email":"pe.esquerdo94@gmail.com","name":"Pedro Esquerdo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-24T19:38:06Z","email":"pe.esquerdo94@gmail.com","name":"Pedro Esquerdo"},"message":"chore(backend): troca bcrypt -> bcryptjs (alpine-friendly)\n\nbcrypt é módulo nativo e exige compilação no postinstall. Em alpine\nsem build tools (python, make, g++), o binding C++ não é gerado e\no require falha com ''Cannot find module bcrypt_lib.node''.\n\nbcryptjs é pure JS, drop-in replacement (mesma API hash/compare),\n~3x mais lento mas irrelevante para 1 login/sessão.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"97d8dc7de66a70406a63b76cab798244f7781f8f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/git/trees/97d8dc7de66a70406a63b76cab798244f7781f8f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/git/commits/92d68931b2ab1ba1fd1c5ed63135a3b378258409","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57636214?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/gists