epos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/commits/0e2b89e6309c82462e1f8bc83196533727c8b47f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-24T19:37:51Z","email":"pe.esquerdo94@gmail.com","name":"Pedro Esquerdo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-24T19:37:51Z","email":"pe.esquerdo94@gmail.com","name":"Pedro Esquerdo"},"message":"feat(frontend): SPA com login, listagem e CRUD de alunos\n\nPáginas:\n- LoginPage: form Zod, mensagem neutra, marca lowercase + paleta oficial\n- AlunosPage: tabela com busca (nome/email/CPF), filtros (status, plano),\n  badges coloridos por status, mascaramento CPF com toggle de revelar\n\nComponents:\n- Topbar (logo, email do admin, logout)\n- AlunoFormDialog (criar + editar com Radix Dialog + RHF)\n- ConfirmDeleteDialog (mensagem ''tem certeza?'' com soft delete)\n- ui/* (Button, Input, Label, Select, Badge, Dialog) Radix + Tailwind\n\nInfra:\n- TanStack Query como server state, Zustand minimal (auth ctx via Provider)\n- React Hook Form + zodResolver, shared schemas Zod do @escola/shared\n- Tailwind tokens com cores da Escola do Breno (#FF5917, #DDFD5A, #0E2E23)\n- Inter + Manrope via Google Fonts\n- API client com credentials: ''include'' (cookies httpOnly)\n- Toaster sonner posicionado bottom-right\n\nRefs design.md, ADR 0006 (PII), ADR 0009 (validação compartilhada).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"946c25fa7a0c9ffc3d5cd25e02180a9dc381297c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/git/trees/946c25fa7a0c9ffc3d5cd25e02180a9dc381297c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/