github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pedro-esquerdo","id":57636214,"login":"pedro-esquerdo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NjM2MjE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/commits/094943d2e87355a564cff8216a61c682f87ff1a7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-23T16:18:33Z","email":"pe.esquerdo94@gmail.com","name":"Pedro Esquerdo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-23T16:18:33Z","email":"pe.esquerdo94@gmail.com","name":"Pedro Esquerdo"},"message":"feat(backend): express app with auth, CRUD, PII redaction, rate limit\n\nAPI endpoints:\n- POST /api/auth/login (rate-limited, neutral error message)\n- POST /api/auth/logout\n- GET /api/auth/me (requires auth)\n- GET /api/alunos (search + filter + pagination, soft-delete filtered)\n- POST /api/alunos (Zod validation, 409 on conflict with neutral CPF msg)\n- GET /api/alunos/:id (optional ?reveal=true for raw CPF)\n- PATCH /api/alunos/:id (partial update, conflict-safe)\n- DELETE /api/alunos/:id (soft delete via deletedAt)\n- GET /api/health\n\nMiddleware:\n- requireAuth (JWT in httpOnly cookie)\n- validate (Zod for body/query/params with field-level errors)\n- notFoundHandler + errorHandler\n\nSecurity:\n- helmet, cors with credentials, cookie-parser, hpp\n- rate limit global (300/min) + login-specific (20/15min)\n- Pino with PII redaction (cpf, email, telefone, password, token, cookie, ...)\n- JWT cookie: httpOnly + sameSite=lax + secure in prod\n\nDTOs:\n- toAlunoDTO masks CPF by default\n- toAlunoRevealedDTO exposes only when explicitly requested\n- Prisma model never returned raw\n\nTested manually: 200 with cookie, 401 without, 400 invalid CPF, 409 conflict.\n\nRefs ADR 0004 (auth), 0006 (PII), 0008 (soft delete).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f5eaf276c1fb253ca5fb9772b579ced7fc104cbb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/git/trees/f5eaf276c1fb253ca5fb9772b579ced7fc104cbb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/git/commits/094943d2e87355a564cff8216a61c682f87ff1a7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57636214?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pedro-esquerdo","id":57636214,"login":"pedro-esquerdo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NjM2MjE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pe