t":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-23T15:40:59Z","email":"pe.esquerdo94@gmail.com","name":"Pedro Esquerdo"},"message":"fix(db): correct 3 invalid sample CPFs in seed\n\n70283457001 -> 70283457007\n04094445116 -> 04094445102\n46625325831 -> 46625325821\n\nCaught by the shared CPF validator test suite. The original list had\n3 CPFs that failed the check-digit algorithm. Replaced with arithmetic\nvalid equivalents derived from the same first 9 digits.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a5226b55eb1944701eb0c931e76b938b73963678","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/git/trees/a5226b55eb1944701eb0c931e76b938b73963678"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/git/commits/e8c9adfbd2dea08be03be5e882c035c4c1512572","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57636214?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pedro-esquerdo","id":57636214,"login":"pedro-esquerdo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NjM2MjE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/commit/e8c9adfbd2dea08be03be5e882c035c4c1512572","node_id":"C_kwDOSmuAt9oAKGU4YzlhZGZiZDJkZWEwOGJlMDNiZTVlODgyYzAzNWM0YzE1MTI1NzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/commit/2231b9bcf3380b37f2e018564b5af2fc94f8a357","sha":"2231b9bcf3380b37f2e018564b5af2fc94f8a357","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/commits/2231b9bcf3380b37f2e018564b5af2fc94f8a357"}],"sha":"e8c9adfbd2dea08be03be5e882c035c4c1512572","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/commits/e8c9adfbd2dea08be03be5e882c035c4c1512572"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57636214?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pedro-esquerdo","id":57636214,"login":"pedro-esquerdo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NjM2MjE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/commits/2231b9bcf3380b37f2e018564b5af2fc94f8a357/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-23T15:40:51Z","email":"pe.esquerdo94@gmail.com","name":"Pedro Esquerdo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-23T15:40:51Z","email":"pe.esquerdo94@gmail.com","name":"Pedro Esquerdo"},"message":"feat(shared): @escola/shared with validators, schemas, and DTOs\n\nValidators (with full algorithmic rigor):\n- CPF: 11-digit check + check digit algorithm + reject all-same digits\n- Email: practical RFC subset + lowercase/trim normalization\n- Telefone: BR 10/11 digits + DDD range + 9th-digit Anatel rule\n\nZod schemas (server is source of truth, frontend reuses):\n- createAlunoSchema / updateAlunoSchema / listAlunosQuerySchema\n- loginSchema\n\nDTOs (PII safety, ADR 0006):\n- toAlunoDTO masks CPF by default (cpfMasked: ''***.***.247-25'')\n- toAlunoRevealedDTO exposes CPF (intentional reveal action)\n- Prisma model never serialized directly\n\nTests: 71 passing (Vitest). Coverage includes valid+invalid+edge cases\nfor each validator and snapshot-style assertions on DTOs.\n\nRefs ADR 0006 (PII), 0007 (CPF), 0009 (shared validation).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"52ba230f5b8b6d0d288355b5083c83531ad565cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/git/trees/52ba230f5b8b6d0d288355b5083c83531ad565cf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/git/commits/2231b9bcf3380b37f2e018564b5af2fc94f8a357","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57636214?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pedro-esquerdo","id":57636214,"login":"pedro-esquerdo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NjM2MjE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/orgs","received_events_url":"https: