e":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/commits/2b860005429e7360852d057314813b8bfe2c4c56/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-23T15:35:21Z","email":"pe.esquerdo94@gmail.com","name":"Pedro Esquerdo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-23T15:35:21Z","email":"pe.esquerdo94@gmail.com","name":"Pedro Esquerdo"},"message":"feat(db): prisma schema for Admin and Aluno + idempotent seed\n\n- Admin model: 1 user with email unique + bcrypt password hash\n- Aluno model: minimum fields from brief + createdAt/updatedAt/deletedAt\n- Enums Plano (basic, premium) and StatusAluno (ativo, pausado, cancelado)\n- Indexes on deletedAt, status, plano (queries de listagem)\n- Seed idempotente: 1 admin + 8 alunos com CPFs algoritmicamente válidos\n- backend package.json/tsconfig (ESM, strict, tsx for dev)\n\nRefs ADR 0005 (modelagem), 0008 (soft delete), 0003 (single admin).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6ead0aa07a0d2e2c8c5dbfa97b74a49cd25deb91","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/git/trees/6ead0aa07a0d2e2c8c5dbfa97b74a49cd25deb91"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/git/commits/2b860005429e7360852d057314813b8bfe2c4c56","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57636214?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pedro-esquerdo","id":57636214,"login":"pedro-esquerdo","no