f717fb8c5fb0860dcfbf02afd0c29000201/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-23T15:33:14Z","email":"pe.esquerdo94@gmail.com","name":"Pedro Esquerdo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-23T15:33:14Z","email":"pe.esquerdo94@gmail.com","name":"Pedro Esquerdo"},"message":"docs: register 11 pre-kickoff ADRs\n\nArchitecture decisions taken before implementation, in the format required\nby the brief (context, decision, alternatives, consequences):\n\n- 0001 stack adoption with explicit cuts\n- 0002 single-tenant architecture (remove multi-tenancy from stack-ref)\n- 0003 RBAC with 1 role, no CASL\n- 0004 JWT in httpOnly cookie\n- 0005 Aluno modeling (minimum fields + timestamps + soft delete)\n- 0006 PII handling (defense in layers)\n- 0007 CPF storage: plain text + validation + masking\n- 0008 soft delete with anonymization path\n- 0009 shared Zod schemas in packages/shared\n- 0010 explicitly cut scope (audit log, business rules, jobs, etc)\n- 0011 partial adoption of OurWayOfWork data-first philosophy\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fd8d2eefe16ca08c981c576e63461f355be7c317","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/git/trees/fd8d2eefe16ca08c981c576e63461f355be7c317"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/socium-micro-apps/client-escola-breno/git/commits/e79fbf717fb8c5fb0860dcfbf02afd0c29000201","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57636214?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-esquerdo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pedro-esquerdo","id":57636214,"login":"pedro-